  ('zcrm_1579374000148509195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129714015', 'Charlene Dickey', NULL, '10.09.2024 Charlene called to be transferred to Zion. It seems as though Zion is requesting repetitive info. She had sent in the itemized bill for her prescriptions, while she was on the phone with her processor at Zion, who stated how thorough her organized uploads were. However to later receive an email requesting an itemized statement for her prescriptions, but she had already do it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-09 17:25:27', '2024-10-09 17:25:27'),
