  ('zcrm_1579374000148494003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123644002', 'Shane Patterson', NULL, 'Since Member was turning 50 and changing to new MEC at the same time, he was facing a significant price increase.  So he elected to increase his IUA to $5000 to offset some of the costs.  I will update in A123 and notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-09 07:24:55', '2024-10-09 07:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148474033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '10/8/24: Elizabeth called. Her daughter broke her wrist and going to ER. I explained that there''s nothing she needs to do at this moment. Just to present as self pay, then after they receive a bill from the ER, give us a call back and we can walk her through how to submit it as a sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-08 17:56:42', '2024-10-08 17:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148476025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '10-8-24 UPDATE - Bruce is NOT turning 65 in Dec. He''s turning 64. So, he will remain a member with Sara as ES $2500 / $550. Patti confirmed they will keep the 2023 rates for Nov-Dec. They will be moved to the 2025 rates for the Dec. 20th billing for Jan. effective dates.  Look like that will be $633 / $2500 for SECURE HSA 2025.  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-08 16:57:21', '2024-10-08 16:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148476020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111398011', 'Max Springer', NULL, '10-8-24 Max got a new job with benefits that already began Oct. 1st. He''s going to cancel for Nov. 1st. I sent him the cancellation form with instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-08 16:50:36', '2024-10-08 16:50:36'),
