  ('zcrm_1579374000148476003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163424002', 'Kendra Campbell', NULL, '10-8-24 Kendra came to me via Mary Ellen Francescani with Middleway Wellness. She currently paying about $400 for Freedom Life with high ded and mop. She''s 56 and prefers naturopath, acupuncture, chiro, massage, etc. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She''s a former therapist and worked in hospice and palliative care. She takes supplements (I think). Discussed Care+ and HAB w/ DPC. Middleway Wellness is $140 per month but she could get $70 reimbursed per month with HAB. 2025 rates are $352/$1000 + $124 HAB w/ DPC+ $140 Middleway Wellness = $616 - $70 = $546 Total which includes cost of DPC. Or at the $2500 IUA level she saves $50 per month bringing total cost to $496. She has a super busy next two weeks bc she''s publishes a magazine. So, we scheduled a time on Oct. 22nd to reconnect after she reviews everything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-08 15:48:47', '2024-10-08 15:48:47'),
