  ('zcrm_1579374000148410016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '10-8-24 Elizabeth and Dan are both 61. They wanted to review their membership.  They do not use their HSA. She has sarcoidosis and does testing every year which seems to be shared. She will want to remain on her current membership. She''s interested in HAB and dropping the MEC. However, Patti is saying that we can''t drop the MEC until 3/5-3/20/25. UGH!!  I had quoted her $675.65+25 = $700+$165.  I will tell her we can do this in March for April 1st. Or she can add HAB in addition to what they are already paying for.  She mentioned that getting meds through Costco is excellent and saving her tons of money, even better than our Concierge can offer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-08 12:38:22', '2024-10-08 12:38:22'),
