  ('zcrm_1579374000148397026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209023', 'Neal Grateke', NULL, '10/8/24: Melinda called asking how to get some past bills paid for. Her daughter Sara and herself received bills for their well woman visits which are usually paid for 100%. The service date on the claims is 7/29/24.
Per Catherine - ARM has reserves from RCI to pay for back claims like this. 
I advised Melinda to call the providers office and have them resubmit the bills to ARM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-08 11:51:25', '2024-10-08 11:55:35'),
