  ('zcrm_1579374000148410011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, '10-8-24 Lisa is reviewing her options for when Kurt moves to Medicare for Jan. 1st, 2025.  Lisa is a Functional Medicine Health Coach. She does thermograms, labs, dental cleanings 3-4x per year, vision screenings, skin check maybe, gym $49 per yr and an app for $159, interested in nutritional health and mental health, No on shots. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She is in menopause and will check her record for anything else. She''s considering moving to Premium Care EO/$1000 $285 + HAB $107 = $392 or dropping MEC and choosing CARE+ $352/$1000 + $107 = $459 if she has any pre-x concern. She might stay put for the final 4 years before Medicare. She''s supportive of MAHA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-08 11:41:23', '2024-10-08 11:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148397021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089233002', 'Alexander Myers', NULL, '10/8/24: Shannon emailed in asking for rx coupons and listed off medication. I responded with the link to RX Quote Form, letting her know that once we receive the form a member of our concierge team will begin working on that. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-08 11:39:46', '2024-10-08 11:39:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148373078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', 'New Membership eff 1/25', 'a)	Member Only 1000 IUA – Secure with w/ARM', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-10-08 11:38:39', '2024-10-08 11:38:39');
