  ('zcrm_1579374000148397016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '10/8/24: Charlene called on the brink of a breakdown and needing a psychiatrist. She said she was close to going to ER, but not yet.  I lightly gave her the unfortunate news that the sessions with EAP would only be with a therapist and they do not manage medication, BUT offered to help in any way I could with locating someone, and advised her to still give MAP a call bc even if they don''t have a psychiatrist on staff, they could at least give her some resources. Found a few psychiatrists in her area through a simple google search and gave her some names, number to try. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-08 11:30:21', '2024-10-08 11:30:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148374098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130554030', 'Candis Davis', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-10-08 11:18:21', '2024-10-08 11:18:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148397008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '10/8/24: Quentin called letting me know that his ex wife - Betsy Green is still showing up in Zion''s database. I let him know we would put in an IT support ticket and get that taken care of. I put in ticket and alerted Julia. AM

He called right back saying that there wasn''t an option to upload docs into the Zion portal. I explained that on the home screen there is a separate place where he can upload supporting docs after the sharing request is created. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-08 11:15:58', '2024-10-08 11:17:00'),
