  ('zcrm_1579374000148320033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139074004', 'Pietro Simonetti', NULL, '10-7-24 Pietro got a new job with benefits and wants to cancel for Nov. 1st. I''m inquiring about the best process to do so.  UPDATE - He can try to call the # on his card or support@americaschoicehealthplan.com to request cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 19:58:01', '2024-10-07 20:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148242044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '10.07.2024 Jennifer called and LVM.
Skin Cancer Check Concerns:
- Kelly went to dermatology biopsy $1700~ mainly LabCorp
- Jennifer went to dermatology biopsy $508~ mainly LabCorp

Needed guidance on how to get covered/shared. We discussed sharing requests to open tomorrow with Zion, as well as searching for a gastroenterologist for Kelly''s esophagus and preventive colonoscopy. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-07 16:52:16', '2024-10-07 17:21:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148242036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103044020', 'William Pelkey', NULL, '10.07.2024 William called surprised that his membership, shows up as cancelled at the doctor''s office.
I looked him up in Admin123, and it shows cancelled there as well. Furthermore, it may be due to his payment not going through.
NEW Email: max4pelkey@gmail.com
Did not know that his membership was cancelled. It may be due to the previous email (the one we have on file) that got hacked.
I told him that our administration will be in touch with him tomorrow, as it is a list bill. He is interested in reinstating it, but does not know how much it would cost. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-07 16:09:21', '2024-10-07 16:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148323003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '10.07.24:  Recvd. an email from Thomas on 9/26.24. He recvd. our email re: changing his MEC. He wants to know if he should make any changes concerning the new plan options. I apologized for the delay in responding to him due to Hurricane Helene causing internet access failure. I told him we should discuss the new options which may better suit his needs and asked when he would be available for a meeting.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-10-07 16:02:34', '2024-10-07 16:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148320028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '10-7-24 Maurine had a nightmare of a time trying to find  a Dr. in the PHCS network who would call her back to set an appt for wellness. After wasting 4 hrs she gave up and decided on Carolina Vogel DO out of UCSF Health. I looked up the hospital and Dr. and discover they will bill to Multi-Plan/PHCS. She will provide her Planstin card and knows to ask for ONLY items that will be coded as a preventive screening and nothing more to avoid paying for any portion of the visit. She will do that. Paying for HAB on top of that isn''t worth it since she can''t drop Planstin bc she''s in CA and needs ACA compliance. All set and will also ask for bills from her ER visit to get that ball rolling ASAP. She know of the 6 month deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 15:37:50', '2024-10-07 15:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148242031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131712002', 'Grant Zabielski', NULL, '10.07.2024 Milynn called wondering if a breast pump would be covered. I did not think so, but she said that she spoke to a representative, which was not clear with what entity (MPB/Planstin....etc), and they told her that it would be covered. That conversation, she shared, earlier this year.
Milynn was about to board a plane, so she did not have enough time to chat and it was noisy. I told her I will need to do a little more investigating on this, and email her the findings. In the end, she was a bit more solid on who she may have spoken to, and said she thinks it was Planstin.
I will call Planstin to learn if indeed the breast pump is considered preventive and will be covered by them. I will then email Milynn what they shared with me. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-07 15:36:10', '2024-10-07 15:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148320023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '10-7-24 I left a vm calling Liz back regarding questions about her sons membership. His name is Reid Collins and it looks like he never joined properly with MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 15:07:52', '2024-10-07 15:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148320018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '10-7-24 Christine called to discuss wellness needs that she has. She wants to do mammo, skin check, hear scan, etc. She spoke with some Concierge Team member around Sept. 30th but I don''t see any notes. I will wait for her returned call now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 15:04:12', '2024-10-07 15:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148318018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '10/7/24: Angela called needing assistance with a bunch of bills. She wanted to know how to submit for reimbursement. 
Her bills included:
Chiropractor, supplements, lab work, health coaching, CT scan, dr visits related to a heart issue. 
I educated Angela on the major aspects of her plan and what types of services they will pay for or not pay for bc it seems like she is not clear on how it works.
We discussed Planstin, Zion Medical Cost Sharing, IUAs, CirrusMD, Member Guidelines, How to Open a Sharing Request, Eligible Expenses. 
Angela requested a written email with the details we discussed today as well as a link to Zion Guidelines for her to review. I went ahead and sent guidelines and will put together an email for her tomorrow. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-07 15:00:25', '2024-10-07 15:00:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148320008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152572016', 'Emily Cope', NULL, '10-7-24 Emily is 32 and has a son 1 and daughter 4 years old. She came via Laura Zaunbrecher. She made too much money last year to get a subsidy. She wound up paying $16K to have her son. Although, I suspect it was half of that for one person''s ded/mop. She does their wellness visits, immunizations, labs, dental, vision, gym but not mental health, not nutrition and none of the high cost wellness since she''s still young. So, she''s excited about CARE+ possibly on its own and is fine paying for wellness visits cash pay. Will ponder HAB but likely skip that part. She''s taking a med for acne and her daughter use an inhaler only when she''s sick. No tobacco or smoking.  She''s only paying $330 now with a $500+ APTC. She qualified once she had her son about 1 year ago since it''s a family of 3 now. But, she''s very nervous having the $18K mop and super high ded. She''s willing to pay more per month to protect against that. I quoted her Care+ $1000 EC $1000/$461 for 2025 or $2500/$364 and $125/$25. She''s thinking to join for Jan. 1st. She wants to review C4 plans. We set a time early Nov. to review those options and to compare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 14:56:13', '2024-10-07 14:56:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148318008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108421001', 'Tara Dobson', NULL, '10/7/24: Tara''s father called. She is in the hospital and he is wondering what she should do for the bills. I explained that they don''t need to do anything right now - but after she get out and receives a bill to call us back and we can walk her through the process. 
I informed Paul how Tara can access her member portal, what to submit, and shared Zion phone number. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-07 14:54:07', '2024-10-07 14:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148286250', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130572022', 'bassam salman', NULL, '10/7/2024
member is inactive according to admin123(membership canceled)', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-07 14:48:31', '2024-10-07 14:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148320003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353075', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '10-7-24 Michele and her husband need to enroll for Nov. 1st C4 plans. She uploaded her Cobra letter into the documents showing the Life Change Event. The system is also asking for Financial Information. I recommended that she uploads the same Cobra doc to that online requirement to see if that solves the need for any more docs. We got her 2 kids removed from the platform with the help of Salina from C4.  I think their names are Haley and Callie that we got removed. They are both filing their own taxes as single independent tax payers. Ref # from the call is CAS-49961-F2D5L2.  We then put Michele and Derek''s income at $68,337 as a safe bet with rental income at $46,337. Michele''s 1099 Part-Time income is estimated at $22K.  We have to wait 24-48 hours for her account to be updated and ready to move forward. So, we have a meeting for Wed. to choose a new plan for Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-07 14:40:55', '2024-10-07 14:40:55'),
