  ('zcrm_1579374000148194031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, '10/7/24: Brittany called in asking why she was billed $700 for routine bloodwork when her plan is supposed to cover all preventive. I explained that her MEC pays for the services listed under ACA guidelines, and there are 2 reasons why she might have received a bill - Either the test isn''t listed on ACA or it was coded incorrectly. I emailed her ACA link and offered to connect her with Planstin. She said she would call them later. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-07 08:55:11', '2024-10-07 08:55:11'),
