  ('zcrm_1579374000148098072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '10/4/24: Charlene called. She''s temporarily in a new location and wondering where she can go to get a flu and covid shot. I advised she can either get them at an in-network provider or at a participating pharmacy - but just make sure the pharmacy sends the claim to the claims address on back of Planstin card instead of running it though pharmacy discount. Searched pharmacies in her area and sent a screenshot of what is available. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-04 13:52:54', '2024-10-04 13:52:54'),
