  ('zcrm_1579374000147976081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '10.03.2024 Julia requested that I help with Cheryl''s preventive billing situation with her OBGYN, by calling her MEC company, Planstin and decipher the billing that may have been processed.
