  ('zcrm_1579374000147976066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085050002', 'Matthew Claycomb', NULL, '10.03.2024 Matthew has a prescription to be refilled, and was not sure what his options are. I recommended he start with telehealth, and I''ll send him the RX request form, to help him save money. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-03 15:07:50', '2024-10-03 15:07:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147989044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146688012', 'Joey Zheng', NULL, '10/3/24: Joey returned our call. I informed him that he should have a member certificate from Zion in his email that he can provide his school. He was able to pull it up and will send it to them. Hopefully this suffices. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-03 15:04:38', '2024-10-03 15:04:38'),
