  ('zcrm_1579374000147989039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '10/3/24: IT resolved the issue with Esther''s MPB member portal. It was a simple fix within a123. Sent email letting him know the issue is resolved and provided link to portal and credentials. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-03 15:00:39', '2024-10-03 15:00:39'),
