  ('zcrm_1579374000147989019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146087021', 'Jane Kim', NULL, '10/3/24: Jane called, asking if she told us some codes from PCP if we could tell if they are covered. I explained that I can''t from my end, but her MEC administrator can and gave her the number to ARM. She asked if a bone density scan is covered - it is, according to ACA if a woman is over a certain age or gone through menopause. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-03 14:34:54', '2024-10-03 14:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148017003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '10.03.24 - Cheryl called stating she received a bill for $300.00, for her pap smear. But it is applied towards her deductible. Additionally, she is receiving bills from Quest Diagnostic for some diagnostic services. She is sending the bills for us to take a look at and compare with Planstin as to why it was covered. 

Notified her that the reason her bills may not have been covered is due to diagnostic coding or they may not have been billed to Planstin. Forwarded the bills to Nahla to see w/Planstin what is going on. Will update Cheryl tomorrow.

