  ('zcrm_1579374000147996005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3885 Question : I just have a quick question on how to work with Zion healthshare. If I have a need that I''ve submitted, but then they close it. How do I add additional bills if it''s kind of an ongoing need?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-10-03 12:52:52', '2024-10-03 12:52:52'),
