  ('zcrm_1579374000147976041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146489002', 'Anna Nadasdy', NULL, '10.03.2024 Spoke with Anna, and we discussed the present facts on her RX request for Lo Loestrin Fe, and the possible alternatives that could save her money in the long run.
I introduced her to MyFreePharmacy and sent her, via Outlook, an email with additional resources.

"Such a pleasure speaking with you. 
Here is the information that I found:
-Comparison to equivalent medicine: https://www.drugs.com/compare/levonorgestrel-vs-lo-loestrin-fe
-Healthcare.GOV information: https://www.healthcare.gov/coverage/birth-control-benefits/
-My Free Pharmacy Site: https://myfreepharmacy.com/
-Plan options Screenshot 
-My Free Pharmacy Screen Shot:

Birth control benefits and reproductive health care options in the Health Insurance Marketplace®
Learn about birth control benefits at Healthcare.gov. Read about the many health care services available at the Health Insurance Marketplace®.
www.healthcare.gov

Anna, please let me know if this is moving you in the right direction, and if not, I''d be glad to shift gears with you. Remember to discuss the comparison with a medical professional to get confirmation that it is indeed parallel in function and aid, to the initial medication requested.

Talk to you soon!


Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969

* Disclaimer *

This email is intended solely to provide supplementary information to our valued members and is not a personal point of contact.

If you have additional questions or concerns, please call the Concierge at 1-800-519-2969."             NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-03 12:39:45', '2024-10-03 12:39:45'),
