  ('zcrm_1579374000147989003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146688012', 'Joey Zheng', NULL, '10/3/24: Called Zion to ask if they can provide adequate info to Joey''s school. Eden informed me that in these scenarios, Zion will issue a Member Certificate, but if the school still doesn''t believe that meets their regulations, he may still need to purchase the insurance they are requiring. 
