  ('zcrm_1579374000147897008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', NULL, '10.02.2024 Finally reconnected with Lisa today to go over her membership usage and possibly some reparations on her actions in the last year. 

THE CONCIERGE is guiding her through the following:
-Opening a sharing request with Zion for that ER visit and uploading ALL docs pertaining it.
-Zion so far has been (Abby) receptive and understanding, most likely will make an exception to missing that 6 month deadline, given the life events that unraveled for Lisa and her daughter.
-Maneuvering her membership via services she needs and resources we can share with her. 

Via Julia: Ashley is becoming involved due to Planstin being Zion''s TPA, and to mold this situation from both ends.

Encouraged the sales team with information to kick off their introduction to her:
-Her schedule makes it challenging to get her on the phone
-SUGGESTION: FROM AN Advisor''s lens > call first and LVM if you don''t catch her, letting her know who you and why.
-Then email her as well, so she has it on file to refer to visually....
-Try to aim to set up a time for her to carve out of her calendar to chat with you.

Lisa is in a better state of mind on her membership, and has a more conducive handle on how to use her services, as of today.         NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-02 12:31:33', '2024-10-02 14:39:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147897003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '10.02.2024 Jennifer called in to learn of any updates regarding ARM covering her preventive appointments. I earlier learned that this was an outstanding situation, being attended to by Angee, who was waiting to speak with Jennifer, after leaving her a VM yesterday.
