  ('zcrm_1579374000147759123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147720058', 'Kaleb Fehr', NULL, '10/1/24: Miah called asking if there is a waiting period for getting pregnant and the pregnancy being shareable. I double checked Zion''s guidelines, and confirmed with her that as long as she didn''t conceive prior to her start date, then the maternity request is shareable. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-01 16:52:00', '2024-10-01 16:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122571002', 'Andrew Thomson', NULL, '10/1/24: Andrew called unable to access member portal, he does not recall using forgot password feature - he tried while we were on the phone and never received an email. Let him know I would put in an IT support ticket and update him via email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-01 16:22:50', '2024-10-01 16:22:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '10/1/24: Spoke to Lori about Jennifer''s pediatrician not accepting ARM plan bc it is "practitioner and ancillary" instead of "PPO".
Lori from ARM offered to allow Jennifer to submit her claims for reimbursement if the provider is unwilling to bill. She stated that after speaking to the provider - Cooks is going to bill her cash price moving forward, and if that''s the case then ARM paying 125% or even up to 150% of medicare reimbursements rates would most likely cover her visits at 100%. 
Called Jennifer to explain this to her and give her options moving forward. LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-01 16:21:37', '2024-10-01 16:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '10/1/24: Michelle called, saying she''s getting a colonoscopy soon and doesn''t have her new MEC card. I let her know she should have a digital version in her email. She was able to find it bit doesn''t understand why it lists a copay on there. I wasn''t sure since not all the cards list co-pays but said it wouldn''t matter for her preventive services since they are covered at 100%. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-01 15:36:39', '2024-10-01 15:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '10/1/24: Macay called. He needs to take child to urgent care and wanted to make sure he just goes and presents as self pay. I replied yes, and that if the expenses go above $1000, then he can begin submitting bills as a sharing request. He asked if we could point him to a better urgent care clinic. I said unfortunately no, we don''t have a list of best urgent care clinics however if he needs help finding a specialist, we can assist with that. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-01 15:34:19', '2024-10-01 15:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147792008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', NULL, 'Sent Zach an email to determine interest.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-10-01 14:57:26', '2024-10-01 14:57:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146489002', 'Anna Nadasdy', NULL, '10.01.2024 Anna put in an RX Request for Lo Loestrin Fe - 10 mcg - 90 days (3 months 84 days).
When I searched the medicine, the prices were showing up in the $500 and above.
I reached out to our international shopper, but he cannot source it, and domestically for them was $800.
I called Anna at the number she provided in the request, and left a detailed message asking her to call back, and why I have not clipped a coupon yet. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-01 14:49:12', '2024-10-01 14:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109518002', 'Elisa Kammeyer', NULL, '10.01.2024 Jordan called requesting to see a mental provider, referred to her by a friend. I guided her to the MSEAP program, and coached her to:
1- Call the number 8005435080
2- Introduce herself so they can find her
3- Ask if the doctor in mind is on their list
4- ...if not, ask how to get the doctor nominated.

She had 10 minutes left before they closed, so I told her to call me back if she has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-01 14:24:01', '2024-10-01 14:24:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, '10.01.2024 Provider called to confirm membership. Accent was very heavy and hard to understand. Offered minimal information (effective membership date and cancellation date) and had to let her go. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-01 14:14:54', '2024-10-01 14:14:54'),
