Jerry called and explained that the M&amp;P counseling sessions are not enough for one of his children and that their mental health is worsening by the day. Unfortunately, Zion will not cover suicide attempts unless they have one year of continuous membership and he started in July, I told him I would try to find other alternatives for this situation and call him back(10/2/2024 called him back lvm )', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-01 10:02:07', '2024-10-02 14:55:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147759008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '10.01.2024 Hilary called trying to help get her kids the supplements prescribed by the doctor. She was unable to, and called FullScript for help. They referred her to MPB to have the restrictions removed on: 
1- Ortho Mega Molecular product by ohm.
2- Apex Bilemin - Apex Energetics (sp?)

I reached out to admin to learn more and assist Hilary-  I think it''s Michale''s wife.
**********************************************************************************
After speaking to FullScript, they explained that there are certain supplements/products they have that have access restrictions on them, and the ones that Hilary mentioned to me were on that list.
Depending on the person sourcing the plan, Okubo with MPB for us, that is who will have to send a recommendation in to FullScript in order to allow the member to make the purchase for said brands.
According to FullScript, AO today 10.01.2024 MPB has access to Apex Energetics brand but not Ortho...etc
Also, FullScript said that the plan that MPB hold right now, through Okubo, DOES NOT offer the service to extend a recommendation to FullScript, to allow the members to purchase the restricted supplements. 
The representative on line was planning to send me and Okubo@mympb.com the information to extend our plan to have that service. I have not received anything yet. It''s been 40 minutes.   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-01 09:58:49', '2024-10-01 14:41:59'),
