  ('zcrm_1579374000147626036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147520081', 'Lisa McCann', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-30 11:28:41', '2024-09-30 11:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147609021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '9/30/24: Brittany called asking what labs are covered with MEC and if second visit where doctor reads labs are covered. I explained that a lipid panel and diabetes screening is part of the aca guidelines. As for the second visit, typically a provider will email results to you. If another visit is scheduled due to an elevated blood test, then it would be diagnostic and not preventive. 
I asked member if she needed assistance finding a PCP. She asked for a list of drs in network which I emailed her. 
Also sent link and instructions for searching PHCS to husband''s email on file with a doc detailing what is covered and how to navigate visit. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-30 11:28:22', '2024-09-30 11:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147626031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147087070', 'Bansari Patal', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-30 11:03:15', '2024-09-30 11:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147608025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295146', 'Keith Marshall', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that over this past weekend he was in the hospital and had a stint put in.  he showed the MPB card to the hospital and was told by them that he only had Preventative benefits.  I told him that was not true and explained the needs process and how to present.  Also, that he owed the hospital $2500.  He will call Sedera to get the process started.  Member also has new email address, I will send him Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-30 10:42:58', '2024-09-30 10:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147681003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123074010', 'Caleb Vogtner', NULL, '09.30.2024 Caleb called to see if he had any dental benefits. I assured him he does not, but enlightened him on a product companion that some advisors are selling side by side to the MPB membership, Health Access Benefits, that would offer additional preventive including dental and vision. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-30 10:40:30', '2024-09-30 10:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147626021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130291011', 'Matthew Waldron', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule welcome call due to an emergency. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-30 10:35:11', '2024-09-30 10:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147609008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133662010', 'Elizabeth Cornish', NULL, '9/30/24: Elizabeth LVM needing to know next steps for sharing request. I went over how she can pay her IUA and how to open member portal. Advised she speak to Zion about upcoming procedure on Wednesday to see if they can reach out to provider about bill. Trans over to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-30 10:27:01', '2024-09-30 10:27:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147608017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145266002', 'Gerald Ackerman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation for an effective of 10/24 (prior to start).  I will process &amp; refund all monies collected.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-30 08:18:07', '2024-09-30 08:18:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147608012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117567010', 'Shane Dilley', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request eff 10/24 due to getting married.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-30 08:06:09', '2024-09-30 08:06:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147626008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147520065', 'Zachary Asatani', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of November 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Also changed email on file as per member request. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-30 07:36:35', '2024-09-30 07:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147609003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101025002', 'Michael Merritt', NULL, '9/30/24: Michael called to ask if cologuard is covered. I answered yes, to simply use planstin card for billing. Mike is going to order it through his physician. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-30 07:17:37', '2024-09-30 07:17:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111775010', 'Xiaosong Xiao', NULL, '9/27/24: Member and I have been emailing back and forth about 2 sharing requests he submitted to Zion. He hasn''t heard back from them and now it appears that one of the requests has dissappeared from his member portal. It seems like Xiaosong is not understanding his plan and how this all works, and since this has been dragging on for some time, I suggested member submit a PHI form to Zion to allow me/MPB to speak to them about his requests. 
I learned from Zion that his first request only shows proof of a $300 payment in Nicaragua instead of the details member submitted which was  - hospital stay, stroke, 2 MRIs and more.
The second request is a $2200 statement that is mostly preventive services. 

I left a message for Zion processor to ask if there is anyway they can assist in acquiring his statement from Nicaragua and emailed member back asking if he can locate the statement or bills from that visit. 
I informed him that the second request should be submitted to Planstin and to present his planstin card for billing in the future for preventive visits. Let him know I would reach out to planstin on Monday and see how to move forward with that bill.

Will touch base again on Monday with Planstin, Zion and Xiaosong. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 15:13:50', '2024-09-27 15:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129714015', 'Charlene Dickey', NULL, '9/27/24: Charlene called. She''s in Zion portal submitting a sharing request and wondering whether she should choose "bill" or "itemized statement" for her docs. I advised that "bill" would be an invoice she has not paid and "statement" would be a receipt. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 14:25:51', '2024-09-27 14:25:51'),
