  ('zcrm_1579374000147519068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'I received an email from Sedera saying that this member needed to be cancelled eff 10/1 since he was going on his employers Select + plan.  I emailed back letting them know that I would cancel him, but I would need a Cancellation Request form from him.  I reached out to the member and asked him about this and he said that he did not want his membership cancelled, that he was unemployed.  Spoke with Kristen from Sedera and she said that she would send the to her team to investgate.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-27 12:20:00', '2024-09-27 12:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147528093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146981018', 'Jeffry Beberwyck', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-27 11:10:27', '2024-09-27 11:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147537025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144387001', 'Penny Black', NULL, '09.27.2024 Called Penny back, per Acelyn''s request, from this morning.
Penny is trying to get her COVID Shot at Walgreens, but after speaking with Acelyn, I deliver the information Acelyn gathered to Penny that CitizensRX/ARM does not have a contract with CVS nor Walgreens.
I explained to her how to get her shots covered, per the ARM''s representative last week, members need the pharmacy to code the shots as preventive in order to be covered 100%. Otherwise the pharmacist was correct, when they told Penny that she needs to get her shots at the doctor''s office.
Penny and I also discussed her RX Request for Progesterone. In her request, she wrote it out just as the script shows to her, and there it says Progesterone Micro. HOWEVER, that is in a jar NOT capsule, as her request also says, and it does not come in 100mg or 200mg. Penny is looking into that part and will email me back what she learns, b/c AO now, I cannot find her a coupon with THOSE DETAILS, and neither can she. 
Penny called back sharing she was able to attain a 90 day supply of progesterone for only $55, which is a great deal. They ended up taking the word micro out, to proceed with fulfilling the script. Penny also, was able to get her covid booster shot at HEB (same place where she got her script), for no charge. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-27 11:03:42', '2024-09-27 11:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '9/27/24: Juan called requesting his 1095 form. I gained his permission to send via email and let him know we can send it at the latest Monday. Requested from Kelly and asked to be cc''d. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 11:03:19', '2024-09-27 11:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147537014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '09.27.2024 Ryan had a head injury, went to ER: Xrays were performed. Staples were put in. He went to the Urgent Care to get staples taken out, paid $100. 
They sent her the bill, after she presented as cash pay patient ($4906), and Prompt pay (an additional 40% off).
Presently Susan only had the regular bill of $9800. She will speak to Sedera after me, and request to open a medical need. I recommended that she turn the bills into pdf forms in order to submit them onto the medical need. I direct transferred her to Sedera. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-27 10:54:27', '2024-09-27 11:02:48');
