  ('zcrm_1579374000147452145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '9/27/24: Nancy called. She''s having a hard time scheduling an appointment bc the provider is telling her that Planstin does not pay for an annual wellness visit. We 3-way called the drs office and I assured them that planstin does indeed cover this - it''s the number 1 service our member''s use their planstin MEC for - so as long as the visit is coded correctly, it is fine. The providers office was then accommodating and allowed Nancy to make an appointment. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 10:24:27', '2024-09-27 10:24:27'),
