  ('zcrm_1579374000147452135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '9/27/24: Quentin called needing a little more assistance submitting his preventive bills. I guided him to his member portal and advised on how to begin process and to make sure he chooses preventive sharing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 07:27:11', '2024-09-27 07:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141579037', 'Dianne Pallaise', NULL, '9/27/24: Diane called. She''s receiving benefits from her job starting Oct 1 and wants to cancel with us. I let her know that it wouldn''t actually cancel until Nov 1, but showed her how to access the cancellation. Notified her of deadline to make changes - 19th. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-27 07:18:49', '2024-09-27 07:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147479041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '09.26.2024 Esther called in again, on behalf of her son Caedmon. He hurt his wrist, and she believes it''ll need to be xray''d.
I walked her through presenting as a cash pay patient, and holding onto that receipt in case in the future, she might need to open a sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-26 17:41:21', '2024-09-26 17:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147479036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354169', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '09.26.2024 Daniel called wanting to know how to get his covid and flu vaccines under his coverage. I explained, per Planstin''s recommendation, that it is better to have them done with the physician to get billed coded preventive and covered 100%. However, to ask the pharmacy if they are able to bill Planstin via preventive coding, for that to happen. Otherwise, make an apt with a pcp.
He does not have a pcp, so I generated a list from the Multiplan link and emailed it via outlook, along with other preventive resources and cash pay options for blood work. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-26 17:13:24', '2024-09-26 17:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147479031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '09.26.2024 Kara went in for a mammogram08.07.2024. Then received an EOB, claim # , We did a 3-way call with Planstin, and Carmen picked up. Two bills showed up for Carmen at Planstin, one over $200 and the other for over$400,  $675 was the total amount billed. Processed 09.05.2024, according to what Carmen was seeing, and she shares that she is NOT seeing that the patient has any responsibilities at this point. She does have an EOB showing those details and ask Kara if she could provide the fax # for the facility. She also explained to Kara that sometimes the facilities bill at different times and the EOB, and she went ahead and emailed Kara the details showing that she does not have any responsibilities. Kara in turn will email it to the facility if need be. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-26 15:49:06', '2024-09-26 15:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147479026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '09.26.2024 Maurine has been trying to get a PCP established, but she called over 12 of the ones sent to her via MultiPlan Link, and none of them are either taking patients or want up front payment.
I told her since she''s still on Planstin to please go see the doctor and directed her to DIRECT them that She has insurance coverage through the ACA guidelines and to please send the claims to "this address" from the card or at least call the 888-920-7526 number.
Maurine will proceed in that fashion to at least establish a physician, just in case she gets sick, like she did a few months ago with strep.
I also forwarded her the email pertaining information about changing the MEC TPA .She filled out the form to be eff 12/1. I will reach out to Wendy, and gave Maurine Wendy''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-26 15:29:16', '2024-09-26 15:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '9/26/24: Verified with Planstin that Quentin had preventive sharing though Zion up until next month. Called member back and advised him to open a preventive sharing request for the appointments he had asap as there is a 6 month deadlines as to when he can submit bills. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-26 14:14:20', '2024-09-26 14:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147452114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779423', 'Lela Glick', NULL, '9/26/24: Lela called wondering if her payment would be a partial one for October. I stated no, her payment is as usual for October (which was processed a few days ago) and that would be her last payment, since Medicare will begin 11/1. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-26 13:39:07', '2024-09-26 13:39:07'),
