  ('zcrm_1579374000147479021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '09.26.2024 Nance called to get guidance on how to proceed with her preventive appointments for her and her husband. We went over the MEC change and what she needs to do prior to January. I forwarded her the email that was sent out (TWICE at this point), cause she could not find it in her inbox. 
