  ('zcrm_1579374000147452043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, '9/26/24: Member LVM with questions about getting her husband set up on account. 
Called her back. She wanted to make sure we could differentiate between her husband''s bills and hers. I said yes, no problem bc any statement would include his name and he is indeed part of this plan. 
She asked if her dental and vision can be submitted. I let her know that dental and vision is not part of her MPB plan, but sometimes advisors can sell that in addition to if she''s interested.
Suchada doesn''t have her MPB card - getting Kelly to send a new one.
She asked how to schedule a session with a therapist. I provided her with MSEAP number and instructions on scheduling a session.
We discussed Preventive Care, that flu and covid vaccines are covered 100% as well as annual wellness visit and cholesterol and diabetes testing.
