  ('zcrm_1579374000147298081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067616017', 'James Schorie', NULL, '9/24/24: James called asking how to start a sharing request. He was in the hospital for 5 days with congestive heart failure and has already paid $1300 towards the issue. I educated him on how to open his member portal, submitting itemized receipts and statements and transferred to Zion to open portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 17:51:56', '2024-09-24 17:51:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136920019', 'Francesca Thornley', NULL, '9/24/24: Francesca called. She''s trying to use Planstin card for daughter''s prescription, but it''s being denied bc her daughter Madeleine is listed as a male. Since the medication is for an inhaler, I advised that she wouldn''t use the MEC card for this type of medication anyway, and offered to find her a coupon. She said she would cover this one, but next time will let us find best price.
