  ('zcrm_1579374000147298071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '9/24/24: Risa LVM requesting new cards. I attempted to call her back with no luck, but went ahead and requested new cards from Kelly and Planstin. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 16:54:37', '2024-09-24 16:54:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133662010', 'Elizabeth Cornish', NULL, '9/24/24: Elizabeth called. She is in the hospital and wondering what to do. I explained that there is no need to do anything right now except present as a self pay patient and once she receives the bill, to give us a call back and we can walk her through how to submit it for sharing. Reminded her of 6 month deadline, and we discussed how Zion gives out payments. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 16:44:37', '2024-09-24 16:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '9/24/24: Jennifer called back. She spoke to her provider who told her they do not accept her insurance (ARM) and asked if this will be a problem. I advised that it shouldn''t be - that the MEC Vendors use the same network. She said the provider said they are very familiar with these types of plans and have no contract with them. I reiterated that the contract shouldn''t be with the TPA, but instead with multiplan. Her provider - Cook Children''s is listed in the PHCS network. 
I assured Jennifer that when we send her claim to ARM, we will also clarify the network question for the future and let her know via email. Took down the number for provider just in case:
682-885-1790 (main line), 817-335-3255 (office).
Once I receive the claim, I''ll forward to ARM and ask about future billing for member. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 16:39:51', '2024-09-24 16:39:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147315008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', NULL, '9-14-24 Waheed responded saying he thought he had already filled out the form back in Jan. which I thought as well. He filled it out again just now. I''ll ask Patti and Karina to help with resolving this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-24 15:54:50', '2024-10-02 15:57:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '9/24/24: Reisa called back saying that in her member portal, none of her family members are listed and needs to speak to Zion directly. Gave her number again and transferred. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 15:51:42', '2024-09-24 15:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105087002', 'Paul Snyder', NULL, '9/24/24: Ellyn called about the MEC changeover, asking if each member of her family needed to sign the form. I advised no - just the primary member and it would count towards the entire membership. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 15:45:17', '2024-09-24 15:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147298046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111535002', 'Michael Furi', NULL, '9/24/24: Michael called to open a preventive sharing request. I advised on how to submit the request through Zion. He''s going to check if he already has a login and begin the process. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 15:32:15', '2024-09-24 15:32:15'),
