  ('zcrm_1579374000147298036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '9/24/24: Jayne called wanting to add a person to her plan. It was a child who is over 26. She remembered being able to add them as an employee under a list bill previously. I advised they would either need their own plan or to speak to her advisor about enrolling as a company and transferred to Kirk. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-24 14:52:50', '2024-09-24 14:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147315003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', NULL, '9-24-24 I just discovered Waheed was never moved to my account since the first of the year. He''s asking more  questions.   I responded as follows.
