  ('zcrm_1579374000147180006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130717010', 'Dalton Fisher', NULL, '09.23.2024 Sarah called back to double check on when she can restart her sessions again with her therapist "Mears". I briefly shared what we at the concierge know to be the general timeline (non CA states), 4 sessions with two months in between. 
