  ('zcrm_1579374000147104043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '9/23/24: Julia informed me that ARM will pay for this type of claim instance and to have Jennifer ask the provider to resubmit the bill to ARM and provide MPB with the bill so we can forward it on her behalf. Reached out to Jennifer and left a detailed message with all of this info and asking her to give us a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 12:02:37', '2024-09-23 12:02:37'),
