  ('zcrm_1579374000147109018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '9/23/24: Jennifer called. Her dr submitted a claim to RCI in August for her daughter''s well child visits and immunizations. RCI kicked back the bill, and member says their website is down, mailbox full and not answering calls. I let Jennifer know that I would look into this and get back to her today or tomorrow morning. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 11:23:04', '2024-09-23 11:23:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147141022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132038008', 'Sabine Werner', NULL, '09.23.2024 Sabine called not feeling well with Covid. Wanted to learn how to proceed to be cared for. She does not have any MEC in her membership, and no DPC. But she does have a PCP she''s been attending.
I recommended she start with telehealth, CirrusMD, and if need be then attempt an urgent appointment with her PCP. 
She also wanted to know how to get reimbursed for her visit screening with her OBGYN, but her membership on preventive is very minimal. For Zion to share her woman wellness visit/cervical screening, it needs to get done during the annual physical with the PCP.
I recommended that she open a preventive sharing request with Zion, and let them make that determination by submitting the screening bill from the OBGYN. 
Sabine will do just one thing today, as she is not feeling well. She will attempt Zion and the preventive sharing request another day. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-23 11:21:32', '2024-09-23 13:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147104028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '9/23/24: Cheryl called, not super happy about the Concierge service. She said she called a couple weeks ago trying to see if diabetes medication and supplies offered through MyFreePharmacy would be worth the monthly subscription, and that the "Concierge Manager" (who is a man) was going to send a list of medications covered. 
Then she was irritated that I wasn''t aware of what she was talking about saying that no one here knows anything about what the other person is doing. 
I offered to look through the list of offered medications at MyFreePharmacy and give her a call back later today with an update. 
Took screenshots of available Diabetes medication and supplies and sent via email as well as a link for Cheryl to look up meds herself. Zoho shows that she opened the email. Called to follow up - left a detailed message. 

Turns out the "concierge manager" Cheryl referred to was simply Leo who showed her how to look up medications via MyFreePharmacy.
On Sept 3rd, Cheryl called asking what''s better about her new plan versus her old plan and Acelyn transferred her over to Leo to help explain the differences, but then they discussed the Diabetes medication and supplies. Cheryl was not explaining the details of her last conversation as it actually happened.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 11:04:37', '2024-09-24 10:58:41'),
