  ('zcrm_1579374000147117031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147087070', 'Bansari Patal', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-23 10:45:31', '2024-09-23 10:45:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147117026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122227001', 'Mary Jane Morris', NULL, 'Member called in and asked for her "card" to present to her daughters college.  Since she only has Care + she would not get a card and would most likely not satisfy the college requirements.  She will be reaching out to Zac as she misunderstood what was purchased.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-23 10:43:31', '2024-09-23 10:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147128033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146762002', 'Daniel Wonders', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-23 10:42:17', '2024-09-23 10:42:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147104023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712208', 'Earl Walker', NULL, '9/23/24: Barbara called to check and see if she has telehealth. I let her know that yes, she has access to Cirrus MD with her plan and guided her on how to access them through the browser or app. She was able to log in and said she will download app for the future. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 10:32:38', '2024-09-23 10:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147128023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146888458', 'Adilene Silva', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-23 10:32:24', '2024-09-23 10:32:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147141008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '09.23.2024 New plan starts in October.
Needed a bit of education on plan, now that it has changed a bit.
Explained where his preventive is coming from - HAB.
Tried to access his MPB Portal, but his credentials did not work. Putting in a ticket to IT.
He needs to open a sharing request with Zion, so we did a 3-way call with Amber. There he was able to ask his questions regarding his girlfriend''s addition, and how the Up Front payment towards a procedure. Amber explained to offer a good faith estimate through the sharing request, and fulfill the IUA, it will go through the determination process, within two weeks to make a determination, if eligible - Zion offers a virtual credit card to pay the provider, but AFTER he fulfills the IUA.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-23 10:24:34', '2024-09-23 10:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147109013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115200014', 'Michael Ebeling', NULL, '9/23/24: Tracey called asking if her husband can go to any lab to have cholesterol checked. I advised her to use Multiplan website to check and see if lab she wants to go to is in the PHCS network, and then present ARM card for billing. Emailed link to site and told her to call us back if she has any issues. We also briefly discussed the types of labs that her MEC will pay for. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 10:19:27', '2024-09-23 10:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147141003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, '09.23.2024 Faviola called on behalf of her son regarding the MAP program. I walked her to our MPB.Health page for all the resources then to the MAP registration link, and gave her OUR CODE - MAP. Offered her a mini orientation to the site, and briefly explained the process, including the 6 sessions total per year in CA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-23 10:18:02', '2024-09-23 10:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147117021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142370033', 'Michael Llerandi', NULL, 'Member called in as his pmt declined.  I will send out link to update pmt. UPDATE Member submitted update method of pmt I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-23 10:17:29', '2024-09-23 11:59:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147117016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146993002', 'Nicholas Weston', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-23 10:12:27', '2024-09-23 10:12:27'),
