  ('zcrm_1579374000147104018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085050002', 'Matthew Claycomb', NULL, '9/23/24: Member requested ID numbers and new MPB cards be mailed to them. I emailed Matthew their MPB ID numbers and let them know that new cards are on the way to the address they have on file. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 08:19:55', '2024-09-23 08:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add ARM MEC eff 10/24 due to the fact that his children lost their preventative coverage and need it now.  I have processed.  No notification to Planstin needed because member is on MEC only.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-23 08:16:14', '2024-09-23 08:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147104008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '9/23/24: Esther sent a message in requesting HCBB access code. Emailed her back the code plus instructions for how to use. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 08:02:45', '2024-09-23 08:02:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000147109003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062151025', 'Diana Lim', NULL, '9/23/24: Nadi from Planstin called and said that this member is showing with different membership Tiers for Zion portion versus MEC.
Zion portion is showing as Employee + Child, and MEC is showing as Employee + Spouse.
The MEC portion should also show Employee + Child .... or as we put it - Member + Family.
I gave Planstin the correct info and put in an IT support ticket for us to correct on the next file transfer that goes out. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-23 08:00:42', '2024-09-23 08:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146914219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '09.20.2024 Esther called back trying to access her MPB Portal page, but her credentials are not working. Our passcodes usually have aONE capital letter, and it looks like it is missing from the passcode generated for her.
Also - according to Admin123, her profile shows that she has the Care+ membership, confirming the title in the CRM platform, HOWEVER in the details of the CRM platform it shares that she has a MEC portion with Planstin.
When I put in a ticket for the passcode, I also mentioned that part to be cleaned up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 17:51:36', '2024-09-20 17:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146914206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701002', 'Bruce Appino', NULL, '09.20.2024 Bruce called trying to get access to MPB Portal. We had to leave the site he was on and start all over again. His credential worked and I encouraged him NOT to change his passcode. He asked again about getting his vaccine, and I re-established for him, as of today, we learned that the easiest way to get covered 100% for that vaccine is to get it done through the provider/pcp. 
He shared he either has a prescription or will get one from his doctor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 17:02:46', '2024-09-20 17:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146914201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141070002', 'Jerry Barnwell', NULL, '09.20.2024 Jerry called on behalf of his daughter Karis, who needed to get set up on CirrusMD. I sent her a registration link directly to her email, cause she is above age. She received it while I was still on the phone with Jerry, and he said he will help her get set up from here. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 16:52:54', '2024-09-20 16:52:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146914196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144387001', 'Penny Black', NULL, '09.20.2024 Penny put in an RX Request on the 18th that I have not been able to find anything on. Not that it was expensive, but that it may have been entered wrong on the form. Nothing is coming up in what she requested. I called her TODAY and LVM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 15:44:29', '2024-09-20 15:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146914191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, '09.20.2024 Jeff called wondering how to get covered for his annual physical he had with an out of network doctor. We went over the difference between Planstin and ARM, and the RBP model, and the difference how they both practice THAT. It was getting to a point that Jeff was going to eat that bill, and he was not expecting that.
We went ahead and did a 3-way call, with a shot in the dark, to see if they would cover this time only, given  he is barely new to using ARM, and was still used to the OLD ways using Planstin. Monica at ARM, was gracious to agree to getting him covered and requested he send the super bill with all the details and provider''s tax information to Kait@altrisk.com. 
After that phone call, Jeff asked about getting a colonoscopy and has called twice to get an appointment, but no one is getting back to him. He asked if we assist with that. I told him that service is still in talks but not set in place with a procedure. I told him, given that time of the day, lets revisit this next week to see what we can do as a first time experience in helping with making an appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 15:23:28', '2024-09-20 15:23:28'),
