  ('zcrm_1579374000146914163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, '09.20.2024  An OBGYN  facility called to confirm that Heba is indeed a patient with benefits. I generally explained the benefits of this membership, including there''s a coPay of $50 for a specialist visit 3/year. I asked if they received or provided them with the ARM card It turns out they did not. So I called the Alhallak family to guide them. I made sure they had their ARM card for the appointment. -Learned they need their address changed. We attempted to change it over the phone, but the form was being updated. It appears he did get his form in, and Patti processed it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-20 11:30:25', '2024-09-20 17:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146976003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '09.20.24 - Spoke to Daniel (IT) &amp; Karina that confirmed that even though we have been collecting the MS $ for the membership, Planstin does not have Meghan Grabow on the invoice since 01.01.24. Karina will bring this up to Patti and possibly (Ashley - Planstin) to see if the member can be backdated to 01.01.24 given that we provide proof of verification. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-09-20 11:14:51', '2024-09-20 11:14:51'),
