  ('zcrm_1579374000146906008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '9/20/24: Tina called asking how to present at dr appt with husband. I advised to present as self pay. Tina thinks that this issue will end up going over their IUA. I educated Tina on how to present, what to collect from dr office and how to submit a sharing request. Transferred to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-20 08:30:40', '2024-09-20 08:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146906003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '9/20/24: Meghan called saying she never received cards from MPB when she signed up and needs to go to the doctor. What she really needed was to access her telehealth. I attempted to register her but got the error message "No records found". Sent a support ticket to Cirrus and advised Meghan to keep an eye on her email - that they are quick to resolve these issues. 
