  ('zcrm_1579374000146783003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '09.18.24 Wendy reached out to let us know that Matt is still unable to obtain his vaccine event through the ARM card was sent to him on Monday 09.16.24). Upon reaching out to ARM, they did not intergrade the file with CitizensRX until yesterday. Our team has tried to reach out to him to follow up and let him know, but he was unresponsive (hung up). Wendy reached out again, after hours stating that unless Matt can get the requested services, he is requesting a refund. Per Nahlas notes below, he was once again unresponsive to our efforts to follow up and let him know but unfortunately his requested pharmacy was unable to accomodate him.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-09-19 07:16:49', '2024-09-19 07:16:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146741021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '09.18.2024 After reaching out to Citizens RX via emailing Kaitlen & Ccing Julia, as well as calling Vanesa, I learned that Matt is indeed integrated successfully. Vanesa called me back, had me share some details to find him in the system (Mbr ID, Bday, Eff start date), and she did.
Then she called the pharmacy at City Market in Aspen CO, for them to tell her that they are short staffed tonight, and that Matt will have to go in tomorrow (WHEN HIS TRIP IS SUPPOSED TO TAKE PLACE), to get his vaccine, OR CHOOSE a different pharmacy who can offer him the vaccine.
I called Matt instantly to let him know the good news, but it went to VM. I left him a general VM and to call back for the details. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-18 16:54:00', '2024-09-18 17:00:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146744018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171052', 'Bailey Johnson', NULL, '9-18-24 Hi Wendy, 

