  ('zcrm_1579374000146736008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '9/18/24: Carey called in for Nahla about getting vaccinations at pharmacy covered by planstin. She was given incorrect info by someone at planstin regarding this - that if member received vaccine at pharmacy, it would not be covered. To avoid any misinterpretation, I brought Caitlyn from Planstin into the call.
Caitlyn advised that pharmacies are wired to use the prescription discount instead of sending claims directly to planstin and that''s why it''s best to go to a provider instead. However, if the pharmacy sends the claim directly to planstin using the claims address on the card, then they will pay it 100%.
Carey is going to call her pharmacy (Safeway) and ask if they are willing to bill planstin (instead of using RX Bin number) for the covid and flu vaccine. Her other option would be to find a different provider who has the vaccines in stock. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-18 14:35:16', '2024-09-18 14:35:16'),
