  ('zcrm_1579374000146715063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036377153', 'William Moomaw', NULL, '9-18-24 Matt called to see if there are any new good options bc he keeps getting messages about new plans via text or email. I looked up his account and he''s on CARE+ MO $2500/$185. I let him know his rate will only increase to $205/$2500 for 2025. He will likely stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-18 13:46:25', '2024-09-18 13:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146676143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127155017', 'Michael Couris', NULL, '9/18/24: Michael called asking if he needs to do anything regarding the new MEC vendor changeover. I replied no, just acknowledge that you would understand it''s changing. But it looks like they''ve already done so according to note above. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-18 13:42:21', '2024-09-18 13:42:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146708118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140980002', 'Bryan White', NULL, 'Received CC info form Wendy for this member and billed member for the August &amp; September/24 payments due to enrollment error.  Next payment set for 9/20.  Will be waiving the 7/24 payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-18 12:29:58', '2024-09-18 12:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146649039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, '09.18.2024 Deanna called to verify if she indeed should be receiving an ARM preventive card. I looked up her profile to learn that she has Planstin. I told her that change for September 1st, which is what she mentioned, was aimed for those members with a different MEC plan, RCI. She proceeded to share another part of the email/letter she received, saying "...those with Planstin MEC are welcome to change...". I explained, that it is recommended that members with HER MEC are strongly urged to change by November or December to ARM, otherwise they lose their MEC by January.
I requested the email/change form via Teams Chat. Kelly offered to send me the email, so I can forward it to Deanna. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-18 12:00:55', '2024-09-18 12:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146676138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '9/18/24: Jillian called asking if she states that her husband has had injections before in his sharing request, will that affect the request with Zion. I advised that it wouldn''t make a difference. Zion will look back into his records to see if this might be a pre-ex condition. However, I don''t think it''s relevant to offer up the info especially if it was over 2 years ago. (got injections in 2020)
She asked if gum surgery is shareable. I said according to Zion guidelines - oral issues are shareable if it''s related to an accident or injury, and without knowing the full details of the issue, there''s no way I could give her an accurate answer - advised her to speak to Zion about it. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-18 11:57:24', '2024-09-18 11:57:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146708113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, 'Member called in asking questions about the change to the ARM MEC.  She told me she lives in MA and wanted other options.  I advised that to be compliant she would have to stay with the Secure membership.  She wants to start eff 1/1/25.
