  ('zcrm_1579374000146715053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140980002', 'Bryan White', NULL, '9-16-24 Not sure where my notes went for Bryan. But, Patti and team discovered that he entered List Bill for his payment and he was never billed. He owes July, Aug. and Sept. with Oct. to be billed in 2 days. He thought WWSRA paid as a group. I just confirmed that they pay individually.  Karina approved waiving the month of July. Bryan agreed to pay Aug. and Sept. and Oct to be billed in 2 days. He provided his cc information which I provided to Patti. I let him know of the 3% per month processing fee. But, the cc is a WWSRA card, so he wasn''t concerned. Patti will get his account up to speed and he will be good to go moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-18 11:50:18', '2024-09-18 11:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146649028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097264002', 'Marilyn Negley', NULL, '09.18.2024 for Joshua, son, ambulance involved, X-rays taken. July 13th. She''s received lots of bills that are unpaid/unshared, as she shares.
I asked her what the visit was for and what was entailed. 
It was an emergency for Joshua, who needed an ambulance, x-rays on July13th, 2024, and Marilyn wanted to see how to get all the bills paid. It sounded like she has not opened a sharing request, so we did a 3-way call with Zion, and spoke with Isabella. Isabella sent her the invitation link to open that member portal with them to her husband''s email, where she will retrieve it, when he gets back home.
I sent her the MPB Change form so she can add her email, and be able to receive any correspondences from any of the entities in her membership. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-18 11:43:02', '2024-09-18 11:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146649023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '09.18.2024 Carey emailed again. Sharing that the information I offered her did not play out as I guided her it would. Subjects at play here are: Pharmacies, PCP, OptumRX Vs. PlanstinRX.

I called Planstin to verify the information she said they provided her, to be on the same page, prior to calling/emailing her back (at this point, I prefer the phone call to be more clear in delivering the information).
I luckily got Caitlyn and she specified the following information for vaccination coverage:
1- If done via provider = covered 100%
2- If done via pharmacy visit = covered via discount - NOT 100%.

Simultaneously, for Carey''s membership that has not change since October 1st of 2023, she should still be able to use OptumRX. Unsure why the pharmacy and the provider gave her the run around on getting vaccinations. 

I attempted a 3-way call back to Carey with Caitlyn on the line, to better clarify the entire process as a team, but Carey did not answer. I left her a detailed message to call back and move forward. I will not be responding to the lengthy email with misinformation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-18 11:26:13', '2024-09-18 11:48:45'),
