  ('zcrm_1579374000146676123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '9/18/24: Jodi called with questions about some preventive bills and upcoming appointments. There was some initial confusion about how to present and at her wellness checkup, she presented as self pay. Then after our conversation in April, she had the bills resubmitted but it seems like one was sent to Redirect which she hasn''t had since 2022. I advised her to have the lab bill resubmitted to Planstin, and to call Planstin about the wellness visit and see if they have a claim on file since she wasn''t sure who it went to. 
