  ('zcrm_1579374000146676073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '9/17/24: Valerie submitted RX request but under dosage info, asked MPB to call doctor to obtain correct dosage.  I sent Valerie the following email:
Hi Valerie,

We received your RX quote request, and noticed that you indicated for MPB to contact the doctor''s office to confirm the dosage for your prescription. Due to HIPPA compliance, we’re unable to make that call on your behalf.

