  ('zcrm_1579374000146676018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144777002', 'Thomas Newton', NULL, '9/17/24: Thomas called. He''s getting a CT scan and wanted to know how to approach the appt to best use his benefits. I advised him to present as cash pay and save an itemized receipt for the visit as well as any other service or prescription related to his issue and that it can all go towards IUA. We discussed 6 month deadline as well. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-17 12:25:09', '2024-09-17 12:25:09'),
