  ('zcrm_1579374000146647021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137191001', 'Carol Cheh', NULL, '9-17-24 Spoke with Carol again about her possible new dental plan vs her current discount plan. The new plan is quoting around $550 for a new crown and if she chooses  a Porcelain + Noble Metal Crown 1Dental is estimating about $558. If it''s not with the metal crown then 1Dental gives a 20% discount. I told her to find a dentist she wants and ask them what she would pay with either network or with the dental ins. She will work on that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-17 10:53:07', '2024-09-17 10:53:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146647016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '9-17-24 Roseann called back. She spoke with a different person at Health Images and now they quoted her $432, not $1700!  They will accept her card. She will move forward now. All is well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-17 10:38:13', '2024-09-17 10:38:13'),
