  ('zcrm_1579374000146642016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, 'called regarding mammogram coverage. It seems like there aren''t many faculties in her area that are in the phcs network so i talked about planstin RBP (I advised that facility must agree to this)', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-09-17 10:05:35', '2024-09-17 10:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146647008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '9-17-24 Roseann called bc she''s going in for a mammogram tomorrow and they are estimating it will be $1700!  She wants to know how to submit it. I called and talked with her. Acelyn gave her the Multi-Plan network list to look up a provider but she didn''t find anything on her own. I look up mammograms as a service and found 18 locally. I sent her the list to review. I let her know mammograms tend to run around $300-$500, $600 worst case. I let her know an MRI or Ultrasound won''t be covered by Planstin. She confirmed that might be what the dr. ordered. But, I told her to call the dr. and find out what was ordered and pick one of the places I sent her in the list and confirm they are definitely in-network and what the cost will be. She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-17 10:02:31', '2024-09-17 10:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146624018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146505011', 'Kathleen Clarke', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-17 09:34:32', '2024-09-17 09:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146625008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '09.17.2024 Florie Gusman called and LVM. I returned her call @ 10:23am, and she wanted help with logging into:
