  ('zcrm_1579374000146625003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '09.17.2024 Lynn called to help Ava and Timothy get set up on their telehealth services. I attempted to register them, but they already were registered. I sent them both the following and Cc''d Acelyn:
