  ('zcrm_1579374000146592051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '9-16-24 James doesn''t know what bills were submitted since he''d given up on HMA and cancelled his payment. He couldn''t even find a way to cancel his account without just calling his bank. He thinks his account was around $800 when he cancelled. But, HMA is saying they''ve approved two bills. I think one was around $99 and the other small as well. Jeff Kanter inquired and they told him they approved two bills as well for urology and a pathology lab. So, Jeff said he''d inquire again. I''ll away Jeff''s response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-16 16:16:22', '2024-09-16 16:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146592046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '9-16-24 Darrin called me back and I let him know of the $25 price difference in what I quoted him bc he loses grandfathered pricing. But, I also let him know the new 2025 pricing is only a $2 increase. So, he''s ok with it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-16 15:53:27', '2024-09-16 15:53:27'),
