  ('zcrm_1579374000146592031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '9-16-24 I left a vm for Jennah to let her know there''s a 6 month waiting period for colonoscopies beginning as of Oct. 1st! I wanted to let her know ASAP since she mentioned she''s planning to do one in October.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-16 15:50:51', '2024-09-16 15:50:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146584050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '09.16.2024 Esther called to get educated on how to proceed to seeing her PCP. She is looking to get a referral for a derm appt. I told her that her membership does not require it, but the derm might, so she might want to start there. 
