  ('zcrm_1579374000146584045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, '09.16.2024 Dawn called wondering about the new insurance company and where her card is. I tried checking the outlook emails, but there were too many to keep Dawn waiting to see if it was sent to her. I checked the CRM emails, and saw nothing there. I told her I would bring it to the administration''s attention, this is common and they have a procedure for it.
