  ('zcrm_1579374000146584040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128798002', 'Isaac Yoshimori', NULL, '09.16.2024 Reached out via Outlook again, asking to get signed up with CirrusMD. I attempted to register him, but it notified me that he already is registered. So I responded to his email letting him know that, and all he needs to do is reset his passcode. I gave him options on how he could use CirrusMD as well (Laptop or App). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-16 14:56:36', '2024-09-16 14:56:36'),
