  ('zcrm_1579374000146592026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '9-16-24 After talking with Patti, Darrin is forced onto the new pricing which is $350 for CARE+ and $107 HAB which is $457.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-16 14:18:54', '2024-09-16 14:18:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146592018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '9-16-24 Krista inquired about her new rate. I had assumed $50 for Planstin would drop off of her $375 to equal $325. But, Patti corrected me since the SECURE HSA memberships are considered as a new enrollment with Zion so it''s the new rate of $350 + $107 = $457. I also let her know the new rate for 2025 is $352, so only a $2 increase. She handled the bad news well thankfully!  She inquired about pricing of covid shots and found them for $138 and $150+ on GoodRX. I told her to call MPB Concierge for help with best pricing and location locally. She will call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-16 14:09:38', '2024-09-16 14:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146529038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145372007', 'Amy Kopf', NULL, '9/16/24: Amy called saying she got a vm about scheduling a welcome call but does not see anything in her email. I resent the link to and provided her with a bit of an overview of her plan since she called it her "Health Access Plan". She seemed a little confused about who her plan was with - Health Access, Zion or MPB so I clarified the structure of her purchase. We were disconnected though. Called back and LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-16 13:59:50', '2024-09-16 13:59:50'),
