  ('zcrm_1579374000146529028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624002', 'Robin Foss', NULL, '9/16/24: Robin called to check and see if her Dermatologist is in network - Camelback Dermatology. While I couldn''t find the facility name in the multiplan search, several doctors came up. Offered to email results, but Robin was following along and could see the results on her end. 
