  ('zcrm_1579374000146584027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701035', 'Kathleen Williams', NULL, '09.16.2024 $480 so far in bills The visit to the ER started 09.07.2024, admitted to hospital on 8th, discharged on the 11th, and now they are doing follow.
