  ('zcrm_1579374000146536046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108616009', 'Kevin Kakos', NULL, 'Member called in after hours &amp; left vm.  When I spoke to him he told me that his wife had gotten a mammogram and they were told that they did not have coverage at that time.  I contacted Planstin and they told me that the provider referred to his wife as "Peggy" so they were unsure.  I let the member know that they are active.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-16 11:37:47', '2024-09-16 11:37:47'),
