  ('zcrm_1579374000146584011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141240002', 'Michael Greene', NULL, '09.16.2024 Mike called to double check if where he wants to go to get a colonoscopy screening done is in network and if not, can he proceed, or does he need to change it. He wants to go there, b/c he went there last time (5 Years ago). Carlisle Digestive Disease Associate is where he wants to go for Colon and it is in two weeks. 
I called ARM and spoke with Karin who confirmed that the PROVIDER is who needs to stay in the network, unless they want to practice the RBP model with the 50 miles factor. Not the facilities or hospitals, just the providers and ancillaries. Called Mike back and lvm with the above clarification from Karin at ARM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-16 11:05:08', '2024-09-16 12:09:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146587024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146314001', 'Anton Lamasan', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of October 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-16 10:44:38', '2024-09-16 10:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146587008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139647002', 'Yoselin Duran', NULL, 'Spoke to member''s husband Saul (Which is not on plan) directed him for his wife Yoselin to fill out permission to discuss form on our website. Sent email to reschedule online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-16 10:38:30', '2024-09-16 10:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146529023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140542002', 'Julie Lehn', NULL, '9/16/24: Julie called asking for her member ID to log into app and if she has mail order pharmacy benefit included in her plan. She also asked if we have resources for helping find a better price covid vaccine. I recommended her local pharmacies. Costco charges $140. Unfortunately, I could not give her a better resource other than possibly using local health department. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-16 10:33:09', '2024-09-16 10:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146584003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135674002', 'Michael Ilardo', NULL, '09.16.2024 Spoke about ER and how to proceed. He''s having what might feel like a visit to the ER is necessary.  Did not do Teleheath, but did speak to close friend who is the head of the ER staff at a hospital, and given professional guidance. I guided him to not worry about opening anything, until he knows where he stands financially, SHOULD he go to the ER, but do keep the IUA and the 6 month deadline in mind, as well as organizing all necessary documents to upload, if he get there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-16 10:23:25', '2024-09-16 10:24:43'),
