  ('zcrm_1579374000146529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106724002', 'Stacy Cassidy', NULL, '9/16/24: Stacey called with a few questions about an issue she''s been having and how to approach the new sharing request. 
For a number of years she''s had pain inside her thigh and leg cramps. Had an xray which didn''t show anything other unusual and was prescribed physical therapy. The therapy is not alleviating the sharp pain and she wants to have an MRI and possibly change phys therapists to someone who can do more techniques. Wanted to know if she needs a dr order to do both?
I advised that while I am not a medical prof, I know that Zion only shares costs of services that are prescribed by a licensed physician and related to the issue of the request, so she would need them to prescribe the MRI, but as for changing therapist, I''m not sure and to ask Zion directly.
We discussed the phase in period for pre-ex, how Zion will share costs, and types of statements Zion requires. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-16 07:56:08', '2024-09-16 07:56:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146536013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135434002', 'Michael Castaldo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 10/24 citing Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-16 07:45:21', '2024-09-16 07:45:21'),
