  ('zcrm_1579374000146529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '9/16/24: Mary Ellen called with a few questions:
1. Her Health Access Benefit. I advised her to circle back to Wendy about that as it''s not an element of her MPB plan.
2. Can she get a reimbursement for DPC payments? Possibly, if they are part of an open sharing request. 
3. Is there a way to partner with MPB to funnel some of her patients to enroll with MPB. Again, this is advisor territory. I explained that if her patients include in their enrollment that she referred them, she can get a referral fee, and that she could potentially funnel them directly to Wendy, but to talk to her about that. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-16 07:17:44', '2024-09-16 07:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146422226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124104002', 'Sherwin Miguel', NULL, '09.13.2024 Briana called and LVM. Called her back to learn they are pregnant and want to know how to proceed. They have not had their initial visit, but will after speaking with us. They located their opened Zion Member Portal, so once they have their initial visit, they will start their maternity sharing request with Zion. I explained the IUA, 6 month deadline, saving all receipts, uploading the treatment plan and receipts and bills in a timely manner. Shared that Zion might even share supplements, and practice upfront payments to the facility that sells the maternity experience via packaging. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-13 18:03:00', '2024-09-13 18:03:00'),
