  ('zcrm_1579374000146422213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659263', 'Julie Sombrio', NULL, '09.13.2024 Julie called to learn how to proceed to go see a specialist, cardiologist. She wanted to know how to get shared or bill or any steps she is not aware of. Julie openly shared she experiences heavy anxiety, and this could be just that, but she wanted to make sure. I simply explained that as long as it is not a wellness visit under the ACA guidelines, it will be a cash pay visit. I walked her through the process, and options of scenarios. Julie was receptive and ready to move forward with her appointment with the cardiologist. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-13 16:29:31', '2024-09-13 16:29:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146440148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001409011', 'Karen Frame', NULL, '9-13-24 Karen was inquiring about dental but her dentist doesn''t accept insurance and is out of network for everything. I shared the Spirit Dental but the math still didn''t make sense with only a 15% discount in the first year. She has a cracked/broken tooth and wants cleanings and such. She wants to keep her dentist. So, she''ll ask for a discount instead and see if that works.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-13 16:25:14', '2024-09-13 16:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146461260', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110878002', 'Kenneth Huffman Jr', NULL, 'called for assistance for his member portal', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-09-13 14:27:31', '2024-09-13 14:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146440140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '9-13-24 Darrin is choosing to drop MEC and change from SECURE to CARE+ for October 1st. Care+  $325 and HAB $107 = $432. He completed the Change Form and enrolled in HAB. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-13 14:15:31', '2024-09-16 14:16:30'),
