  ('zcrm_1579374000146496262', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135534002', 'Kendall Keil', NULL, '9/13/24: Sheree called to collect info about next steps for her husbands upcoming surgery. He''s having a deviated septum fixed. I advised her to collect any receipts, itemized statements and a good faith estimate for surgery and submit sharing request. Gave her general instructions on how it works. Paying IUA, timeline etc and transferred to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-13 13:37:22', '2024-09-13 13:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146496257', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127235001', 'Pamela March', NULL, '9/13/24: Kiana from St. Charles Health called to check a claims status for Anthony March. I let her know that Anthony aged out of the plan with MPB in July. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-13 13:33:36', '2024-09-13 13:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146425063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130140011', 'Abe Degnan', NULL, 'Christine reached out on Abe''s behalf asking for a call. One of the members on his list bill (Ender, Philip) accidently enrolled as MF instead of MS in December ''23. The company is asking for a refund on the MF membership. 

Gathering all the necessary paperwork to showcase that the invoices have been sent out and that the member made these decisions during the enrollment process. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-09-13 13:33:25', '2024-09-13 13:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146496249', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079754001', 'Catherine Engelman', NULL, 'Member will be submitting a cancellation eff 10/24 as she will now be added to Quentin Greens membership.  Planstin notified via spreadsheet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-13 13:21:38', '2024-09-13 13:21:38'),
