  ('zcrm_1579374000146422208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144687055', 'Brian Tigelaar', NULL, '09.13.2024 Brian called needing to get a tetanus shot, cz he stepped on a rusty screw. Wanted to know if it is covered. It is indeed under the ACA, and I shared that information with him from the Healthcare.GOV site. I gave him guidance on how to proceed and to give us a call if he still has questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-13 11:16:05', '2024-09-13 11:16:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146440107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '9-13-24 Quentin is going to choose CARE+ and possibly HAB. He''s not sure if he would use enough to make HAB worth it. However, he''s now asking about adding his domestic partner to his membership. With her on the membership, I think they will choose to add the wellness. So, $350 for him or $615 for both of them + $107 or $165 = $780. She is only paying $350 right now. She''s 61. Perhaps she''s getting a subsidy. She doesn''t have any pre-x. She has had spots on skin removed and all tested as benign. I shared the pre-x clause with Quentin and sent the video and supporting written overview to get her up to speed. We need to complete the Change Form that Patti sent and simply type in the membership he''s choosing. Then we will have to complete the Change Form to add a Spouse. He will not have to pay the enrollment fees this way either. Patti will process it in the background. Quentin will review it with his partner and call me early next week to finalize.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-13 11:15:22', '2024-09-13 11:15:22'),
