  ('zcrm_1579374000146496193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118537002', 'Laina Kenyon', NULL, '9/13/24: Laina emailed in: I am trying to login to the member portal and it’s telling me there is no account associated with my email and member ID, despite the fact I have used this same email since enrollment. I tried resetting my password and it kept giving me that message. Please advise. 

