  ('zcrm_1579374000146496117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, 'Member called in asking for pricing if he were to remove dependents from membership.  They both have employment.  I gave him pricing and let him know of the 1/25 Zion price increase and of the Changover to the ARM MEC.  Member wanted to avoid lots of time spent on the phone so I will send him Change Link &amp; Change to New MEC link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-13 10:01:06', '2024-09-13 10:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146496112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144687055', 'Brian Tigelaar', NULL, '9/13/24: Brian called needing to go to urgent care clinic and asked if there is a preferred list. I advised no, there is no network and that he is presenting as a self pay patient for this visit. But let him know there is a network associated with his MEC. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-13 09:56:10', '2024-09-13 09:56:10'),
