  ('zcrm_1579374000146496074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109086008', 'Kuljit Rajania', NULL, '9/13/24: Kuljit called with questions about her prescription coverage. Previously she was able to get the med NP Thyroid with a $10 copay. I explained that her MEC gives some discounts for medications but it''s not a lot unless it''s a preventive drug, and that we the concierge can search best price for her but it''s not going to be in the $10 range for that specific med. I emailed member rx quote request form and asked if she would allow us to perform a more thourough price search to get the costs down for her. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-13 09:19:44', '2024-09-13 09:19:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146440102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '9-13-24 Jennika requested her HAB start date be moved to Oct. 1st.   They have honored the request for 10-1-24. All set. She wants to do a colonoscopy soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-13 09:18:16', '2024-09-13 09:18:16'),
