  ('zcrm_1579374000146496011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-13 08:00:12', '2024-09-13 08:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146461230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562027', 'Sarah Verretta', NULL, 'lvm and sent email regarding rx request (per her advisor satiating she needed assistance)', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-09-13 07:26:52', '2024-09-13 07:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146486066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135674002', 'Michael Ilardo', NULL, '09.12.2024 Michael called to learn how to proceed after taking his son to Urgent Care. I explained the three major parts to his plan, gave him options to pay for situations like this, and guided him on how to organize his papers per specific situations and patient. Lastly I let him know what we would need to do if the bills get too large. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-12 17:14:38', '2024-09-12 17:14:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146486061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128798002', 'Isaac Yoshimori', NULL, '09.12.2024 Isaac emailed me requesting savings on his refills. I sent him the form. He responded asking if he can use the PCP he has, who is not in the network or what are his options. I shared with him the option to either use his present PCP under the RBP model with Planstin, OR try the telehealth route, with CirrusMD and asked him to let me know if he needs assistance registering with them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-12 16:59:03', '2024-09-12 16:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146486056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146467002', 'Meegan Oldani', NULL, '09.12.2024 Called Meegan to confirm Scott''s bday due to a duplication in Admin123. She confirmed it to be 05.05.1973, and I changed it here in the CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-12 16:46:20', '2024-09-12 16:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146486051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109378024', 'Lorie Somermeyer', NULL, '09.12.2024 Lorie called to get guidance on how to proceed to her Mammogram Preventive Apt today. I walked her through it, and offered her what to expect and made sure she had the Planstin card, by calling Planstin, Nedi sent it virtually and physically. I also sent her the details on extra lab work via email in Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-12 16:08:27', '2024-09-12 16:08:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146486043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '09.12.2024 Carey still wanted options to getting her vaccines WITH HER PCP without needing to wait for her preventive annual physical. I spoke with Nedi at Planstin, she educated me on PlanstinRX and I sent Carey the following:
"You''re always welcome Carey ?.
Well, the visit with the doctor would not be considered preventive, therefore it will need to be a cash-pay visit (possibly pay for it via HSA account, if in your possession). However, the vaccines attained during that cash-pay visit would be covered, via the ACA guidelines.
Your other option is to go to call PlanstinRX: 435-893-7735, so they can arm you with a list of pharmacies who are capable of billing medically. That way it can reach Planstin through a preventive lens, and be covered.
PlanstinRX is fairly a new approach so here are some steps to follow:
- Call 435-893-7735
- Stay on the line and it will connect you with an agent
- When you reach someone, be sure to state your request in the following fashion:
          * "I''d like a list of pharmacies who can bill medically, in order to get my vaccines there." 
          * "I''d like to get my vaccines at a pharmacy, what do I need to do to be sure to get covered?"
I hope these extra details are helpful, please do not hesitate to contact me back if you have any questions." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-12 15:49:42', '2024-09-12 15:50:43'),
