  ('zcrm_1579374000146446031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123074010', 'Caleb Vogtner', NULL, '09.11.2024 Caleb had a preventive appointment on 07/22 for a bill of $830.80. He was not sure why it was not covered completely. He also was not sure what exactly was the blood work for. He added that he is very confused about his membership and does not know how to use it. 
I took the time to break down the membership for him in 3 major parts, and their sub-parts, and that took some time, as he added questions in between. 
After reinforcing his membership details, we did a 3-way call with Planstin and spoke with Caitlyn. We were hoping to learn two things:
1- What were the labs he got tested for?
2- Why were they not covered 100%?
Caitlyn explained that what it looked like, was that some of the labs were not considered preventive. Something I could not see on my end. 

Caleb was receptive and asked important questions. He took notes down while we were speaking, but he might be a member who would require additional explanations and guidance. I made sure to strongly encourage him to make us his first stop. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-11 14:05:43', '2024-09-11 15:44:21'),
