  ('zcrm_1579374000146440021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '9-11-24 Krista shared her experience with Glenn Streeter for healing her knee. It didn''t work at all and he leaned on her to be his therapist. He kept calling her and dumping his own personal stuff onto her. She was pissed for a while and is over it now. He even made her pay the $75 for express shipping which she didn''t need. I won''t refer him to anyone again, especially from afar.  She heard about HAP from Angelika and wanted to review her membership. She''s not funding an HSA right now, so ok with removing Planstin since it''s been a pain. She is happy to join HAP for Oct. 1st. She will use mammo, bone density, labs, skin check, dental, vision, gym and immunizations.  She chose to drop Planstin $50 and add HAP for $107 for Oct. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-11 12:58:16', '2024-09-11 12:58:16'),
