  ('zcrm_1579374000146446013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141790002', 'Olivia Scott', NULL, '09.11.2024 Olivia wanted guidance on how to set up and attend a preventive appointment through ARM. I guided her to present her card, and instruct them to call ARM in order to bill, and that this insurance company will pay 100%, via the ACA guidelines.
*****************************************************
Olivia ended up calling back saying that the providers office, although in the PHCS network, does not bill ARM, after Olivia offered them their information.
I coached in a manner to give them more of a direction, versus inquiry, to bill the company as they WILL pay for the appointment as long as they are under the PHCS network.
Olivia felt more confident at the end of the 2nd call, and said she will call back if she has more questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-11 12:32:22', '2024-09-11 12:51:00'),
