  ('zcrm_1579374000146440016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137191001', 'Carol Cheh', NULL, '9-11-24 Carol moved to NJ to help her parents. She''s looking for a new job and she''s getting a large APTC now through C4 with her income at $40K for 2024. She''s only paying $68 per month right now. So, I recommended that she calls a local broker/agent to help her find an ACA plan to get a sizable APTC again. I also explained it''s best to cancel C4 first and then cancel directly with Cigna next after she''s set up for a new plan moving forward. She didn''t realize her plan won''t work well in NJ bc everything will be out of network. MCS is too expensive for her right now even though it''s portable. She may have a new job with benefits soon as well, although you never know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-11 11:47:31', '2024-09-11 11:47:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146391086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074270001', 'Istvan Guba', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 10/24.  Member enrolling in Accent360 (Primary Partners)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-11 11:45:58', '2024-09-11 11:45:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146391081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130955002', 'Laurie Boehk', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 10/24 due to receiving Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-11 11:39:52', '2024-09-11 11:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146440011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068353075', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '9-11-24 Michele and Derek now have some pre-x, so MCS isn''t good for them anymore. Derek''s Cobra from Medtronics runs out Oct. 31st.  She will upload his Cobra letter into their account per my instructions.  They are paying $530 now for family of 3. Their daughter will be going onto her own plan moving forward.  Derek turned 63 in June and Michele is 58. Derek has Type 2 diabetes and takes meds, no insulin. He takes metformin HCS 500 mg, Jardiance 25 mg, Rybelsus 14 mg, lisinopril 10 mg, atorvastatin 20 mg. Michele has high blood pressure and needs annual MRI''s bc of atypical hyperplasia. She takes amlodipine besylate 5 mg, olmesartan medoxomil 40 mg,  tamoxifen 5mg (cuts in half bc only offer 10 mg).  They want Dr. Patrick Finnegan, Dr. Barbara Depriest, Dr. Victoria Reiser, Dr. Mabel Mardones, Dr. Kate Weniger (willing to give up Kate since she''s never seen her yet).  They want to go to UCH and Rose Medical. They have limited income bc Derek is retired but they have multiple rental properties. Her best guess before talking with her CPA is $68K MAGI for 2024. She will get back to me on this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-11 11:29:24', '2024-09-11 11:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146403063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143564002', 'Jessey Baytes', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card. Verified address. Sent over info to Julia about no records found with CirrusMD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-09-11 11:21:25', '2024-09-11 11:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146446008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130567002', 'Savannah Lewis', NULL, '09.11.2024 Savannah called on behalf of Trevor. His knee is completely swollen and happened overnight. She wanted to know how they can use their MPB benefits to seek care from medical professionals, most likely to go to the ER.
I explained the process, and coached her on what to say, and made sure she was aware of the most two important elements:
IUA
6 month deadline to submit the bills
We briefly went over preX conditions, but she does not think this is preX. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-11 10:41:08', '2024-09-11 10:41:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146391076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135712001', 'Courtney Meckley', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 10/24 due to getting employer coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-11 10:33:48', '2024-09-11 10:33:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146446003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128574001', 'Courtney Caroland', NULL, '09.11.2024 Courtney called to learn how to submit a bill for a child wellness via Zion preventive sharing request. Grace from Zion sent Courtney an invitation link to her email to set up her member portal to open any sharing requests. 
