Grace also recommended to upload any documents/appointments that were had from June1st and on, given that ended their 6 month preventive waiting period. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-11 10:29:44', '2024-09-11 10:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146442008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105086010', 'Ben Rego', NULL, 'Ben would like to schedule his physical and is having a hard time finding providers in his area who would have an appointment this year. Would like to go Urgent Care to get this done. Sent him the template (Preventive Care & HSA) for additional information, instructed to ask for a preventive screening visit as mandated by the ACA. Will also send the membership handbook to explain the plan benefits. Also, will ask Planstin if they would be open to RBF with the Urgent care. Will provide the information to Ben once I obtain it. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-09-11 10:27:43', '2024-09-11 10:27:43'),
