  ('zcrm_1579374000146371058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082596001', 'Karin Leister', NULL, '9/10/24: Karin called to check the status of her IUA debacle. According to teams conversation, Patti sent a screenshot of correct IUA and is waiting to hear back. 
