  ('zcrm_1579374000146371053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141698002', 'Brenda Ritch', NULL, '9/10/24: Brenda called in needing help accessing member portal. What she really needed is to submit an RX quote request. Guided her to form and emailed credentials for member portal for her records. 
Medication was very expensive - Odactra. Coupons were all over $300. Emailed Reid to obtain international prices.
Called member back to discuss options and that I would let her know the international price but it most likely wouldn''t be under $100.
She''s going to discuss other options with her doctor bc previously, she was paying $25 for the medication. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 17:52:24', '2024-09-10 17:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, '9/10/24: Kathleen called asking if she could schedule her annual well woman visit this month since she had once last November. I advised that she can - Planstin does not go back and look at the dates for these appts, they simply make sure it''s coded correctly and process. 
She then wanted an overview of her plan. We discussed: When to use Zion, how to present for emergency or diagnostic care, IUAs, no more than 3 IUAs in a 12 month rolling period, how Zion pays, Common things paid for with Planstin MEC, Alternative care, Telehealth, registering for Cirrus (which we did successfully over the phone) Life Care sessions and how to schedule, Supplement discounts, and so. much. more.
Advised member to do another welcome call so she can get reacquainted with plan - sent link to do so.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 17:25:01', '2024-09-10 17:25:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '9/10/24: Jane (advisor) filled out a support ticket for MaiLan letting us know that: Member is having a hard time obtaining a Covid vaccine, and also opening a need with Zion. Last time (they) called Zion, there were left on hold for over 15 minutes.
Called MaiLan - She said that Jane told her Covid is not paid for through her MEC. I let member know that Covid is 100% paid for through Planstin (even called to verify again today). Covid hasn''t been added to healthcare.gov website yet but is it part of the list. RSV is not currently part of ACA guidelines. 
Member let me know that she was able to open a need through Zion for colonoscopy. 
I checked the local pharmacies for member, and CVS has the covid vaccine in stock and it''s easy to make an appt by calling. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 16:45:14', '2024-09-10 16:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115200014', 'Michael Ebeling', NULL, '9/10/24: Sarah called hoping to get a reimbursement for her daughter''s 2 mo. well child visit from July.
Her MEC has changed so much over the past few months (Planstin - RCI - ARM) that she is getting the run around about who to contact for this. 
On top of that, she somehow added her daughter Annalise directly through Planstin/Zion so she was not showing in MPB records until Sarah filled out the change form to add her today. 
Planstin confirmed that Annalise had benefits through them 5/22-5/31.
Need to check and see if Annalise had any benefits through RCI during the months of June/July - if so, she should be able to get a reimbursement depending on their time limits.
And then, why was she able to add herself directly through Planstin/Zion instead of them directing her back to us? Do we need to send an email addressing this with them? To Be Continued....AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 16:39:34', '2024-09-10 16:39:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146288051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '9-10-24 Hi Estefania,

