  ('zcrm_1579374000146357103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701002', 'Bruce Appino', NULL, '09.10.2024 Bruce called to learn how to get covered for his preventive appointment this Thursday. I walked him through the possible options with Zion: Pay first, get reimbursed later OR submit a sharing request to attain a virtual card to pay for the appt. I suggested he speak to them and ask what is the preferred way they like.
Before I transferred him, he asked about our MAP program. I guided him to the page from our MPB Portal page and coached him on the process and when to call. 
*****************************************************************************
According to Admin123 and CRM ------- he''s a Direct Member. 
He''s trying to do a preventive visit for this Thursday, but he''s showing up in their system that he has Planstin.
 I tried telling them that is incorrect, but Amber from Zion was not open for me to send screenshots to assure them they have him in wrong. 
It doesn''t seem that Amber was able to make any changes on anything I could share with her, so I offered to reach out to our administration. 
I put in an IT ticket. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-10 14:34:55', '2024-09-10 15:14:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146357093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', NULL, 'lab work', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-10 14:21:35', '2024-09-10 14:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024351', 'Eric Thomsen', NULL, 'Sally Thomsen called (agent) with her son Eric on the line to help with learn how to submit sharing request. Eric recently had a heart attack. I educated Eric on IUA amount, collecting itemized receipts and statements and how to open member portal for the first time. Transferred to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 13:47:29', '2024-09-10 13:47:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146357088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141070002', 'Jerry Barnwell', NULL, 'Tina called back stating she was more interested in psychiatric care. Guided her that she is self-pay, Zion will not share in mental health, nor prescriptions. Advised to contact the Concierge once she has her scripts for guidance and discounts. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-09-10 13:44:52', '2024-09-10 13:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146288031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146373002', 'Francisco Ansaldo', NULL, '9-9-24 Francisco joined CARE+ $265/$1000 and may add HAB later. He''s set for Oct. 1st. His company will pay for it via reimbursement it sounds like.  He''s all set to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-10 13:31:15', '2024-09-10 13:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146357083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141070002', 'Jerry Barnwell', NULL, '09.10.2024 Tina called to learn how to proceed with Mental Wellness through their membership. I guided her to the Mazzitti and Sullivan page through the MPB Portal page. Gave her a mini orientation on their website, and how to connect with them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-10 13:29:38', '2024-09-10 13:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135605018', 'Jessica Robinson', NULL, '9/10/24: Jessica called. She has an annual derm visit scheduled and she checked that the place is in PHCS network, however she can''t find the specific doc in the network. I advised that she is still ok as long as the provider will bill planstin directly and that the service she is getting is coded preventive and listed on the aca guidelines. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 13:16:09', '2024-09-10 13:16:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146357072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135712001', 'Courtney Meckley', NULL, '09.10.2024 Jarred called to cancel his membership. I offered to guide him to the form, then suggested that he speak to Zac Masters in order to be sure no gaps will be in his insurance/coverage endeavor. He was adamant that he does not need to speak to Zac and all he needs is to cancel.
I offered to guide him to the form, but he said he is not in front of a computer. With that said, I told him I will go ahead and send him the form to fill out and submit by the 19th of this month, Sept. The email was sent out via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-10 13:12:29', '2024-09-10 13:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146357062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '09.10.2024 Lindsay called to confirm what Planstin shared with her regarding primary care vs. preventive care.....
I reiterated that Planstin is purely preventive, and what Planstin shared with her possibly may be from the angle of allowing it to go to the deductible, AND that we the concierge DO NOT encourage that approach. 
She still seemed confused about Urgent Care vs an ER visit and either of them being covered. I repeated to her, that BOTH of those would be cash pay visits. The only way for them to be "covered" is if the situation prolonged and expenses went passed the IUA amount. THEN they can be SHARED via sharing request. 
She may have misunderstood the ACA guidelines on healthcare.GOV, by saying that she SAW that Urgent Care is covered under the ACE guidelines. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-10 13:08:59', '2024-09-10 13:18:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130043002', 'Jonathon Waunch', NULL, '9/10/24: Jonathon called asking if we could help him find a facility that will charge a fair price for a sleep study. I guided him to website and showed him how to perform a search on HCBB. We found several places close to him that would do this in the fair price rance of $1,200. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-10 12:58:14', '2024-09-10 12:58:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146277057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3848 Question : Hello MPB!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-09-10 12:47:45', '2024-09-10 12:47:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146363048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', 'New Membership eff 11/24', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure w/ARM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-10 12:43:24', '2024-09-10 12:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146363043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', NULL, 'Member requested change to ARM MEC eff 11/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-10 12:42:44', '2024-09-10 12:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146370016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605002', 'Kirk Schults', NULL, '9-10-2024:
Hi Kirk,

Since we last spoke there have been some changes with the memberships. Your current Secure HSA membership is comprised of:

--Zion for the medical cost sharing components.
--Planstin for preventive care component.

The Planstin component is changing more than we thought since the last time we communicated. Originally, all you had to do was re-enroll with them....but now Planstin changed the game further! They are pulling out of the preventive care space for individually enrolled members effective 1/1/25.

That said, we have arranged a new preventive care provider "ARM" that operates in the same manner as Planstin. Your medical cost sharing provider (Zion) remains the same which; so if you have any open needs cases with Zion, that is all intact. This modification to ARM (from Planstin) keeps you compliant with the Affordable Care Act and is compatible with Health Savings Account requirements.

To make the change, please use the following change form https://www.cognitoforms.com/MPoweringBenefits1/ChangeToNewMEC   Complete this form anytime between 9/21 and 10/19 for an effective date of 11/1.

Your new monthly recurring membership fee at your current $5000 IUA level will be $301.20/per month.

Let me know if you have any questions at all, they are welcome.

Kirk', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-09-10 12:38:49', '2024-09-10 12:38:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146363038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', 'New Membership eff 11/24', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure w/ARM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-10 12:12:41', '2024-09-10 12:12:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146363033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', NULL, 'Member requested change to ARM MEC eff 11/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-10 12:11:43', '2024-09-10 12:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146371008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125276002', 'Tristan Sophia', NULL, '9/10/24: Tristan emailed in asking if the covid and flu vaccine are covered under her plan. Sent the following email back:
