  ('zcrm_1579374000146105516', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139165008', 'Kelvin Yip', NULL, '9/9/24: Member LVM over weekend asking about how to see a doctor, pharmacy, immunizations, and how to get another HSA bank card bc hers was stolen. Called back - She talked a million miles an hour and acted like she already knew everything and was in a hurry to get off the phone. I explained when to use MEC versus Healthshare and how to present, emailed her instructions on how to find a PCP with multiplan and specialist using HCBB. Let her know that we do not manage the HSA accounts and they will need to contact the bank to issue a new card. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-09 10:12:54', '2024-09-09 10:12:54'),
