  ('zcrm_1579374000146105506', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137674002', 'John Petrou', NULL, 'This member was in contact with Travis on the weekend about cancelling his membership.  He did not schedule a welcome call after Vanessa leaving a vm &amp; em.   Member gave Travis a hard time but did submit the Cancellation Request.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-09 10:05:46', '2024-09-09 10:05:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146105496', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045585130', 'Angela MacDonald', NULL, '9/9/24: Angela emailed in needing help logging in to submit bills. I messaged her back giving her instructions on what to do if this is her first sharing request as well as how to find her member portal if she has done this before. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-09 09:51:03', '2024-09-09 09:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146105491', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, '9/9/24: Scott Called asking where to go to submit receipts and bills for upcoming surgery. Since he''s accessed his Zion member portal before, I reminded him on how to get into his member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-09 08:29:17', '2024-09-09 08:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146105486', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000917082', 'Marc Clair', NULL, '9/9/24: Marc emailed in requesting to cancel his account after this month. Sent link to form and advised him to submit before the 19th to avoid being charged for October. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-09 08:27:44', '2024-09-09 08:27:44'),
