  ('zcrm_1579374000146105442', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '9-6-24 Carolyn ended her job already with driving the school bus. She can get Cobra is she wants. But, she''d prefer MCS. She wanted to backdate and pay for her previous membership but that''s never been allowed. Instead she could join Premium Care for $1000/$533 for Oct. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-06 16:44:53', '2024-09-06 16:44:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146154013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838033', 'James Truett III', NULL, '09.06.2024 Lisa called to attain more clarification on the membership they have. She had spoken to Zion, who told her about the $2500 IUA, but she was confused cz she remembers having something that brought down that number to $100. She was thinking they may have an extra service, so I referred her to speak to Misty Berryman, their advisor, as she may have sold them a product companion.
I went over their membership briefly, in three large parts: Essentials, PReventive and Healthsharing.
I explained about the MEC soon to change, they will look for the email. She was happy to learn about all the services, b/c she did not do her welcome call, I went ahead sent her the welcome call schedule link. 
She tried to register for CirrusMD and it did not recognize her credentials. I will send out a ticket for her and the family. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-06 16:11:35', '2024-09-06 16:11:35');
