  ('zcrm_1579374000146094069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141094002', 'Patricia Case', NULL, '9/6/24: Patricia called needing help finding a PCP. I helped her search Multiplan and reiterated that if it is not preventive, she presents as self pay. We also discussed the different credentials needed for Cirrus, MPB Portal and APP. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-06 14:52:57', '2024-09-06 14:52:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146094059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '9/6/24: Amy called furious about not receiving MEC card as of yet. She was part of the group that hd their files sent late. Kelly sent David at ARM all of this members information and asked if we could get cards today. I also called ARM and asked if there was any way we could rush this particular member. 
ARM was able to produce cards. Kelly emailed them over and I called Amy to make sure she saw them in her email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-06 14:10:49', '2024-09-06 14:10:49'),
