  ('zcrm_1579374000146153014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820220', 'Karen Neice', NULL, '09.06.24:  Karen called. Aging out of MPB to Medicare for Oct. 1. Asked if she needed to do about ending terminating her plan and, since her birthday is on 10/29, could she stay for that month.  I told Karen she should have received an email from MPB re: terminating her plan at end of Sept. Karen said she never received the email.  I checked and Patti did send her an email on 8.1.24 instructing her to fill out the cancellation form and copied me.  Will call Karen back and let her know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-09-06 12:43:14', '2024-09-06 12:43:14'),
