  ('zcrm_1579374000146105247', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130286061', 'David Naber', NULL, '9-6-24 Talked with Dave bc Kaiser sent email saying they have to set up their billing on the new platform. Dave asked me to send email to him and Rebecca. I did and Rebecca successfully set up their payment on the new platform according to her.

