  ('zcrm_1579374000146153003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '09.05.24:  Recvd. an email from Jocelyn asking how she pays for preventative care such as vaccines, mammograms & pap smears.  I emailed her back instructing her to call the Concierge and they will assist her in learning how to use her MEC services with Planstin.  I also informed her to use these services as soon as possible because Planstin will no longer be offering this MEC to individual bus. owners as of 1/1/25.  I added I have other plans that will suit her needs and asked her to let me know if she''ll be available either next week or the week after to schedule a meeting with me to discuss other options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-09-06 10:52:03', '2024-09-06 11:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146094046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143230002', 'Paul Evans', NULL, '9/6/24: Paul called to get wife set up on Cirrus MD. I was able to begin her registration successfully. He had 2 critiques for us! 
