  ('zcrm_1579374000146007053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, '9/5/24: Andrew called to find a new Primary Care Doctor. I walked him searching phcs to find a list of dr in his area. He was pretty confused about his plan and we ended up discussing a range of other topics:
-lowering iua and the waiting period that goes with that, verbiage for making appointment with planstin mec, general info about plan services - when to use planstin, zion or cirrus MD, concierge direct pcp, direct plan info. 
Emailed: Preventive Care Resources, Welcome call email scheduler, Direct plan flipbook and membership change form in case he wants to lower IUA. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-05 11:43:09', '2024-09-05 11:43:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000146007048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115245002', 'Derek Brandt', NULL, '9/5/24: Derek called to make sure his wife presents correctly for mamm appt tomorrow. I advised to present ARM card for billing. Apparently, his wife has a high chance for breast cancer and the estimate they received has diagnostic codes on it. I explained that ARM will only pay for the mamm if it is coded as preventive and to make sure his wife is aware and lets the imaging facility know to code it as such. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-05 11:41:49', '2024-09-05 11:41:49'),
