  ('zcrm_1579374000145998039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083475009', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'I got a call from this member who asked me about a bill he had received from his spouse''s emergency heart surgery.  It was for $300,000.  I asked when this happened, and he said 8/23.  I asked if they had opened a need for this event and member was unsure.  I told him that he needed to be in contact with Zion immediately to check on this.  Member was unsure of all the entities and what everyone did.  Member will be aging into Medicare eff 11/24 so I told him that it was imperative that his spouse re-enrolls for a membership eff 11/24 (when he goes on Medicare) so she has continuous coverage in case there are any further issues connected with this episode.2', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-09-05 10:17:03', '2024-09-05 10:17:03'),
