  ('zcrm_1579374000145957003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146373002', 'Francisco Ansaldo', NULL, '9-4-24 Francisco is 31 and planning to join solo for now. He may add his wife later. He was referred by Martin Bonzi. Lives in Atlanta, GA. He is going to see if his company will pay for this or reimburse him. Martin explained a bit about how it works. I explained CARE+ to him entirely and HAB. No pre-x, no tobacco, no smoking. He has used supplements in the past but not now. For HAB, he does wellness visits 1x per year, dental cleaning, gym is free, mental health only years ago, labs and that''s it. He had lasik years ago, no skin check, no vax, no skin check, no nutritional health.  CARE+ $1000/$265 and wellness HAB $107 = $372, plus $125/$25. We will meet again next week after he discusses payment with company.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-04 14:38:14', '2024-09-04 14:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145941018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863002', 'Dennis Nield', NULL, '9/4/24: Dennis called. He''s having issues with his foot and is going in for an MRI. He wanted to make sure he is handling the visits correctly by presenting as self pay. I advised yes, and we discussed his IUA, 6 month deadline, when to use Prev. card instead of self pay. He requested a new MPB card. Will reach out to Kelly to send. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-04 14:33:22', '2024-09-04 14:33:22'),
