  ('zcrm_1579374000145839008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '09.03.24:  I was informed today that OPD Complete will be terminated as of 11/1/24.  Primary Partners sent the OPD members an email directing them to Primary Partner''s new plan, Accent360. MPB sent an email to our members today offering 2 choices; Accent 360 or one of MPB''s plans.  I sent Joan an email offering to assist her in selecting the best plan for her needs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-09-03 17:46:53', '2024-09-03 17:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145839003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082612012', 'Ken Carpenter', NULL, '09.03.24:  I was informed today that OPD Complete will be terminated as of 11/1/24.  Primary Partners sent the OPD members an email directing them to Primary Partner''s new plan, Accent360. MPB sent an email to our members today offering 2 choices; Accent 360 or one of MPB''s plans.  I sent Ken an email offering to assist him in selecting the best plan for his needs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-09-03 17:44:10', '2024-09-03 17:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121928001', 'Tanya Hagre', NULL, 'Tanya called to obtain guidance on some procedures her doctor ordered: a mammogram, upper and lower GI, and blood tests. I shared with her resources such as Healthcare Bluebook to search prices and check the doctor referral she had been given. Emailed her search instructions too.
Educated her on what to do shall any of these issues go over her IUA
Shared instructions on using discount lab sites and emailed links. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 17:26:08', '2024-09-03 17:26:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123511002', 'David Toomey', NULL, '9/3/24: David emailed in with questions regarding what to do if daughter needs to use health plan while traveling to South America. I sent him the following message back:
"Should your daughter need any emergency or acute care while traveling, she would need to present as self-pay and collect itemized statements during the time of service. 
Zion will share expenses incurred internationally based on their guidelines. See screenshot below.
To answer your question -  yes, she would request the best cash price. If the incident goes over your IUA, the remaining expenses are eligible for sharing. 
Safe travels to your daughter!"
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:38:07', '2024-09-03 16:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145803044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, '9-3-24 Her response about HMA challenges.

Hi Wendy,

Thank you for letting me know, I am not the only one experiencing difficulties. I join you in the hope that they come up with an easier solution:-). I guess there is always hope! On that note, I hope you are doing well, I graduated in the meantime to Medicare and I wanted to belatedly thank you for the healthcare services you provided. It gave me great peace of mind to have this backup health sharing at a reasonable price. 

All the best to you!

Brigitte Fleeman', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-03 16:35:58', '2024-09-03 16:35:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '9/3/24: Emailed Jude the following email to make sure he was able to complete his family''s Cirrus MD registration:
"Good Evening Jude,
I hope you and your family have had a nice Labor Day weekend. I am following up regarding the registration for your Cirrus MD accounts. Per Joan Phelps'' request, I arranged for Cirrus MD to set up your family''s accounts and send you the links to complete the registration process.
If you need any assistance or have not received the registration links, please let me know, and I will be happy to help."
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:22:17', '2024-09-03 16:22:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000917080', 'Joan Phelps', NULL, '9/3/24: Joan still cannot access her Cirrus account and does not see any emails or calls from Luis at Cirrus. Sent another email to Cirrus to investigate further and confirm the email they used to reach out to Joan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:14:54', '2024-09-03 16:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', NULL, 'Renee called to see if immunizations and extra mamm images are included in her plan. I explained that yes, immunizations are and let her know how to find that list. As for the mamm, it depends on how it''s coded. If the extra images are bc they can''t get an adequate prev screening bc of breast tissue, then yes - but if it''s bc they found something during the screening and want to investigate it further, then no. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:11:16', '2024-09-03 16:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131742001', 'Leslie Zann', NULL, '9/3/24: Leslie called. She has a bill from pharmacy for two immunizations and wondering if they are covered under her plan. I educated her about what is included in her MEC and how to present her card at preventive appts for billing. Advised that she speak to Planstin and see if there is any way she can get a reimbursement for the shots. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:09:16', '2024-09-03 16:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145807054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, 'Melany called bc she hasn''t received her ARM card. Her husband needs to get a shingles vaccine. I let them know that a small group of members who were on older plans are a bit late in getting their cards sent but assured that ARM does have their info and they should be receiving cards soon. Emailed Contact info and group number for their reference in case they need it. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-09-03 16:07:27', '2024-09-03 16:07:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145778046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111229018', 'Dale McMullen', NULL, 'needed help opening a needs with zion -ac', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-09-03 15:05:22', '2024-09-03 15:05:22'),
