  ('zcrm_1579374000145772037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664001', 'Rebecca Meighan', NULL, '09.03.2024 Rebecca needed to have an ultrasound breast exam instead of a mammogram, her doctor approved it, but Planstin was not going to cover it. She needed to have the ultrasound due to her dense breasts.
She also switched plans, and according to her and Leslie that had her lose her longevity with Zion. What was going to be shared was no longer getting what she expected, due to the tier it put her in with Pre-X conditions. She did not leave Zion, so I questioned that to be accurate, and told her I was going to look into it, EVEN THOUGH she is now receiving benefits through her employment, so she will be cancelling.
I guided her to the form on line, and she completed it while we were on the phone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-03 14:17:07', '2024-09-03 14:30:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145803039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '9-3-24 Left another email to alert Elizabeth that her payment was declined and her membership will be cancelled. She called me back and submitted the update payment form just now. I will notify Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-03 14:10:52', '2024-09-03 14:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145772032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, '09.03.2024 Heli is trying to access her 30% discount with FullScript. She keeps getting an existing account up, when she clicks on the link in the Member Portal.
I tried to search with her on how to log in with a different email, then she said she only has one email.
After speaking with Julia via Teams, she guided that I need to call FullScript to have them cancel the member''s old account.
We entered a training meeting at that time. Afterwards I learned from Angee, since I mentioned to her I was searching for Fullscript''s number to call to cancel a member''s account, that it is the member''s responsibility to call FullScript to cancel and resituate their account holding with them. 
***************************************************************************
I called Heli back. I ended up leaving a detailed VM saying:
1- I am not able to do anything past guide the members to sign up for the FullScript.
2- Anything that has to do with the individual accounts, must be addressed by the member.
3- I offered Fullscript''s number.
4- I guided her to have them cancel her present account and use the link I guided her to from the member portal to open a new account, and get her 30% discount. 
5- I gave her our number and repeated Fullscript''s number again. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-09-03 13:57:56', '2024-09-03 14:36:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145803034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, '9-3-24 Brigitte''s troubles with HMA outlined here...

﻿Dear HMA,

I am very disappointed in your new method of paying at the doctors office for medical care. Despite your frequent emails proclaiming the ease of use and that I won’t have to pay out of pocket anymore (which by the way I never had to do with the Visa card), I now had to pay 6  of 8 times at the doctors office myself and sometimes despite having had them submitted and approved. Yesterday the office manager at the hearing studio even called you and then didn’t let us pay through the card. BTW, the reimbursement takes over 6 weeks.

It takes me a long time to get the contact information submitted, wait for the approval, print the email and even with all that prep work, the approved provider doesn’t accept the payment method and I have to front the bill (as I already said, six times).

You explain to me how that time consuming process is simpler than the Visa card which worked every time. Just skip the time it takes you to send me your long emails about the advantages of this card when in reality it just doesn’t work.

I would like a more truthful explanation of the change and also what you suggest to make this process work without all the useless prep and extra work.

Brigitte Fleeman

I let her know they are supposedly opening a reimbursement portal once again to process expenses to be reimbursed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-09-03 13:57:30', '2024-09-03 13:57:30'),
