  ('zcrm_1579374000145772024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, '09.03.2024 Jessica called b/c some of her bills like the one for $2554 on 8.15.2024, the anesthesia, is not paid yet. As well as one for around ~$60k, the actual surgery. They sent her a letter and called her warning her not let this go to collection. 
