  ('zcrm_1579374000145555101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131743016', 'Anna Suchowian', NULL, '8/30/24: Anna called to check the status of a need she submitted. She''s having mole surgery today and submitted the sharing request a week ago. I advised that since the surgery is today - she''s looking at paying upfront and then submitting for reimbursement. I trans to Zion so she can check the status of her need now. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 10:00:01', '2024-08-30 10:00:01'),
