  ('zcrm_1579374000145555093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '8/30/24: Joan asked me to help with making sure Jude and his family is registered for CirrusMD. When checking his status, I received the error message "no records found". Emailed support ticket to Cirrus. 
