  ('zcrm_1579374000145555088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128574001', 'Courtney Caroland', NULL, '8/30/24: Courtney LVM with questions about coverage. Attempted to call her back and phone never would connect. Sent the following email:

Hello Courtney,
Thank you for reaching out. We received your voice mail and attempted to return your call. However, it seems there was an issue with the connection, and were unable to reach you.
To ensure that we can assist you promptly, could you please give us a call back at your earliest convenience? We are here today until 8pm EST at 800-519-2969.
Best regards,
Angee Montgomery
MPB Health Concierge

AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 09:23:22', '2024-08-30 09:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145553068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130453026', 'Lillian Mell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-08-30 09:12:11', '2024-08-30 09:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145555068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111775010', 'Xiaosong Xiao', NULL, '8/30/24: Sent member the following email in response to email shared by Julia through teams:

Dear Sean,
Thank you for reaching out. I understand you are wanting to check if your recent hospital bill went through to Zion.
Since we at MPB do not have access to the Zion member portal to check the status of sharing requests, the best course of action would be to contact Zion directly. You can reach them at 888-920-9466, and their team should be able to provide you with an update regarding your recent submission.
Please let us know if there''s anything else we can assist you with. 
Best regards,
Angee Montgomery
MPB Health Concierge
800-519-2969
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 08:58:29', '2024-08-30 08:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145555058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128139002', 'Dixie Johnson', NULL, '8/30/24: Dixie called saying she is having issues finding a doctor on PHCS and wondering if she can just go to the OBGYN and pay cash and then send it in for reimbursement. 
I explained that she''ll need to have the provider bill Planstin directly in order to have her visits paid for, and that they have RBP pricing for out of network providers. Gave advice on what to say to provider and imaging center when making appointments. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 08:49:36', '2024-08-30 08:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145555053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117970009', 'Marissa O''Neal', NULL, '8/30/24: Marissa called in saying that her daughter has a swollen lymph node, and they got bloodwork and ultrasound, but doctor is wanting her to go back for more testing. At this point, they''ve met their $1000 and she wants to know how to submit a need. 
Advised on submitting itemized receipts and upcoming bills through member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 08:34:20', '2024-08-30 08:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145555048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000917080', 'Joan Phelps', NULL, '8/30/24: Joan is having issues logging into her Cirrus MD, and keeps getting the message: "There was an error trying to log you in.  Please try again." 
Emailed a support ticket to Cirrus. They responded back with following message: 
"I reached out to Joan directly and offered her assistance so they could access their account. I looked on our end and can confirm that her account is active and it shows as registered. I provided the login links and ensured they could reset their password if needed. "
 AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 08:21:29', '2024-09-03 16:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145555043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '8/30/24: Jennifer called needing her member ID and username to access MPB app. She asked what her resources for recent anxiety. I provided her with MAP number and also suggested CirrusMD as they can sometimes help in the short term. 
Member never received MPB health card in mail. Asking Kelly to resend. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-30 08:09:16', '2024-08-30 08:09:16');
