  ('zcrm_1579374000145489428', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '8-29-24 Marni called and asked for a letter for proof of coverage for college. I sent her back to Concierge for them to help her obtain the letter. Either Planstin or Zion should be able to supply it. Planstin will be best and Zion as backup.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-29 14:57:16', '2024-08-29 14:57:16'),
