  ('zcrm_1579374000145489418', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '8-29-24 Darrin definitely wants to remove MEC and is still deciding if he wants to add HAB. He had included a cardiology screening which is about $325 in his math but that''s not included per another client of mine who tried already. He will let me know before Sept. 13th to move forward on both fronts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-29 13:20:58', '2024-08-29 13:20:58'),
