  ('zcrm_1579374000145489413', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '08.29.2024 Felicia wanted to be sure as to how to get the Colorguard covered by Planstin. We did a 3-way call with Planstin, spoke with Caitlyn, she confirmed the easiest way was to have the provider to send the claim straight to Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-29 12:24:04', '2024-08-29 12:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145489408', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, '08.29.2024 Sondra called on behalf of Brent, to learn how to attain a better consultation fee from a specific doctor. I guided her to shop around on HCBB, and gave her a tiny orientation, but she was wanting me to have an impact on the fee being charged, as I understood. I told she would have to see what others are charging and see if she can negotiate that fee down. Otherwise, switch doctors. 
They seem to have their heart set on THIS particular doctor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-29 11:58:06', '2024-08-29 11:58:06'),
