  ('zcrm_1579374000145489400', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145560002', 'Stephanie Thompson', NULL, '8-29-24 Stephanie and son is almost 18, enrolling now for Oct. 1st into Premium HSA and is self-employed. Her accountant advised her to  get the tax benefits from HSA. She tried to enroll on Safari and the system kept telling her she was missing his DOB and gender (?). She had to start over with Chrome to get it to work. It''s completed for Oct. 1st. She will cancel her other ins for Oct. 1st as well. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-29 10:31:31', '2024-08-29 10:43:34'),
