  ('zcrm_1579374000145486076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '8/29/24: Marni called asking what she should use for her son''s college insurance waiver. I advised that if was to have an emergency that he''s presenting as self pay and using the Healthshare, however, to appease the school I advised to use the information from Planstin card, as that matches what they are asking for. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-29 08:20:33', '2024-08-29 08:20:33'),
