  ('zcrm_1579374000145486063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939024', 'Ehab Said', NULL, '8/28/24: Member called to update address. Navigated her to form on website and gave instructions on how to complete. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-28 17:56:16', '2024-08-28 17:56:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145486058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, '8/28/24: Brent called to check on Zion reinstatement issue.
After reading back through all the emails from Nahla, Brent, Julia and Planstin - the last update about this was sent out on the 20th but I didn''t see any updates from Planstin or Zion.
Called Planstin and Celeste notified me that Brent''s account is active and there are no notes about him being dropped due to residency. 
To confirm, I called Brent back and we reached out to Zion to check his status - they also said that his residency paperwork has been approved and he is good to go. 
Brent asked why no one from Zion called to let him know he is reinstated, and I didn''t have an answer for him. Apologized on MPB''s behalf. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-28 17:00:02', '2024-08-28 17:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145486053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, '8/28/24: Received confirmation from Cirrus that Amy''s account has been fixed and she can sign in. She also had questions about scheduling an appt with a PCP and what to say so I offered some verbiage that may be helpful and emailed the same info for her to have on file. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-28 16:38:35', '2024-08-28 16:38:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145489361', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770001', 'Adele Haynes', NULL, '8-28-24 Deli inquired about adding wellness. I just left her a vm to help her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-28 15:12:48', '2024-08-28 15:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145486043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, '8/28/24: Astraea called about her 1095 form and granted permission for us to email it to her at astraeabella@gmail.com. She also needs to formally change her email and address - sent her the form. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-28 14:53:12', '2024-08-28 14:53:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145489353', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '8-28-24 Karen is choosing to add HAB w/ DPC for $315 EF for Oct. 1st effective date. They have DPC for both her and Eric. They get reimbursed $140 from HAB, so cost for family turns out to be only $175 for HAB once reimbursed every month. She also chose to change IUA from $1500 to $1000 for Oct. 1st. Price changes about $60 more per month to increase IUA.  All set. Keeping  Redirect for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-28 14:40:09', '2024-08-28 14:56:00'),
