  ('zcrm_1579374000145392883', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770001', 'Adele Haynes', NULL, 'Adele called inquiring about utilizing her plan overseas in the event of travel, domestic mental health services, labs and RX information. Also wanted to know about switching to an HSA membership, guided her to Wendy. JA.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-08-28 12:08:59', '2024-08-28 12:08:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145436068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111776002', 'Mauryce Kennedy', NULL, '8/28/24: Carma called. She had a recent hysteroctomy and is having issues with the hospital changing up the billing. She said first they offered her a 25% discount if she paid day of, and then charged her an additional $1000. The hospital changed the billing codes from what was listed on the good faith estimate. She is actively fighting these bills and does not want to submit to Zion bc she is so involved and making headway on lowering the bills. 
