  ('zcrm_1579374000145348094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, '8-27-24 Ryan called to get numbers for HAB w/ DPC. They are members with Nexterra. So, it''s $293 month EF and $160 reimbursable EF = $133 per month for their cost. He wants to get it approved through the church and will get back to me. I let him know the deadline of 20th of the month also.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-27 16:02:28', '2024-08-27 16:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145348086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130059020', 'Elizabeth Wiersma', NULL, '08.27.2024 Elizabeth received our email regarding the switch from Planstin by Nov/Dec. She was concerned and was not clear on what is what talking about. 
