  ('zcrm_1579374000145348068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111845002', 'Cindy Wolden', NULL, '08.27.2024 Wife got a strange email, from the lady they talked to to sign up with MPB, Karen Torsoe. It turns out they needed to change their payment information.
