  ('zcrm_1579374000145286099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101718001', 'Nancy Cooper', NULL, '8/27/24: Called Nancy and LVM with questions about her prescription quote request. We need more info to proceed. Sent the following email:
We tried to reach you earlier regarding your prescription quote request and need a bit more information to proceed.
While RedBoxRx is not a pharmacy option available through our resources, we’ve provided mail order prices below for your convenience.
If you prefer to pick up your prescription locally, do you have a preferred pharmacy?
Could you confirm if the Bupropion medication you’re looking for is in extended-release tablet form? Bupropion XL. This is the only option I found that goes up to 300mg.
Here are the mail order prices we found through CostPlusDrugs.com:
Minoxidil 2.5mg, 90 tablets: $7.70
Bupropion XL, 300 mg, 30 tablets: $7.70 
Local pharmacy prices range from $15 to $25 per medication. If you prefer this option, please let us know which pharmacy you’d like to use, and we can clip coupons and send them your way. Based on my search, I found competitive prices at Publix, CVS, and RiteAid in your area.
Feel free to give us a call when you receive this at 800-519-2969. We’re available from 9 am to 8 pm EST. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-27 13:54:40', '2024-08-27 13:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145286086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133865034', 'Astrid Weisseise', NULL, '8/27/24: Astrid called, and is having trouble locating her gyno on Multiplan site. I tried searching and also did not see anything. I advised to still try and keep her appt, but make sure that the office is willing to bill planstin directly and explained RBP pricing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-27 13:20:10', '2024-08-27 13:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145348058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353010', 'Lauren Martty', NULL, '08.27.2024 Lauren called to better understand her membership. I explained it in a nutshell. She then insinuated that she wanted to save money. I shared with her the over arching options we carry, and MEC vendors that are moving around, and suggested she speak to her advisor for more detailed approach to learn pricing. We also went over how to have a large medical bill shared with Zion and what to do.
