  ('zcrm_1579374000145348053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145372007', 'Amy Kopf', NULL, '8-27-24 Amy is 53 and lives in Lancaster, PA. Premium memberships are Not an option. She''s changing jobs and looking to work with Mary Ellen and getting divorced. She can get Cobra through work for $836 for one more month. She was hoping to get started for Sept. 1st but it''s too late. She''s healthy, no meds, no smoking. She had a skin issue in Feb. that wasn''t able to resolve traditionally with meds so she chose Aryuvedic methods which worked and never a problem since. She thinks it was related to stress of divorce and everything else going on in her life at that time. She''s a healthy weight and teaches fitness classes. She does all of the wellness visits, skin check, mammo, colonoscopy at age 50, dental, vision, mental health, pap, labs, shingles shot and would love to do yoga since she can get reimbursed. She chose the $2500 IUA for CARE+ at $300 and HAB at $107 = $407.  She will begin Oct. 1st and was sent by Mary Ellen Francescani. She wants to refer people to me as well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-27 12:31:58', '2024-08-27 12:31:58'),
