  ('zcrm_1579374000145255033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141046019', 'Chrystal Caldwell', NULL, '08.23.2024 Clarification on membership details. Chyrstal called to learn if she can proceed with refilling her prescription via telehealth, and I explained it depends on the medication if it''s controlled or not. A lot of times they refill, but want to know that you are visiting with someone in person. I helped her download the CirrusMD app, and I put in the ticket to get her registered with them. I sent her the directions and details for HCBB and Healthgrades. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-23 13:18:01', '2024-08-23 13:37:51'),
