  ('zcrm_1579374000145047996', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '08.21.2024 Denise left us VM. Zion is not being promptly responsive in a timely manner, and that is causing Concepcion a lot of pain. The surgery she needs keeps getting delayed, to give Zion the time they need to review the document, request more documents, and even make inaccurate decisions. The Zion rep shares with Denise that what they are asking is an unusual request and they need time to review it all.
Denise is in well composed spirit, but she''s extremely worried about Concepcion, and was in tears over the phone. From the sound of what Denise is observing in others with the same condition, Zion is doing Concepcion a lot of bodily harm by taking their time and not expediting her situation, despite how busy they are and claim/share with Denise. The two weeks requested has turned into over a month, and they still do not have her proceeding forward with the surgery Concepcion needs. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-21 16:13:54', '2024-08-21 16:13:54'),
