  ('zcrm_1579374000144996136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '8/21/24: Called Patty back. She left a VM regarding accessing fullscript account. I advised her to try logging in through the link on MPB website with a different email to access the 30%. She''s going to try and give us a call back if it doesn''t work. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-21 14:29:56', '2024-08-21 14:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144996131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097027002', 'Elaine Colter', NULL, '8/21/24: Elaine called asking if her annual provider visit allowed through Zion is every calendar year and if I could see when her last one was. I advised that it is annual, but I don''t know how strict they are with dates pertaining to that -  she could ask Zion. As for the last visit, that info is something she could find in her member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-21 14:22:43', '2024-08-21 14:22:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145065021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117297011', 'Piyush Kansara', NULL, '8-21-24 Piyush knows to call Cigna and set up auto pay in 7-10 days. He wrote down the number. He paid with cc for first month. He will start Sept. 1st for family of 3. We scheduled time on Nov. 5th for looking at plans for 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-21 14:22:38', '2024-08-21 14:22:38'),
