  ('zcrm_1579374000144996121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, '8/21/24: Rick called asking if there were any updates regarding member''s pharmacy benefits. From my understanding, Citizens RX had the incorrect ending date for members, but it has been corrected. Advised the Samer try running his RCI card again for med, and if that doesn''t work -  to please call us back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-21 14:09:09', '2024-08-21 14:09:09'),
