  ('zcrm_1579374000145067003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127235001', 'Pamela March', NULL, '08.22.24 Tony emailed stating that they had missed MPB communication regarding their membership age out. Asked if Zion would be able to consider providing assistance. Emailed Ashlee, notified about Essentials Debt Forgiveness, as well as the possibility that Medicare could backdate his benefits to 6 months accounting for first eligibility date of July. Advised to speak with his advisor to find out more. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-08-21 11:14:19', '2024-08-21 11:14:19'),
