  ('zcrm_1579374000144996068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '8/21/24: Called and LVM for Amy following up about Citizens RX issue. Sent the following email:
I wanted to provide an update on the ongoing investigation regarding your prescription. Our team has reached out, and both RCI and Citizens have confirmed that your account is active. We''re continuing to look into the issue, and I will keep you informed as soon as we have more information.

In the meantime, could you ask the pharmacy to remove your current card information and try processing the savings card instead? These cards often have a separate RX Bin and Group number, which the pharmacy can use to process your prescription. Additionally, since the MEC only covers preventive medications, it shouldn''t be applied to this prescription.

Thank you for your patience as we work to resolve this.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-21 09:26:37', '2024-08-21 09:26:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145045003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '08.21.24:  Recvd. an email from Jessica yesterday. She recvd. the "MEC Transition" email and wants to know what plan she has. I responded that she has SECURE HSA and explained Planstin is no longer accepting one-person businesses for the MEC. I added we now have a new selection of plans she may want to consider, so we should schedule a call to discuss them. I asked when she would be available for a call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-08-21 09:26:27', '2024-08-21 09:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000145044008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'spoke on the phone is willing to return just would like better line of communication or understanding of who to contact when she needs a answer.', 'Travis Cannata', 'Travis Cannata', '2024-08-21 09:25:42', '2024-08-21 09:25:42'),
