  ('zcrm_1579374000144996053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '8/21/24: Jill called wanting to confirm her prevent. mamm, bone density scan will be paid for. The hospital is stating they are not in phcs network even through they are listed on multiplan website. I advised her to try calling provider back and have them verify your eligibility with Planstin bc P will pay for out of network services as long as provider will bill them directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-21 08:58:11', '2024-08-21 08:58:11'),
