  ('zcrm_1579374000144842003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106305009', 'Karen Awad', NULL, '07.29.24:  Recvd. an email frrom Karen. Said she sent the video to me w/a voice message. Asked me to review and and she would do it over if I felt the need.  I called Karen and asked if she could send another photo, as the one she sent has a very busy background.  She said she would and she did.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-08-19 11:03:54', '2024-08-19 11:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144840003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, '08.19.2024 Dawn called to get clarification on why is her deductible $5000. It turns out, after she went to the urgent care, she called RCI, and that''s what they told her. I clarified that is a common conversation to have if you call a MEC company, instilled awareness of the MEC vendor change to ARM AO 9/1/2024, and explained how to present and organize her bills to be shared via cash pay patient lens. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-19 10:59:08', '2024-08-19 10:59:08'),
