  ('zcrm_1579374000144787111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled after speaking with Leo extensively.   He leaves to go out of the Country every year for the summer and issue in the past has been the not being able to put membership "on hold".   Should have the same issue next year.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-19 10:11:06', '2024-08-19 10:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144784116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140002', 'Christopher Dalton', NULL, '8/19/24: Chris called, his daughter got several immunizations for nursing school and the EOB states that insurance was applied but didn''t pay for anything. All the immunizations he listed are on the ACA guidelines. It seems like a billing mistake to me and advised he speak to Planstin directly to see if they got the claim and if so, why it wasn''t paid for. Transferred over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-19 10:10:58', '2024-08-19 10:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144787101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144773019', 'Ross Harkrider', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-19 10:00:10', '2024-08-19 10:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144784103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '8/19/24: Amy called. Her pharmacy told her the group number for Citizens RX no longer exists. She has an expensive med that she has a savings card for, but the pharmacy will not run the card until it''s first run through insurance. This is not something we can get her a better price for. Told member I would look into it and follow up. 
I let her know that the MEC vendors are changing but that shouldn''t affect anything now. She was irritated and asked why MPB didn''t think it was relevant to send any notification. I let her know that MPB did send out an emailed notification and I would pass her info to the individual sending those out to make sure she gets it this time.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-19 09:55:27', '2024-08-19 09:55:27'),
