  ('zcrm_1579374000144784083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143062002', 'Susan Scott', NULL, '8/19/24: Emailed support ticket to Cirrus to set up member. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-19 09:23:10', '2024-08-19 09:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144784078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137206002', 'Richard Hirsch', NULL, '8/19/24: Monica called. She is delivering a baby in November and the birth is not part of a maternity request. She''s asking how soon can they add baby to plan and if anything happens during delivery, could that be shareable?
According to Zion guidelines, they can add their newborn no sooner than 7 days from delivery and any complications prior to then would be considered pre-membership conditions. I explained phase in period to member and that no, if there were a complication during birth, that would not be shareable. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-19 09:18:33', '2024-08-19 09:18:33'),
