  ('zcrm_1579374000144751057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '08.16.2024 Robert called to learn how to proceed with his son''s gastro diagnosis and the hospital appointment on next wednesday.
We went over how that would be a Zion sharing request, and went over the details of the process. He brought his wife on the line since she''ll be the one to take him, and discussed it in detail on how to present, organize and get shared.
He also asked about his visitations for his injuries that require PT, Xrays and more. I explained that I''ll have to get back to him on this on monday to confirm with colleagues, since this is a fairly new membership.
He will call on Monday so we can open a sharing request for his son, and possibly one for himself. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-16 17:58:19', '2024-08-16 17:58:19'),
