  ('zcrm_1579374000144749003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142011002', 'Jonathan Chan', NULL, '08.16.24 - Spoke with Jenny, suggested she completed a Welcome Call on her own as she was completely unaware of the plan, details and IUA. Will send her more information on Preventive Visit, downloading our App, and scheduling her Welcome Call.

Explained that labs, and Dr appts (childhood colds) would not go towards the IUA as it is need specific. Alternative Care would need to be pre-approved by Zion, and her possible diagnosis of hashimoto''s disease would still fall under the pre-x clause, even if it has not been diagnosed. May not be the best candidate for this plan.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-08-16 10:13:02', '2024-08-16 10:51:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144748003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '08.13.24:  Called Jude. He said his daughter had ringworm on her scalp and he wanted to use CirrusMD but couldn''t get access into his member portal. He doesn''t seem to be registered. He had to take her to ER (with a $400 bill. I told him to call the Concierge so they can help him register and let me know how all worked out.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-08-16 10:06:58', '2024-08-16 10:07:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144733051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '8-16-24 Susan and Scott enrolled in Premium HSA. Needed the HSA for kids school and for HSA. Kids can use PHCS network in Boulder no problem.  I had Scott enroll as the primary since he''s younger. They chose $1000/$949 EF and added HAB ES $165 since their network is terrible in the mountains. This will save them about $10,000 per year!  I explained the entire membership to Scott as well. I had already done so with Susan. They seem to be dialed in now, for the most part. They may have questions down the road as they use it. They are all set for Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-16 10:01:50', '2024-08-16 10:10:07'),
