  ('zcrm_1579374000144721008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127447012', 'Robert Mull', NULL, '08.15.2024 Rob is at the hospital. Nicole is getting checked out at the hospital for maternity initial appointments. They have not opened a sharing request with Zion yet, still attaining the conception details and the maternity planning and due date.
