  ('zcrm_1579374000144724003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117297011', 'Piyush Kansara', NULL, '8-15-24 Piyush''s wife Purvi is losing her job 8/16/24 with PNC Bank. They have very good coverage with UHC but Cobra will cost $2K. Their income is estimate at $43K to remain above Medicaid. He''s fine with paying money back in taxes if he winds up having a great year these last 4 months.  He makes money on investments and capital gains. Purvi will be looking for another job but they have no idea how fast that will be. He''s looking at Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver for $14.05 after subsidy. Before tax credit it''s $1,773.57.  Or he''s looking at RMHP Colorado Doctors Plan Colorado Option Silver for $209.98 and before tax credit it''s $1,969.50. All Drs. show up in the RMHP network but two missing from Cigna''s network. Drs. include David John Halpin, Jon Steven Rubright, Elizabeth Ann Alaimo, Randolph Anthony Pinto, Emily Anna Reznicek. Randolph Anthony Pinto, Emily Anna Reznicek don''t show up in Cigna''s network. He will decide how important these 2 drs. are for $200 difference in price per month for the remaining 4 months. He will find out the annual renewal period for his wife''s plan. But, doesn''t really make sense to stay on the plan since he''s getting a huge APTC of $1,759.52.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-15 11:10:02', '2024-08-15 11:10:02'),
