  ('zcrm_1579374000144696032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127290002', 'Andrea Thompson', NULL, '08.14.2024 Andrea called needing guidance on how to get all the services she''s been getting for what might look like neuropathy shared. Her initial visit with her primary care physician was on June 19th. From there, there were xray, physical therapy.....and other services, trying to avoid surgery. 
