  ('zcrm_1579374000144651041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701002', 'Bruce Appino', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 12:43:02', '2024-08-14 12:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144687002', 'Paula Shoup', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 12:38:43', '2024-08-14 12:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144617012', 'William Ansel', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 12:31:35', '2024-08-14 12:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659263', 'Julie Sombrio', NULL, '8/14/24: Julie called wanting answers about her preventive services. Her husband received some conflicting advice from planstin about labs and out of network providers. I explained that they both have access to out of network providers. I brought planstin on the phone and Celeste showed that they were both listed on the old plan but got the greenlight from supervisor to update. 
Julie wanted to confirm when she could schedule her annual provider visit this year. 
Celeste said they do not look back at past dates - and as long as it''s coded correctly, they will process. 
Julie was very happy with the answers she received and asked to leave a review. Sent link to do so. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 12:31:08', '2024-08-14 12:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144696027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103443001', 'Daryn Pela', NULL, '08.14.2024 "husband" called wanting to change membership to have ONLY Zion. I explained that would mean to cancel with us and sign up with Zion. He asked if there''s NO WAY we can just bridge over so they don''t lose longevity. I said that is a very litigious question that I believe the advisor and/or Zion can answer precisely. He was happy to leave the research to Jane Kassel. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-14 12:14:26', '2024-08-14 12:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', 'New Membership eff 9/24', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 12:04:14', '2024-08-14 12:04:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144696016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '08.14.2024 Eric called saying he is unable to access his portal. I guided him to access his MPB Portal. He then said but I need to submit my bills to redirect. I realized he was talking about Sedera, I gave him their phone number to get assistance with that. He says "...then who is redirect?" I explained that is the name of his plan. He added that he has an app called Redirect. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-14 11:41:05', '2024-08-14 11:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144697003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '8-13-24 Karen and Eric are thinking of removing Redirect and adding HAB. They pay for DPC for Karen and are open to adding it for Eric. They can choose HAB with DPC and pay $315 for the family instead of $250, therefore $65 more and get reimbursed $70 for DPC membership which she pays $120 to local DPC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-14 11:31:57', '2024-08-14 11:31:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144696008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, '08.14.2024 Missed call with a VM from Allisyn, asking who the OTHER MEC vendor that is replacing RCI is, and what happened to the telehealth service. I''m not sure how she''s relating both entities, but I called her back, and ended up LVM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-14 11:29:21', '2024-08-14 11:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144696003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138936002', 'Chantal Watson-Lewenkamp', NULL, '08.14.2024 Confirmed with Chantal, according to Julia via Teams Chat, sharing a snippet from an email from Ashlee in Planstin, backdating Chantal''s membership to the 1st of June 2024. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-14 11:27:05', '2024-08-14 11:42:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140018', 'James Smith', NULL, '8/14/24: James called back and let us know that Zion has no record of him in their system. I submitted a support ticket to IT, alerted Julia of issue and that he has an upcoming surgery.
Assured James that we will fix it as soon as possible, that it may take a week to be visible in ZIon''s database, but that he does still have services for the time he''s been a member. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 11:24:48', '2024-08-14 11:24:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144661041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143070002', 'Christopher Darling', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-08-14 11:07:25', '2024-08-14 11:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, '8/14/24: Eben called needing a replacement Planstin card. Transferred over to request new cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 10:58:03', '2024-08-14 10:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144661018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143062002', 'Susan Scott', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. No records found with CirrusMD. Also couldn''t get into Healthcare Bluebook. Sent over info to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-08-14 10:52:39', '2024-08-14 11:05:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '8/14/24: Kara called to see about finding a place who could do a more cost effective diagnostic mamm with contrast. I taught her how to use HCBB to search for this. MOST facilities near her were high cost facilities. I showed her the price range she could expect. Avera breast Center was the only one within 60 miles that is a fair price facility so she''s going to try there first. 
I showed her that by scrilling down and if she''s willing to drive there are a few others.
While if it becomes an issue, she''ll have to pay $1K either way, this mamm may be the end of it so she''d rather pay $300ish opposed to $600-900 for it. Hopefully Avera works out. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 10:46:57', '2024-08-14 10:46:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140018', 'James Smith', NULL, '8/14/24: James has a surgery tomorrow for a detached retina and doesn''t have any cards to present to dr. He never got any cards from MPB and had to call planstin to get those. 
I explained how the first sharing request would work and how to open member portal, and to go ahead and submit that sharing request as soon as posisble, but with it being so close to time, if the surgery center requires upfront payment, he would have to pay that and then be reimbursed later after Zion makes a determination and set expectations that they will look back to make sure it''s not a pre-existing condition. Transferred to Zion to open member portal. asking kelly to resend cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 10:01:27', '2024-08-14 10:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103443001', 'Daryn Pela', 'New Membership eff 7/16/24', 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 09:38:52', '2024-08-14 09:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103443001', 'Daryn Pela', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add newborn to membership.  I will process &amp; notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 09:38:12', '2024-08-14 09:38:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138597002', 'Bladimir Aviles', NULL, '8/14/24: Bladimir called, he went to the hospital for a pain in his left side and wants to know if it is covered. I explained that Zion would have to make a determination on the issue and make sure it''s not a pre-existing condition. And that his first step is to submit an itemized bill from visit to ZIon as a new sharing request. Bladimir was kind of surprised and didn''t know much about his plan or how it worked. I educated him on creating a sharing request, his IUA, 6 month deadline, how medical cost sharing worked, how funds are distributed and being self-pay. transferred to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 09:25:47', '2024-08-14 09:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916013', 'Gene Esplin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/24 due to finding other coverage.  I will process &amp; notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 08:25:47', '2024-08-14 08:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144661013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141321002', 'Joe Himrod', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Joe &amp; Sherri. No records found with CirrusMD. Member also couldn''t get into Healthcare Bluebook. Set over info to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-08-14 08:04:04', '2024-08-14 08:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144656008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '8/14/24: Attempted calling multiplan with no luck reaching a person. The recording just kept looping no matter what I chose. I filled out the contact form on multiplan website to ask about suspicious phone calls that Risa has been receiving. Emailed Risa the following:

 hope you''re doing well. I wanted to let you know that we''ve reached out to Multiplan regarding the phone calls you''ve been receiving that seem suspicious, especially with them asking for your tax ID number.
As soon as I hear back from them, I’ll be sure to follow up with you. In the meantime, please avoid sharing any personal information with them.

AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-14 07:30:17', '2024-08-14 07:30:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144651003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125113011', 'Brett Robison', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/24 citing finding other coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-08-14 07:25:14', '2024-08-14 07:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144594021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '8-13-24 Hello Julia,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522191251
Benefits Start Date: 09/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-13 20:57:55', '2024-08-13 20:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144604038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095950001', 'Jennifer Kries', NULL, '8/13/24: Jennifer called, she has a knee injury and wondering how to use her plan to navigate that. She has a tear to left meniscus. I educated her on how using the medical cost sharing component of her plan would work, her IUA etc. 
She asked what if she lowered her IUA - I advised that there is a waiting period of 60 days for sharing requests submitted during that time and you can only change your IUA once per membership year and that lowering her IUA would increase her monthly payment. I gave her an overview of what the price increase would look like but that it would be different for her since she started in 2022 and that she would need to contact her advisor for exact pricing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-13 17:34:07', '2024-08-13 17:34:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144604033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918138', 'Kalyra Goodrich', NULL, '8/13/24: Kalyra called needing assistance with getting into portal, replacement MPB card, accessing behavioral health sessions and medication management for her son. They are living temporarily at a new address and requested the MPB card be sent to:
592 Rosa Linda Way
Santa Barbara CA 93111

I explained that their life care sessions are just therapists and they don''t manage meds and trying CIrrus first, and if they won''t prescribe then use a pcp or psychiatrist. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-13 17:09:39', '2024-08-13 17:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144604028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '8/13/24: Risa called claiming that multiplan has been calling her nonstop asking for tax id number and saying she needs to give info for her account. I let member know this sounds like a scam and to not give out her info. I assured her that I would reach out to multiplan to verify it''s not them and follow up. Am', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-13 16:39:14', '2024-08-13 16:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144594016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '8-13-24  I called and shared with Sheala her new contribution amount at $520 and she''s thrilled!  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-13 15:12:08', '2024-08-13 15:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144565068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '08.13.2024 Concepcion has been diagnosed with Nutcracker Syndrome=Diagnosis > Surgery in December.
Iliac stint put in - limit was $50K, asked for it to be raised - has not heard back - has bills to submit - NOT a preX condition.
Both conditions have paperwork submitted stating they are not preX Conditions. 
Paperwork FROM MEDICAL HEALTH for procedures were to reach Zion after August 1st and July 31st. They have not, and Meghan from Zion reached out to the medical records team, and learned that the papers have not reached them, but THEY WILL be reaching out to the hospital to attain them via virtual request.
As for the iliac - should there be MORE information, services needed or procedures, they need to send them in. Zion has the receipts, but no itemized bills/receipts. Meghan suggested they might be able to find all these through the MyChart medical portal. 
It sounds like Zion is being responsive, just request additional/specific paperwork. Meghan was tremendous.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-13 14:36:57', '2024-08-13 15:00:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144565063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142602002', 'Steve Feld', NULL, '08.13.2024 Steve called with the impression that he has preventive benefits. I explained his membership is purely catastrophic and went into the details on an IUA.
I explained that it is a common question with new members, and sometimes advisors do sell product companions aside from the MPB membership, to have preventive. I suggested he reach out to Mel, his advisor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-13 14:22:40', '2024-08-13 14:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144604023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, '8/13/24: Maria called, said she still can''t access app. I reset her password again, which worked on her end. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-13 13:00:08', '2024-08-13 13:00:08'),
