  ('zcrm_1579374000144608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '08.12.24:  Recvd. an email from Jude. Said he tried to access his Member portal and is being denied access. Asked for help.  I emailed  him to call the Concierge for this task. I''m not sure if it''s the MPB or Zion Member portal he needs. I asked him to clarify.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-08-13 11:49:23', '2024-08-13 11:49:23'),
