  ('zcrm_1579374000144604003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131969002', 'Simone Noble', NULL, '8/13/24: simone called bc she couldn''t access member portal. Gave her the general pw to page. She needed to find a dermatologist, so we walked through using HCBB together and found a list of fair price options. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-13 11:17:28', '2024-08-13 11:17:28'),
