  ('zcrm_1579374000144565042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109794002', 'Sharri Maynard', NULL, '08.13.2024 Sharri called to learn the least expensive way to attain a referral to get blood tests done. We concurred for her 1st step to be with CirrusMD, then visiting the discounted lab sites to find savings for what tests she needs to get done. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-13 10:40:09', '2024-08-13 10:40:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144594003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '8-13-24 Sheala decided to add her kids onto CARE+ for $615/$1000 and husband is keeping his employer plan.  Sheala has chosen HAB for her and kids as well EC for $200 = $815 a month. No SEP needed since no MEC.  This will be effective Sept. 1st, 2024. I instructed her to call MPB Concierge Team Sept. 1st or soon thereafter to set kids up with CirrusMD. She''s all set otherwise! 
 UPDATE- She gets the 2023 Pricing at $520 for the EC!  I''ll call and let her know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-13 10:09:55', '2024-08-13 13:41:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144565031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045043', 'Kurt Benfield', NULL, '08.13.2024 Jill called to get guidance on how to proceed for her scheduled surgery and sharing request.
