  ('zcrm_1579374000144565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916028', 'Trevon Stoltzfus', NULL, '08.13.2024 Avery called to organize her paperwork for college, and wanted to know what lab place to put down on her college papers. I guided her to choose one that is close to her college, as that''s where she will be MOST LIKELY be getting her annual physical. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-13 07:48:30', '2024-08-13 07:48:30'),
