  ('zcrm_1579374000144519027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '08.12.2024 Patrick spoke with Julia, looking for preventive services, (need the email template sent). For his colonoscopy, the provider is asking him to sign a form stating that he is cash pay. Not sure if that would apply to Planstin.
