We did a 3-way call with Planstin, and spoke with Caden. He affirmed that the colonoscopy would be covered, not the consult, to present the card for billing. If they push back, that reimbursement is on the table. Knowing that it is a lot of money upfront, that would be a different conversation to have with Planstin, and they will support him. 
