  ('zcrm_1579374000144477213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128916020', 'Margaret Garrido', NULL, '8/12/24: Margaret called. She received a $119 bill from pcp for well visit. She said that she had blood work done. She thought everything for well visit was covered by planstin. I explained that Planstin does pay for the well visit, but they are limited on what they pay out for blood work and that it''s typically just a standard lipid panel. She asked if they pay for a bone density scan - according to aca, yes for women over 65 or women who have gone through menopause. I transferred to Planstin so she could ask them directly why a portion of bill wasn''t paid. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-12 09:58:03', '2024-08-12 09:58:03'),
