  ('zcrm_1579374000144438041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995010', 'Tom Trimmer', NULL, '08.09.2025 Tom called from when Lisa went to the ER 06.23.2024. I explained how the sharing request works with Zion. They will call back on Monday to open a Zion member portal, if they have not already done so.
Tom has the colonoscopy and an endoscopy. I explained the colonoscopy would be screening preventive unless they pull polyps then it''s diagnostic with Zion. The endoscopy is a cash pay visit, and can go through Zion should it become a lard medical bill. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-09 17:56:22', '2024-08-09 17:56:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144455018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '8-9-24 Cami had her appeal denied for further PT. However, they split her need into 2 sharing requests for neck and shoulder. Now, she will have to pay her $1000 additional IUA but also get an additional 35 PT sessions. She''s concerned about the $125K cap for pre-x. I''m inquiring if it''s $125K per year and resets or per lifetime.  She may want to move to a new membership if this doesn''t pan out. She''s happy to know that she has options as well. She''s afraid 10-20 years down the road she might need surgery on her neck and doesn''t want to be limited by $125K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-09 17:26:52', '2024-08-09 17:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144438036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129963002', 'Matthew Duran', NULL, '08.09.024 Matthew called to learn how set up an HSA account, he could not find a financial institution that would do that for him, where he lives, so I sent him the HSA for America link via CRM. 
He asked about paying for cash pay visits, and I guided him with yes it would be out of pocket and once the IUA, $2500 here, is reached then Zion starts sharing given it is eligible.
He needed to know how to search for a physician, I sent him the HCBB and Healthgrades resources and went over both platforms on how to use them.
HIS IUA was NOT in the CRM, so I took it from Admin123 and typed it in here. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-09 17:18:03', '2024-08-09 17:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144455013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, '8-9-24 Carolyn called to find out what to do with Bob when she turns 65 in October. He can join Premium Care at $234/$2500 IUA and include Health Access Preventative $107 to equal $341 a month for October 1st, onward.  I will want to make sure Sedera will honor his original start date of Sept. 1st, 2022. He has some digestive issues that are ongoing and come and go. He also has prostitis from cycling. For wellness, he does colonoscopies on schedule, dental cleanings, vision screening, skin check, ski pass, labs, no for mental health. We have a time scheduled for Sept. 10th to complete the paperwork.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-09 15:58:15', '2024-08-09 15:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144438023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141419020', 'Scott Lofgren', NULL, '08.08.2024 Scott & Wendy called to be better acquainted with their membership. Thought I could go over the major parts of their membership and get them on their way, but we ended up on the call for 51 minutes.
Went over almost every detail of them plan. This does not usually happen, as I go over the major parts and request that they call us, when they are ready to use their membership. Scot and Wendy had ongoing detailed questions, and they kept repeating them. I answered them, multiple times.
The one item that needs attention in their membership is the HCBB tool. For some reason, they are signed in under the influence of RCI. I will bring this to the IT''s attention via Julia. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-09 15:30:42', '2024-08-09 16:30:45'),
