  ('zcrm_1579374000144331141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144281002', 'Abigayle Bacchus', NULL, '8-7-24 Abigayle is with Florie Glusman''s group. They only have Florie and Abi at the moment. So, Florie is paying and helped Abi enroll. Abi is committed to living a healtier lifestyle. Abi is vaping and now going to quit in order to remove the extra $50 a month fee. Abi has to pay that part, not Florie. Abi joined CARE+ and HAB for a Sept. 1st start date.  They are set to go and will be billed as individuals until Florie brings on one more person to the group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-09 11:34:08', '2024-08-09 11:34:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144323081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '08.09.24:  I assisted Belinda in enrolling at our Teams video chat mtg. Explained to her the emails, letter w/MPB  Membership card and ARM MEC card she will be receiving. Advised her to schedule a Welcome Call to learn about the app and how to access services and Member portals. Told her to call me with any questions or issues.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-08-09 11:26:28', '2024-08-09 11:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144331136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144281002', 'Abigayle Bacchus', NULL, '8-9-24 Hello Abigayle,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522191238
Benefits Start Date: 09/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
Access Digital Membership Packet', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-09 11:24:58', '2024-08-09 11:24:58'),
