  ('zcrm_1579374000144192159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '08.07.2024 Multiplan link not working. Nicole gave me some names she was interested in and I plugged them in HCBB then Healthgrades to confirm their existence  in the field and system. We decided it is best for her to call the ones she reaches and requests they share contacts of practices in their circle that do exist and presently practicing, with PHCS. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-08-07 16:15:53', '2024-08-07 16:38:39'),
