  ('zcrm_1579374000144192143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '8/7/24: Wendy reached out asking if we would contact Kara regarding an upcoming preventive mamm appt. Kara explained to me that she is just going for a preventive mammogram. I made sure to clarify that there is no previous claim submitted to Planstin this year for a prev mamm and she said no. 
I advised her to present her Planstin card for billing and have the provider send the claim directly to Planstin. Should it turn into a diagnostic procedure, then she is a self-pay patient and if the issue exceeds her IUA, those bills can then be submitted to Zion as a sharing request. And to make sure she collects an itemized bill in case it does turn into a larger issue. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-07 14:31:15', '2024-08-07 14:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144192133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143456001', 'Enock Freire', NULL, '8/7/24: Enock called very irritated that he couldn''t access his cards for daughter''s physical. I attempted to quickly educated him on the 2 different cards and what they are used for. I was able to find his RCI cards in my email and forwarded them to him again. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-07 13:30:32', '2024-08-07 13:30:32'),
