  ('zcrm_1579374000144226043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '8-7-24 Abigail Bachus is Florie''s employee that she''s paying for and needs a Sept. 1st start date. She is now enolled in CARE+ 18-29 $240+$107 plus $25 enrollment fee. I waived the $100 fee since she''s joining as Florie''s employee but they only have a group of 2.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-07 08:23:50', '2024-08-07 08:28:01'),
