  ('zcrm_1579374000144192076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141274002', 'Ayad Amary', NULL, '8/7/24: I was finally able to confirm with St Lukes that they are indeed in the PHCS network. Called Caroline and gave her the greenlight on making an appt there for her preventive mammogram. 

I personally stepped into Caroline''s appointment scheduling issue to learn first hand what she was dealing with. 
Between the inadequate multiplan listings and run around by providers, it is understandable how frustrated this member was about making a preventive appointment. It took me 3 days of calling to finally get an answer from a live person. Lesson here being - make sure members ask providers if they are in PHCS instead of using the TPA names, and make sure to ask multiplan if specific places are listed in network - the only option in members area did not come up without specifically calling and asking multiplan. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-07 07:51:56', '2024-08-07 07:51:56'),
