  ('zcrm_1579374000144100034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129064002', 'Kellie Galligan', NULL, '8/1/24: Kellie called. She recently had a well woman visit and needed to know how to be reimbursed. I explained that in the future, it''s best to present Planstin card at the preventive appt so provider can bill them directly. She''s having labs done and a mammogram. We discussed which labs P would pay for, using discount lab sites and presenting at these appts. I emailed her instructions for using the discount lab sites, and ended call by transferring to Planstin so she can ask about submitting her bill and requesting new cards. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-08-01 13:16:00', '2024-08-01 13:16:00'),
