  ('zcrm_1579374000144115018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '8-1-24 Clara is 55 and husband is 58 turning 59 soon. They are both self-employed paying about $1200 for their insurance now. They live in Brighton, CO. They are healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. They do wellness occasionally, not interested in colonoscopy, mammo yes, dental yes, vision every 10 years or so, gym no, mental health no, skin check no. Probably not worth HAB but she will review it. They pay about $530 a year to their dentist for their membership. She will work out the numbers to see what makes the most sense.  With their age and no pre-x, I quoted Premium Care at $1000/$575 or $1500/$507 and HAB $165. She will review it with her husband and get back to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-08-01 11:50:17', '2024-08-01 11:50:17'),
