  ('zcrm_1579374000144100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664001', 'Rebecca Meighan', NULL, '8/1/24: Rebecca called: She had an annual bill, hasn''t paid yet. I advised to call provider and have them send the bill directly to planstin. She has a breast screening coming up that is a sonogram and how to approach billing for that - again, I advised to have prov. send bill to planstin and be sure it is coded as a preventive screening. 
