  ('zcrm_1579374000143961033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, '7-30-24 Lynn is considering cancelling bc she has a bunch of health issues she wants to tend to like a rotator cuff issue and possible within this last year. She can get onto her husband''s ins for a little more money but she doesn''t know the ded or mop. She was frustrated by her experience with Planstin for her wellness visit. The Dr. charged her a new patient fee and she wound up paying most of her wellness visit. She doesn''t do mammos but would possibly do a thermogram. She likes the sounds of HAB once she understood how easy the reimbursement could be. She doesn''t have the time to do all sorts of paperwork. But, she was jaded from Planstin''s challenges. She may choose to opt into her husband''s ins for a few months to see how it all plays out and keep her MPB membership to maintain her low pricing and to avoid pre-x if she rejoins.  She will look over brochure and make a decision and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-30 10:00:31', '2024-07-30 10:00:31'),
