  ('zcrm_1579374000144023003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, '07.30.2024 Brian emailed us yesterday on the 29th to update us on what he''d like to send (as a detailed message) to Zion.
I responded generically, as how we, MPB, cannot actually dictate any verbiage through members to other entities. 
Julia responded letting me know that he might be more suitable for international insurance and not Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-30 07:31:00', '2024-07-30 07:31:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143971034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '07.29.2024 Nicholas is calling on behalf of his wife, Tami, who''s developed an overgrowth of gut bacteria, SIBO (ATM Gene).
Wants to know how to get benefit towards the medication/antibiotics b/c it costs over $2k.
I offered to reach out to the international shopper, cz the sites were not in our favor on this, but he said that it takes too long and that they might just pull the plug.=, as it does make her feel awful.
He also wanted to know if it is at all shareable, I told them the only way to know is to open a sharing request, given that it is a specific issue.
He asked how to get covered for the MRI as a preventive, vs a regular mammogram, due to her not being able to get regular imaging. I told him we will need to do a 3-way call tomorrow with Planstin around noon ET, to discuss this, given that the ACA would cover BRCA screening. 
RX Request: Xifaxan - 550mg - 42 Tablets.                                  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-29 17:30:44', '2024-07-29 17:50:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143971029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141538002', 'Kathleen Ferguson', NULL, '07.29.2024 Spoke with Julia via Teams Chat, video, to ask where we are with Kathleen''s billing situation. Julia shared it is in billing member services'' hands right now. 
I told her then I wont'' generate anymore PHCS lists for Kathleen, until I hear back from admin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-29 16:58:15', '2024-07-29 16:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143971021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128581003', 'Ian Leventhal', NULL, '07.29.2024 Ian emailed with information regarding certain bills and the amounts to be shareable. I responded with:
"Greetings Ian,

Really good to hear from you. Wishing you are starting to feel stronger.

I''m looking at what you forwarded, and I''m curious to whether you reached out to Zion or did Zion reach out to you.
This inquiry is present, due to you recently signing up under the Essentials package, and we were under the impression that you proceeded with the Debt Relief Program. With that said, Zion is not supposed to be in the picture regarding any services, let along a sharing request. 

Attached is the Debt Relief Program brochure, where you will find a contact number to initiate the debt relief request. Most likely they will ask you specific questions, regarding your financial situaiton. In your notes here with us, I have that I reached out to you earlier this month to clarify this, I''ll put it here, so you can read it -
You have two options:
Sign up with ScriptSourcing (the debt relief program).
Sign back up with Zion if you want to pursue their services.

We are here M-F 9-8pm, ET, if you want to chat over the phone for more clarification. 

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969

* Disclaimer *

This email is intended solely to provide supplementary information to our valued members and is not a personal point of contact.

If you have additional questions or concerns, please call the Concierge at 1-800-519-2969." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-29 16:56:06', '2024-07-29 16:56:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143971013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244018', 'Ross Muscolino', NULL, '07.29.2024 Ross wanted to know if his membership holds any benefits towards short term disability. After speaking with Zion, we confirmed they will share anything towards the medical bills, not lack of employment portion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-29 16:39:31', '2024-07-29 16:39:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143971008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137202002', 'Kristianne Goff', NULL, '07.29.2024 Kristianne is inquiring about mammography via the PHCS list. I generated one and sent it via email in Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-29 16:31:37', '2024-07-29 16:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143961025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '7-29-24 Florie couldn''t remember who she spoke with at Zion. She had already submitted an application but not payment. Danielle submitted a request for payment which she has not completed. In order to keep her group intact for her grandfathered pricing and to include the virtual healthcare app and other benefits, she chose to go with CARE+ $240 for her employee/contractor plus HAB $107.  She may pay for CARE+ and have Abby pay for HAB $107 to remain closer to what she was planning to pay. But, Florie really wants to encourage Abby to take care of her health and wellness. Florie see the value of HAB simply with the gym membership with all of her family members. She does cross-fit herself.  They don''t fund an HSA. We can remove Planstin $135 and replace with HAB $250, so her total is $596.50 + $250 = $846.50. Looking to make the change for Sept. 1st. She wants to sleep on it and make sure she understands everything and will let me know. She just needs 1 more employee for List Bill Group status.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-29 15:55:31', '2024-07-29 15:55:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143961008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144011021', 'Sidney Graves', NULL, '7-29-24 Sidney is 57 and lives in Carbondale, CO. He was with his now x-partner/friend through her employer via the public school system. That relationship has ended and he won''t have proof of loss of coverage, so he can''t get onto C4HCO for the month of Aug. He was very excited about Premium Care and HAB for Sept. 1st start date. He doesn''t have any pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Cobra was going to be $850. He is interested in doing the screenings, dental, skin check, gym membership for 7-day ski pass maybe, and 3rd IUA protection. The rest he may not use but it was a no brainer for him in his location. He joined Premium Care for $285 and HAB for $107 = $392 plus $125/$25 for Sept. 1st. He paid MPB with cc and HAB with bank account. All set and happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-29 15:31:43', '2024-07-29 15:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000144003003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125287001', 'Deena Patel', NULL, '7/29/24: Planstin called asking about Deena''s plan. She''s interested in adding preventive services to it. I advised that Deena would need to contact her advisor - Johnathan Masters and provided Carmen with contact info to relay to member. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-29 14:19:54', '2024-07-29 14:19:54'),
