  ('zcrm_1579374000143863003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, 'Sent: Friday, May 10, 2024 1:27 PM
To: Cheryl Powell <cpowell@gclearningservices.com>
Subject: Membership Optimization Call Today

 

 

Hi Cheryl,

 

Great to meet you this morning to review and discuss your current membership options. We discussed three approaches for you.

 

Stay with your current membership, Secure HSA. Please use the following link to re-enroll: https://app.planstin.com/register/employer?affiliate=173091&agent=22793
Re-enrolling with Planstin keeps everything the same for you. The enrollment process is cumbersome but your membership is 100% the same, no changes. And your pricing is held until February of ''25.
If you are open to doing this now while it''s fresh from our discussion, do it. 
Be sure to open your HSA account! ?  (www.hsabank.com is a good provider.)
Convert to "Premium HSA". Optimize your membership by switching over to "Premium HSA" with the $1500 IUA. This is also an HSA compliant (with MEC coverage) membership. The monthly fee will be $320/mo.  This is a $5/month savings.
Conversion is easy, let me know if you end up choosing this approach; I can send you a link to make the change.
Brochure attached for Premium HSA.
Convert to "Premium Care". Optimize your membership by dropping the MEC component altogether and keeping just the medical cost sharing. This membership is called "Premium Care". At a $1500 IUA, your monthly membership amount will drop to $254/mo, a $71mo savings, or $852 year.
Brochure attached for Premium Care.
 

Lastly, I am sorry your request for a Gyn closer to home went unanswered. I mentioned this to Will (a member of our concierge team) and he is following up on it now.

 

Please contact me with any questions at all about the proposed changes, they are welcome.

 

Best,

 

Kirk', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-07-29 07:04:21', '2024-07-29 07:04:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143837009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123703011', 'Jordan Anderson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3728 Question : Why won''t it let me log into the member portal?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-07-26 15:05:17', '2024-07-26 15:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143773063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '7/26/24: Monique called asking about therapy benefits with her plan. I explained that she gets up to 12 sessions/year through MAP. She''s already tried calling them and there are no options for in person therapists in her area. I advised that she could ask a local therapist to join the MAP network and explained the process, but that it would  be up to the therapist. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-26 14:21:17', '2024-07-26 14:21:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143848023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '7-26-24 I called Chris after Patti let me know that he''s inquiring about how to cancel. He needs to cut costs in his life and he was considering cutting out his healthcare but his wife wants to keep hers. He now understands that they will lose their grandfathered pricing at $425 ES $2500 IUA SECURE. Otherwise, if he cancels, his wife will have to re-enroll at a much higher rate. He''s considering whether or not to do so by Aug. 20th for Sept. 1st effective.  He used some of the mental health benefits, 1st 4 and then didn''t continue after the 2 month break. He hasn''t used any of his benefits since. He''s just feeling pinched on money right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-26 14:20:09', '2024-07-26 14:20:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143773058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '7/26/24: Chris called wanting to change the primary on his account to his wife and remove himself. I transferred to Patti - I believe this is more involved than a submitting a change form.
Patti let me know that it''s not something we can do and directed member to Wendy to walk him through the process. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-26 13:58:29', '2024-07-26 13:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143787091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that since he need to cancel and how would that affect his wife who needed to continue with the membership.  She is also an employee of Finesse Marketing.  I asked him to be in contact with Wendy and that she would help her re-enroll.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-07-26 13:53:45', '2024-07-26 13:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143773053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116111009', 'Oleg Petrakovsky', NULL, '7/26/24: Kathryn called asking if her dermatology bills are covered or if they could go towards her deductible. I educated her on her plan and what it will and will not pay for. We discussed:
1. IUA, 3 iua''s per 12 month rolling period, issue specific, difference bt iua and deductible.
2. Preventive services and what that pays for. Why her derm is listed on PHCS
3. Telehealth, good times to use that rather than a dr visit. 
She needs to have melanoma removed and wants to submit bills as a sharing request. Trans to Zion for member to open member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-26 13:32:14', '2024-07-26 13:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143821297', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140440002', 'Alan Caldwell', NULL, '07.26.2024 Spoke with Julia, confirming their information was sent to Planstin yesterday 07.25.2024, and should be manually integrated either later today or first thing monday morning. 
