  ('zcrm_1579374000143787073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126559001', 'Michael Duffy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking to Nahla &amp; then was transferred to me.  We spoke about his cancellation and I asked if he spoke to advisor Lou.  He had not, he told me that he would contact him.  When Julia reached out to me via teams she was under the impression that he wanted to sell our memberships.  I asked if he was an Ins Agent and no he is a DPC doc.  When I brought up the Referring program he was not interested.  I will process cancellation &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-07-26 12:24:17', '2024-07-26 12:24:17');
