  ('zcrm_1579374000143769003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '7-25-24 Florie called bc she wants to add a contract worker and pay for part of the membership. She accidentally called Zion first and they quoted her pricing based on her age of 49, not on her husband''s age of 58. So, she was erroneously quoted $480 at the base price and $595 with preventive, telemedicine, RX and Lifeworks. For her 29 EO employee she was quoted $158 base and $198 total. She is interested in HAB preventive for colonoscopy, mammo+MRI, skin check, pap screening, nutrition, dental, vision and mental health. She''s hesitant to pay more but it might be worth it for her family. Although the vaccines might be limiting.  At the correct pricing for a 50-64 through Zion it''s $705+$115= $820. They are paying $731.50 now. She could remove Planstin for $135 = $596.50 and add HAB $250 = $846.50.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-25 15:57:46', '2024-07-25 15:57:46'),
