  ('zcrm_1579374000143705008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109083002', 'Karin McGrath', NULL, '7/25/24: Called Karin regarding her message yesterday. She was wondering if they have RX coverage with their plan, I explained yes - that their MEC offers discounts for some drugs and pays 100% of statins, bc and some immunizations.
