  ('zcrm_1579374000143705003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103037010', 'Genelle Davis', NULL, '7/25/24: Genelle called. Her daughter needs a physical for school and she wanted to know if she could take her to the pediatrician she had found. It had taken her a long time to finally find someone. I advised that with her MEC (Planstin) they will pay for physicals in or out of network as long as the provider will bill them directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-25 07:10:46', '2024-07-25 07:10:46'),
