  ('zcrm_1579374000143669049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '07.24.2024 Opened a sharing request in May 2024. Calling to check on the process. How long will it take to pay the bills? She is receiving threatening letters to take her to collectors. Zion did ask for the medical records. Last time she checked her Zion portal, two weeks ago, it said pending. Today she checked it was determined eligible, but with a pre-X 2nd year cap of $50k. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-24 16:12:35', '2024-07-24 16:28:33'),
