  ('zcrm_1579374000143687008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143831002', 'Colleen Schreiner', NULL, 'Colleen Called me today, very interested, but had a very bad cell phone connection. Sent her via email my calendar link.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-07-24 15:21:27', '2024-07-24 15:21:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143621041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133307002', 'Felix Costa', NULL, '7/24/24: Rosemary called - she had questions about filling out check-in paperwork for well woman visit. I advised her to use info from Planstin card for inusrance information. 
She also had a lot of "hypothetical" questions about using the health share which were difficult to answer because she just wanted to know if visits to a specialist would be covered. I explained that the need has to point towards a specific issue, and expenses related to that issue after IUA is met can be eligible for sharing - but determinations are made by Zion and go by their member guidelines. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-24 15:18:14', '2024-07-24 15:18:14'),
