  ('zcrm_1579374000143661038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '7-24-24 Matt called bc his CirrusMD isn''t working. I told him to contact MPB Concierge Team to get that resolved. He wanted to review his membership to make sure he''s still on the best one. He''s also still referring folks to Sedera and I suggested he send them to me to help determine the best solution for their needs. I discussed HAB but they do their dental in the Caribbean where it''s about $50. He just did his colonoscopy and done for another 10 years. They figured out where to go for the kids wellness visits. It''s not idea with Apex but they''ve figured it out. They use the HSA. If they moved to HAB they would lose the immunizations for the kids. So, he decided it''s not worth the added cost or losing Apex/RCI with HSA. They have become excellent self-pay patients for the wellness needs not included. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-24 13:24:32', '2024-07-24 13:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143669023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043462286', 'Bryan Baker', NULL, '07.24.2024 Bryan needs to open a sharing request with Zion. I transferred to Zion, after explaining the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-24 13:11:53', '2024-07-24 13:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143669018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631170', 'Zack Aker', NULL, '07.24.2024 .... email response:
"Glad you reached out. When you mention ''the list'', do you mean you generated one on the Multiplan Link, and you did not find what you were seeking?
The MultiPlan Link holds the different networks providers are a part of, including the PHCS Specific Services that your membership carries for your MEC portion, with Planstin. You have the option to search for anything that can fall under the ACA guidelines, Healthcare.GOV. Those are the preventive service guidelines in your membership. If the service you are looking for is not there, then it is considered out of pocket. 

Preventive health services
Most health plans must cover a set of preventive services like shots and screening tests at no cost to you. This includes Marketplace private insurance plans.
www.healthcare.gov

For out-of-pocket appointments, you''ll need to present as a cash pay patient. We can talk more about those appointments via phone if you like. 

As for the RX Requests, we search a number of sites per medication, and allocate around 24 hours per medication. Should we need to reach out to our international shopper, that will take up to 48 hours to attain a price. The time allocated for this service includes answering phones throughout the search, as well as other communication liaison in the process.

I have just one 7 item request in front of yours that I''m almost done with, and I can start with yours.

Please let me know if you need me to clarify this part of your plan further. I know it can get confusing from all the moving pieces." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-24 13:08:41', '2024-07-25 12:09:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143669013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '07.24.2024 Elisa called inquiring about coverage/sharing/coupon for Paxlovid, lowest dosage, for being diagnosed with Covid.
I tried a couple of sites to see the pricing, and the 1st price that showed up was in the ~$2200''s.
Then I tried Zion RX Save - but the medicine did not come up there. Then we 3-way called Zion RX Share, and ended up opting for them to call us back, when their lines are free. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-24 12:58:07', '2024-07-24 12:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143661033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '7-24-24 Robin upgraded her HAB to include DPC for Aug. 1st. Original start date was 7-1-24.
Hello Robin,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190696
Benefits Start Date: 07/01/2024

