  ('zcrm_1579374000143661014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '7-24-24 I talked with Patti and if she removes Planstin, it will only save her $30 a month. So, if she keeps it, she can still fund the HSA for now. She''s paying $905 now with the old pricing with SECURE. If she changes to CARE+ with the current pricing, it''s $875. So, may be best to leave well enough alone. She submitted the change form just now, but Patti won''t process it until Aug. So, we have time to determine if she should remain with SECURE for now. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-24 10:46:38', '2024-07-24 10:46:38'),
