  ('zcrm_1579374000143359011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '07.19.2024 Elizabeth went for a mammogram, bilaterial 3D due to a large breast density. However, Planstin DID NOT cover any part of it. They started out with a regular mammogram, but then took additional images due to the breast density. 
