  ('zcrm_1579374000143255075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143301002', 'Sarah Hall', NULL, '7-18-24 Sarah was just out here in Denver, CO for her 18 year old son''s soccer tournament at Dick Sporting Goods Field. They qualified for nationals!  She has a large family with 4 kids.  Her husband is a smoker so it''s $685 up from $635. She will encourage him to quit smoking. He''s turning 47 in Nov. They will join HAB for $250 as well. Her cost with Derek Lee will be $175 per pay period.  She''s all set for Aug. 1st HAB List Bill with Perrysburg Counseling / Derek Lee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-18 12:10:27', '2024-07-18 12:53:10'),
