  ('zcrm_1579374000143307008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, '07.18.2024 Ear infection in June - got seen at a local doctor - gave her antibiotics that did not help - inner ear fluid - last week, went back in - another round of antibiotics and referred her to see the ENT - if healed, then cancel - but they can drain the fluid.
