  ('zcrm_1579374000143054026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '7-16-24 Cynthia is flustered since she can''t get her former employer to help provide a Cobra letter showing the end date of July 31st. They are telling her she get Cobra for 18 or 36 months. I let her know it''s 18 months. I asked her to find her original Cobra notice showing the 18 months as proof of her SEP. She will look for that and create her C4 account and select me as her Agent. She will also send me her list of drs. for her and her husband. Once I have that we will set a new time to discuss the plan options for an Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-16 14:09:07', '2024-07-16 14:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143054021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '7-16-24 Brady wants to add his wife and baby. I showed him how to complete the form and to do so by the 18th at the latest. He will verify with his wife that they are ready to make the move. If not, he''ll complete it in a month or so. He''s pretty certain they are ready to move. They still have a big deductible to meet, so not really worth staying.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-16 13:55:49', '2024-07-16 13:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143056032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127834002', 'Jeffrey Markham', NULL, '07.16.2024 Jill called on behalf of her husband regarding his cardiac ICU Er visit for 2 weeks on 7.02.2024.
