  ('zcrm_1579374000143056027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121976011', 'Robin Kruel', NULL, '07.16.2024 Robin had surgery on 05.07.2024 from a dog bite, had hand surgery. She wants to open a sharing request. I walked her through thru process in details, what to expect and be ready to fulfill then transferred her to Zion NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-16 13:38:44', '2024-07-16 13:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143060033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130216002', 'Montanah Matthies', NULL, '7/16/24: Montanah called. She is getting bills for some preventive visits - physical, pap smear, and blood work. Some she paid up front and some the provider did not send bill to planstin. I advised her to speak to planstin about reimbursement - they can tell her exactly what is needed and where to send, and as for the other bills, to call providers and have them submit to the claims address on the back of her planstin card. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-16 13:36:28', '2024-07-16 13:36:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143023012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109512002', 'Gabrian McPhail', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with MPB.Health Admin Assistant', 'Visit ID : 3695 Question : I''m trying to reset my member password. I''m not sure how to do that.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2024-07-16 13:34:22', '2024-07-16 13:34:22'),
