  ('zcrm_1579374000143059028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121653002', 'Christina Darding', NULL, 'After issues trying to get the PU link to member via email she called in and I directed her to the website.  She them submitted the form.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-07-16 13:13:58', '2024-07-16 13:13:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143060028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135465016', 'Todd Smith', NULL, '7/16/24: Aimee left a message needing help submitting a need from a bike accident she had 5 weeks ago. In the message she also asked if seeing a dentist for the teeth fractures she got from the accident could be included in the sharing request. 
Called back and LVM asking her to give us a call back so we can assist is helping her start the sharing request and responded to the teeth question - that yes, as long as it was damage incurred by the accident, then it can be included. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-16 13:09:43', '2024-07-16 13:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143060023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '7/16/24: Member called back - the front desk girl at provider''s office told them she doesn''t know and can''t verify if they are in network or not even though all the doctors listed for that office are showing as in network on multiplan. Member wanted to know if she was safe to book?
I said it is really best to get a verification first bc I''d hate for her to get stuck with a surprise bill, and advised her to call office, say that I see your drs are listed in network, can you call and verify for me - and give them planstin''s phone number. And to make sure that the provider is willing to bill planstin for the service directly. I explained that there is a safety net for services obtained out of network and Planstin will still pay, as long as the claim is sent by dr office. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-16 12:42:14', '2024-07-16 12:42:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143060018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '7/16/24: Felicia called needing help finding a provider for a colonoscopy. I guided her to multiplan site and we together performed a search for her area. She was able to get a list of over 60 providers. I advised to call ahead of time and verify that whoever you choose is indeed in network. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-16 12:21:33', '2024-07-16 12:21:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000143054016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082626002', 'Leon Wisniewski', NULL, '7-16-24 Leo sent this to me to show the power of cash and knowledge. "Several months ago my wife has emergency gallbladder surgery.  She’s fine now and is fully recovered.  I get the bill from the hospital and see that they billed me the Multiplan rate of $31,000.  I know this is wrong because Multiplan shouldn’t be billed for catastrophic care, and I have the price transparency data and see the cash rates are much lower.  After several months of back-n-forth phone calls to the hospital to have them bill me the cash rate they finally do so.  The bill dropped to $7200.  I had it over to Zion and they pay immediately."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-16 12:15:06', '2024-07-16 12:15:06'),
