  ('zcrm_1579374000143019023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130297012', 'Lea Long', NULL, '07.16.2024 Spoke with Vanessa during a welcome call. Vanessa reordered. I messaged Kelly via Group Chat in Teams, and she said she''s already sent it twice, but will send it again. I suggested that she NOT send it the same way she''s been sending it, and try UPS or Fedex or other. 
