  ('zcrm_1579374000143019008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '07.16.2024 Maria needs additional PT, according to her physician. She is in the process of uploading the additional treatment plan and other pertaining documents. We reached out to Zion to better learn of our best options for this outlying situation. We spoke with Illana, who discussed uploading the documents, which Maria was doing, and waiting to hear back from the adjudicator, Jessica for a determination. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-16 08:51:54', '2024-07-16 08:51:54'),
