  ('zcrm_1579374000142951046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876167', 'Coreen (Cory) Nickerson', NULL, '7-15-24 Cory 58 and Mike Williams soon to be 60 are using LHS now and finally realize it''s time to switch. They are still owed about $6K. BCH is no longer willing to work with LHS. BCH is requesting Mericare rate +2.5X!  Mike has a surgery he wants to do and BCH wants $30K up front!!  He''s now looking at a different, affordable solution to his medical issue and understands he will have to pay for it on his own.  They are interested in Premium Care + HAB. They are interested in most of the wellness benefits. They are well aware of the pre-x clause. They are going to read the guidelines to make sure LHS will still pay them back their outstanding reimbursement once they cancel.  They are looking for Aug. 1st start date. Premium Care $1000/$575 or $1500/$507 + HAB $165 = $672 or $710.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-15 18:05:52', '2024-07-15 18:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142951041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '7-15-24 Carey removed me as her agent on C4. Not sure what she''s doing but I just called and left her a vm to check in. Not sure if it''s purposeful or a mistake.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-15 17:49:11', '2024-07-15 17:49:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142958056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141419020', 'Scott Lofgren', NULL, '07.15.2024 Scott called trying to get set up on CirrusMD. He is not being recognized when he tries to register.
We went over his plan and how to maneuver, preventive, prescriptions, labwork, and everyone''s account on CirrusMD.
He is sending me the remaining emails for everyone to add onto to CirrusMD. I''m putting in a ticket to CirrusMD to help them get registered. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-15 17:48:34', '2024-07-15 17:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142951031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169148037', 'Nicole Duke', NULL, '7-15-24 Nicole is 50 and came to me via Jessica Hall Muniz. Nicole''s 2nd email is nicoleduke74@gmail.com.  She''s 50 and daughter 15. She''s self-employed as a real estate agent.  Yes, seeks alternative care such as through Jessica Muniz Hall. She hasn''t done her wellness visits since her current private ins is too confusing to use. She does the following dental cleanings, vision ?, gym yes for yoga and ski pass, nutrition No, mental health yes, skin check no, mammo yes, pap yes, colonoscopy yes, labs yes, immunizations no. She''s curious the cost for her alone and for her and daughter. Since she''s 50, I quoted Premium Care $285/1000 or $254/$1500 and HAB $200 EC or $107 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-15 17:30:10', '2024-07-15 17:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142951021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152311057', 'Daniel Richardson', NULL, '7-15-24 Dan is 51 and came to me via Julie Oldham. He''s looking to start his own biz around the 1st of the year 2025. He has mild allergies and a back issue he''s taking care of with PT and yoga. Not a problem! He lives in Carbondale, CO area. So, Premium Care and HAB are best for his age and location. He doesn''t take meds, no to typical vax he does a heart artery scan due to family history but no problem. I told him to review his records if he''s concerned there''s anything on there.  He doesn''t have symptoms of anything.  He does his wellness visits, dental cleanings, vision screening maybe, gym with yoga, nutiotional health, no, colonoscopy yes, labs yes.  I shared Premium Care $1000/$285 or $1500/$254 + HAB $107 = $392 or $361.  He will let me know as he moves forward with his own biz.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-15 17:12:26', '2024-07-15 17:12:26'),
