  ('zcrm_1579374000142889021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659050', 'Beth Bryant', NULL, '07.12.2024 Needs to find a gastroenterologist for a colonoscopy. Looking for guidance to better narrow the list down. I guided her to use HCBB after she generates a list from the Multiplan Link. She also wants to know if there''s a limit  or cap on how much the cost of the colonoscopy should be. She will need to talk to Planstin about that part, and will do so after she chooses a physician. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-12 10:44:08', '2024-07-12 11:15:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142889013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140157002', 'Joy Garvey', NULL, '07.12.2024 Joy called and left us a VM to cancel her membership. I called her back to learn she does not know who her advisor is, just said Wiley Long. So that was hard to transfer to an advisor, then I guided her to the cancellation form on MPB.Health. I told her we are sorry to see her go, and was everything alright. She said she qualified for government benefits, which most likely will be kicked off by the end of the year, and she will most likely come back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-12 10:07:42', '2024-07-12 10:08:47'),
