  ('zcrm_1579374000142885011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, '7/12/24: Brent states that he is currently in Mexico and had an injury and needs an immediate knee replacement (even though there is a previous note from March asking about opening a request for knee replacement which leads me to believe it is not). 
He submitted request and was denied due to it being a provider in Mexico. Brent filed an appeal which was also denied. 
