  ('zcrm_1579374000142815071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '7/12/24: Stephany called. She is planning to move overseas and also has an open maternity request, and wondering if she should wait to move until after she has the baby, or can she give birth outside the US. 
