  ('zcrm_1579374000142815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113500001', 'Diana Albrecht', NULL, '7/11/24: Diana emailed in again stating that she has not received the cancellation link email and this is the third time she''s had to ask for it.
However, according to her account - it was opened on her end 7/1
Sent form link in reply to her email apologizing for any inconvenience.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-11 07:15:26', '2024-07-11 07:15:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142770023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', NULL, '07.10.2024 Stephanie called inquiring about ivf being shareable or not and if she can save on labwork. We went through the zion guidelines together and learned that they do not share any testing or treatments of IVF but they do share the pregnancy result of it. I also sent her discounted lab sites to peruse. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-10 16:47:42', '2024-07-10 16:47:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142770018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126559001', 'Michael Duffy', NULL, '07.10.2024 Michael called to cancel his membership due to a employment offering benefits. I guided him to the MPB cancellation form. He was hoping to get reimbursed a pro-rated amount for the rest of  July, give his present benefits have already started this month. I told him I have not experienced the billing department to practice that with cancellations, but to try to put the inquiry in the comment box, and try to give us a call back tomorrow and ask for Patti our member services/billing department. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-10 16:32:45', '2024-07-10 16:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142770013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904304', 'Katherine Waller', NULL, '07.10.2024 "Hello MPB Fam ?,

I''ll try to be brief with this billing situation in bullet form. Member has been seeking reimbursement for the amount charged in January, $702.08

Member: Katherine Waller
Plan: Provider Director - Redirect
Cancellation Form submitted 1/23/2024 = COMPLETED
Was still billed and has been attempting to get reimbursed since January.
Her efforts in date correspondence via phone are
1/16 x2
5/8
6/10
Each time she spoke with someone, she shared, they told her that they will bring this up to a higher level to connect with her ~
No one contacted her.
At the beginning of the call, we 99% established that she most likely was NOT calling MPB, given two factors:
The last person she spoke with finally told her that she needs to contact us here at MPB.
There are no notes in her CRM file, aside from the last one from Patti, documenting the cancellation.
Katherine is still seeking reimbursement - unfortunately, she was given the run around by various other parties, and IDK who it was. EDUCATIONNALLY guessing, I''m thinking someone at Redirect.
Although her experience has been unpleasant, Katherine was pleasant, patient and receptive.

Due to her previous experience with the other calls, I told her that tomorrow morning, if she were to call in on this same line, Angee would answer, and she can ask to speak to Patti (sorry Patti - not meaning to volunteer you). If not, most likely, Patti would reach out to her to help either resolve or shed light on the issue. 

I apologize in advance for volunteering any of you, I tried to keep it open with the ball on her court as much as I could. 
At the end of the call, she was much better at ease and hopeful than when she first called in.

I''m back tomorrow at 12ET. 



Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969"', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-10 14:47:02', '2024-07-10 14:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142778011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '7-10-24 I missed my appt with Martha while on phone with my bank to damage control identity theft. I just left her a vm and I sent her an email. We just need to finalize making a change for her 26 year old. We need to remove him and re-enroll into CARE+ $240/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-10 13:30:20', '2024-07-10 13:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142778003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '7-10-24 Etta chose to drop Redirect since they are tough to work with and added HAB instead for Aug. 1st.  Nothing else has changed. She''s excited to try this and avoid the struggles with Redirect. She''s been very happy with Sedera.  They are paying $1047.28 for PDHC. They will now pay $737.25 SDHC and $250 HAB = $987.25 with 2 separate payments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-10 13:24:14', '2024-07-10 13:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142770008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125340012', 'Wesley Burke', NULL, '07.10.2024 Expanded on Angee''s response to Wes'' inquiry on getting benefits for weight loss medication. Responded via Outlook.

"Greetings Wes,

Thank you for reaching out to us here at the concierge. 

Unfortunately, Angee was called to a personal matter. 
I''m stepping in to expand on the information she shared with you.

Regarding weight loss medication and having its cost shared with Zion, it falls in the same terminology from Zion''s guidelines.

I.E.: Wegovy costs at least ~$350.00 per injection for the lowest dosage of .25, and most members who have requested this, have shared a prescription of a total of 4 to cover a whole month of 1/week injections. This can bring costs up to at least $1300.00. That''s if the dosage is the lowest.

With the example of pricing above on Wegovy and the guidelines from Zion that Angee shared, you will see that Zion will share (once determined shareable), the $300 of the $1300, for the first month, and up to $3000 total to using Wegovy, for the remaining of the months. 

I hope this helped clarify your curiosity, and of course each medication would be administered differently and cost differently. Please note, Wegovy is just an example of what has been requested by our members in the past.

If you have any questions left on this matter or other, we are here at the concierge line M-F, 9-8pm, ET. 

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969"                                                                     NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-10 12:46:32', '2024-07-10 12:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142765013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt Update Form.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-07-10 11:43:58', '2024-07-10 11:43:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142772023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '7/10/24: Holland called back asking how to use Cirrus for her dependent. I advised to add her under family settings of app before starting conversation with doctor.
