  ('zcrm_1579374000142772013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '7/10/24: Holland called asking how to access her telehealth. I guided her to CirrusMD on the web browser checked if she was registered - which she was. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-10 11:30:26', '2024-07-10 11:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125340012', 'Wesley Burke', NULL, '7/10/24: Member inquired about weight loss coverage via email:
