  ('zcrm_1579374000142670046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '7/9/24: Called Corinne in response to her missed chat and informed her that they will be receiving an email with instructions on how to remove herself from plan. They were interested in changing the plan to lower the costs and I said they are welcome to do that, just be aware that to make financial changes to the plan, it has to be done before the 19th of the month. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-09 12:00:36', '2024-07-09 12:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142644039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '07.09.2024 Carey put in an RX Request:
