  ('zcrm_1579374000142644034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '07.09.2024 Stephany called to learn how to proceed with her new pregnancy, and to include a midwife in the process. I attempted to do a 3-way, as Stephany preferred, with Zion. However when Amber answered, she immediately requested to have the member speak to her directly. We ended the 3-way call and Amber promised to call Stephany back with the number that Stephany shared with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-09 10:26:26', '2024-07-09 10:26:26'),
