  ('zcrm_1579374000142653023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, 'This member has been on the Direct membership with Sedera all along.  Per note of 1/26/23 I modified the Redirect pricing as there was an issue product in A123.  During the audit in 10/23 price was changed back to Redirect pricing.  Notes in A123 were overlooked.  I went back over the billing and came up with a figure that member needs to be reimbursed.  This is $2535.  Karina will be processing and sending to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-07-09 10:18:37', '2024-07-09 10:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142644029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104973012', 'Lynne Howard', NULL, '07.09.2024 Adam called with Lynn to learn in detail what to do now that Adam needs to have a knee replacement. I walked him through the sharing request process, the IUA options - since it is a planned surgery, the 6 month deadlines, RX requests and any alternative therapies needed afterwards.
We briefly went over the process for any pre-X conditions, and connecting Zion with the medical team that is performing the procedure. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-07-09 10:16:46', '2024-07-09 10:16:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142670023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '7/9/24: Ryan called. He recently cracked a back tooth and wondering if that is something he can submit as a sharing request. I read the Zion guidelines to him regarding dental and informed him that it would come down to how the tooth was cracked and that dental procedures resulting from an accident or injury can be considered eligible. He''s going to submit a sharing request to see. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-09 10:11:42', '2024-07-09 10:11:42'),
