  ('zcrm_1579374000142644021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139165008', 'Kelvin Yip', NULL, '07.09.2024 Kelvin called to learn how to proceed with anything preventive services. I walked him thru the PHCS network, what to do &amp; what NOT to do at the appointments, preventive vs. cash-pay visits, learning about providers, the MAP program, CirrusMD and RX Requests.
