  ('zcrm_1579374000142366003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '7-3-24 Susan''s daughter needs her wisdom teeth taken out and they think their current plan with the pediatric dental will cover the wisdom teeth. Their dental plan will only cover $1000 and they think UHC will cover much more. I''m not sure of this. But, she will find out for sure. They have the appt scheduled for Aug. 7th already.  Her daughter is 18 now and her DOB is in March. ACA looks to cover up to age 19, ie. through all of their 18th year. Once she finds out if it''s covered this will determine if they join Premium HSA for Aug. 1st or Sept. 1st for EF. This will help for compliance with CU and give the gives their wellness screenings. They will also add HAB for the two adults since they live in the mtns and the network is a challenge. But, they can also get their skin checks, vision, dental, annual mammo, ski pass reimbursed. The only decision now is the start date and she''ll keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-07-03 10:40:31', '2024-07-03 10:40:31'),
