  ('zcrm_1579374000142306058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '7/2/24: Axel Livingston called, said he just had a telehealth appt be of dizziness and heart palpitations. The Cirrus Dr recommended he get blood work done and have an EKG. I guided him to HCBB to find a local Dr, advised to call the nearest PCP and see if those services can be done there and if not, ask for facility recommendations. In HCBB, the only facilities pulling up for EKG were hospitals. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-02 15:40:46', '2024-07-02 15:40:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142306053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086948001', 'Bradford Winship', NULL, '7/2/24: Janet called. Her husband Bradford cut his finger and went to urgent care and she''s wondering if he needs to present a card. I advised to have him present as self-pay, no card - discussed IUA and submitting a sharing request if need be. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-02 15:36:13', '2024-07-02 15:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142306048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133668002', 'Alastair Cross', NULL, '7/2/24: John called with several questions. He needed to access his telehealth. I began his registration while we were on the phone, and instructed him to follow the link in his email from Cirrus md to complete the sign up process. 
