  ('zcrm_1579374000142287031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '7-2-24 Liz''s account looks to be charged wrong. It shows her next billing is $518.78 but she''s been getting billed at $508.59 with a cc. This makes no sense at all. We haven''t made changes to her account recently either.  I''m waiting to hear back from Patti.
