  ('zcrm_1579374000142229023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118740002', 'Deven Hazelbaker', NULL, '7/1/24: Deven called having issues getting into her member portal to access telehealth. I advised that they are actually two different things and guided her on how to get into CirrusMD. She already had the app on her phone and was able to access. As for her MPB member portal, I offered to provide her with her login credentials, but she wasn''t interested since all she wanted to do was use Cirrus. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 09:47:31', '2024-07-01 09:47:31'),
