  ('zcrm_1579374000142229018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '7/1/24: Maria called asking how to access her telehealth. I advised she could access CirrusMD either through their app or a web browser and navigated her to the web address. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 09:22:07', '2024-07-01 09:22:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142229013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129893002', 'Clayton Roberts', NULL, '7/1/24: Clayton called. He''s in the hospital and wondering what to do about submitting a need. I advised that he does have 6 months from date of service,  so there''s no rush to do it now and that after his IUA of 5K is met, the remaining expenses can be eligible for sharing. trans to Zion to create member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 08:55:08', '2024-07-01 08:55:08'),
