  ('zcrm_1579374000142202031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141419020', 'Scott Lofgren', NULL, '7/1/24: Scott called asking for his login for app. I advised that he would create a unique username and password. He was able to register successfully. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 08:15:35', '2024-07-01 08:15:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142202026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608265', 'Trina Donahue', NULL, '7/1/24: Trina called asking how to start a need. She had an accident, which resulted in xrays, a cast and followup appointment with an orthopedic dr. I educated her on how to 1. open her member porta, 2) collecting itemized bills and receipts for services, 3) meeting IUA before remainder can be shared, and 4) 6 month deadline to submit bills. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 08:03:32', '2024-07-01 08:03:32'),
