  ('zcrm_1579374000142202008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113500001', 'Diana Albrecht', NULL, '7/1/24: Diana sent in 2 emails on Friday (which didn''t come through to me until after 5 pm).
1. "My husband is taking a new job with health insurance included therefore, please cancel our policy on August 31, 2024. Our member number is 12252902. Please confirm with me that you have received this email and will follow up with this request. Thank you!"
2. "This is our second request. Please respond that you have received this. Thank you."

I sent Diana the cancellation form link and asked her to notify her advisor that she is cancelling. I informed her of the cutoff date for making financial changes to her account being the 19th, which would put her cancellation effective on 8/1/24. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-07-01 07:32:17', '2024-07-01 07:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142099087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, '06.28.2024 Anne-Marie called to learn why she is not able to access the MPB page/section in the FullScript platform. She was still under the impression that we are still only giving a 25%, and I informed her that JUST this morning, we learned of a bump up in that discount to 30%. She was excited, but when she logged in, she did not see MPB to choose from the selection of practitioners. I messaged the admin team via Teams General Chat where the new discount was posted. I asked if they can look at what the members are viewing when they sign in. Photo that Anne-Marie shared is attached here. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-28 15:42:35', '2024-06-28 15:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142099077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110165001', 'Sivagurunathan Kumaragovindan', NULL, '06.28.2024 Siv called to request his 1095C from last year. He said his acct asked for the 1095A, but I told him we only produce the C version. I did request it, as before, via the Loop Table in the Teams Group Chat. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-28 15:17:55', '2024-06-28 15:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142099069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '6/28/24: Mary Ann called. She stated that she submitted bills for a wellness visit and routine mammogram to zion in April, and hasn''t heard anything. 3-way called Zion to see what the hold up might be.

Chris from Zion looked into her account which said that a check and digital cc was already sent to her.
Check for mamm was sent April 19, 2024 for $259 & card sent May 6 for wellness visit. Mary Ann stated she never received either.
June (another processor) then came on to let Mary Ann know that she would need to wait for her talk to the accountant next week to check the status of the check sent before sending another check for mamm reimbursement, and they would go ahead and process another digital card to pay for the annual visit. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-28 14:08:44', '2024-06-28 14:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142158003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '06.28.24:  Called and spoke w/Mary Ann.  She said she submitted a sharing request for a mammogram and Zion declared it shareable but never sent her the reimbursement amount.  I told her to call our concierge to help her contact Zion and discuss it with the Needs Dept.  She said she would call today. I told her to keep me posted. She also said she spoke w/her friend Mary Anne Fleisher and she is still interested in hearing bout the plans.  Her husband has epilepsy but takes medication to control it. I told her I call M.A. Fleisher earlier today and left a message to call me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-28 13:29:35', '2024-06-28 13:29:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142099064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217082', 'Aaron Martin', NULL, '06.28.2024 Aaron called for his son Dominic who ended in the ER, bill = over $10K. I transferred him to Sedera to open a medical need NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-28 13:22:21', '2024-06-28 13:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000142099059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139449072', 'Joseph Globokar', NULL, '6/28/24: Joe called unable to register for Cirrus MD. Sent support ticket email to Cirrus and it has been resolved. He asked how to access medical records vault - I pointed him to the info on his card for how to access QR Life code. We discussed the fact that he wants to see a dr to manage medication - I explained with his plan, small dr visits are out of pocket. For prescriptions, I guided him to use the quote request form for us to search discounts, but unless the med is associated with. a need, there is no reimbursement for prescription costs. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-28 13:11:07', '2024-06-28 13:11:07'),
