  ('zcrm_1579374000142099023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122611002', 'Matthew Salvo', NULL, '6/28/24: matthew called. he recieved a huge bill from dr for wellness checkup and bloodwork.
He said he went in for a wellness check up, they prescribed blood pressure meds, and he went back to see if meds were working alright. The 2 visits totaled $1300 and $400 from quest for lab work. 
I advised he would need to speak to planstin to see if 1. The bill was actually sent to them, and 2. why the first visit wasn''t paid for - what codes were used and what codes should have been used.
Educated member on discount labs, the labs planstin will pay for and urged him to give us a call before he has another appointment or lab work and we can guide him to avoid surprise bills like this. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-28 10:40:02', '2024-06-28 10:40:02'),
