  ('zcrm_1579374000141986052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118107002', 'Erik Bjur', NULL, '06.26.2024 Erik called from a doctor''s office, when he was about to go into his appointment. He called to learn how to get his appointment covered. He was holding the MPB card. I asked him to search for the Planstin card in his email, he said he will go search for it and if he could not find it, he will call us again. After we hung up, I called Planstin anyways and asked them to send him a virtual card anyways, so he has it to use for the present appointment, just in case he did not find the original one. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-26 17:45:58', '2024-06-26 17:45:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141985049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '6-26-24 Daniela wants to join HAB for Aug or Sept. They are traveling now and will reach out upon their return.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-26 16:21:41', '2024-06-26 16:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141985044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '6-26-24 After asking for about 5-6 months to have Jennifer Abbott removed and refunded for Estefania Luna''s HMA account, I finally got help from Holly at HMA. Holly is requesting proof of Jennifer''s payment and admitted they''ve had troubles with the payments for small groups like this. Once she sees that Jennifer has paid, she can confirm whether or not Estefania has paid as well. I''m awaiting Jennifer''s response now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-26 16:12:55', '2024-06-26 16:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141985039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '6-26-24 Hello Sally,

