  ('zcrm_1579374000141985031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '6-26-24 Apparently Monique cancelled her account around 5/23/24 with about $2K in the account!  Holly with HMA is requesting for me to have Tina show proof of her payment to Monique''s account in order to process a refund.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-26 16:06:29', '2024-06-26 16:06:54'),
