  ('zcrm_1579374000141985013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '6-26-24 After months of back and forth texts and a few emails to Elliott Gorog with HMA, nothing has been resolved with Jim''s account. Holly from HMA called to today to help me with all of my clients after sounding the alarm bells with Geoff Kirk. Jim has been extraordinarily patient all of this time. Holly is telling him to ask his provider to resubmit the claim one more time. They do not need a QR code, they just need to submit it on the new portal with their NPI, EOB, itemized bill with codes and submit it similar to how they submit to ins. He will try one more time. Holly also revealed that they are working towards a resolution for manual submission of old bills as well.  But, it''s not set in stone yet, so we can only hope this is true.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-26 15:22:11', '2024-06-26 16:02:43'),
