  ('zcrm_1579374000141985003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6-26-24 Kristen and I will walk through the change form on July 8th to change from $1000 to $2500 IUA to keep the price from going to $905 and instead to $755. So, only a small price increase from the current $715. I got confirmation from Patti that they can keep their grandfathered pricing by simply changing the IUA for Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-26 10:16:59', '2024-06-26 10:16:59'),
