  ('zcrm_1579374000141943008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '06.25.24:  Called Mary Ann re: her window treatment service. She said she referred me to her friend, Mary Anne Fleisher about 1-1/2 mos. ago and told her to call me. I said I haven''t heard from her friend.  Mary Ann gave me her friend''s phone # and asked me to call her.  Also, Mary Anne still needs help w/her preventive care issue w/Zion. She asked me to call her at 3 p.m. this coming Friday to further discuss it. See notes below.  We need to review this issue and move ahead to resolve it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-26 09:28:31', '2024-06-26 09:28:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141945018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132290002', 'Tracy Zottola', NULL, '6/26/24: tracy called needing a quote for single person membership to show her place of employment. Transferred to Kirk. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-26 09:28:21', '2024-06-26 09:28:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141945013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '6/26/24: Risa called. Her daughter needs an xray on toe - I advised there are no network restrictions for an injury related service and they can go wherever. Risa said they would go to urgent care. She also said her daughter is going to camp and they need a card in case of emergencies. I said you can give them your MPB card but since it''s a healthshare, there is no card to present for billing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-26 09:24:04', '2024-06-26 09:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141942013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137105002', 'Christopher Ferritto', NULL, 'Note to Kirk about this member:
   Just got off the phone with Chris Ferritto who was surprised that he was billed for July and wanted to "push" his start date further to Aug or beyond.  He seemed a little unsure if he would be starting in Aug so I suggested to him that I could cancel him and that he could get back with you when he was sure about his start date.  He also put out there to start 6 mos from now.  Also seemed a little confused why we needed a start date.  I will send him the cancellation and will refund him all the $ that we charged him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-26 09:21:30', '2024-06-26 09:21:30'),
