  ('zcrm_1579374000141945008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132131011', 'Paul Mergener', NULL, '6/26/24: Tara called, she had a routine mammogram and now dr is wanting to do a second diagnostic one. I advised that this one is not covered in full, however, if it becomes an issue that will exceed your IUA - the bill can go towards your IUA and to keep an itemized bill from the visit. 
