  ('zcrm_1579374000141940003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089965012', 'Michele Palumbo', NULL, 'Sent an email to Jason Health to see if paying for the labs through them can be applied to reduce the bill from Quest. Michele (per my conversation with Nahla), has expressed rude and unempathetic behavior from Planstin regarding this issue. Will email Ashlee (Planstin) once I have more information.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-06-26 07:41:45', '2024-06-26 07:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141923008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141229002', 'Jessica Giles', NULL, '6-25-24 Hello Jessica,

Your Health Access Benefit is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your primary care, prescription, and preventive care.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using your Health Access Benefit.

Health Access Member ID: 522190912
Benefits Start Date: 07/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
There is no further action you need to take to activate these benefits. If you are ready to use your Health Access Benefit, instructions are included in your digital membership packet here.
