  ('zcrm_1579374000141905013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '06.25.2024 Carey has covid for the second time. Wanted to learn what her options are regarding seeing a doctor. I suggested to start with telehealth, CirrusMD, and if needed, go to the PCP in person. Sent her an email via CRM with a PHCS list and directions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-25 15:59:35', '2024-06-25 16:18:57'),
