  ('zcrm_1579374000141885059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075243068', 'Aaron Malusky', NULL, '06.25.2024 Aaron called to learn why does his prev sharing request with Zion that he visited in the last 30 days, say Sharing Request Closed - member action pending. We attempted to 3-way call Zion, extension 6 &amp; then 3, but both times they were unavailable. I guided him to give them an hour and call the back. I offered him their number and what to press. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-25 13:35:32', '2024-06-25 13:35:32'),
