  ('zcrm_1579374000141885041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '06.25.2024 Had questions regarding her plan:
husband needs a colonoscopy - did the box first.
Was concerned that Planstin will not cover. I explained that they will only pay for ONE colonoscopy and if they ran the box screening through Planstin, then Planstin would not pay for another one. Since, they did not and paid cash for the box screening, then Planstin owes them ONE colonoscopy. I explained what happens if they pull poylps; prev. vs. diag. Francoise understood and will call us back if she has anymore questions. She found her card in her email and will look for the hard copy afterwards. I sent her an email on the PHCS and finding a provider. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-25 12:42:33', '2024-06-25 12:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141879019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '6-25-24 Sally also just completed the Change Form again to update her address. I didn''t know it changed or we could have done it all at once on the previous change form. This will change immediately anyhow and the other changes were for Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-25 12:39:12', '2024-06-25 12:39:12'),
