  ('zcrm_1579374000141874039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136247002', 'Patrick Hanrahan', NULL, 'Member left VM wanting to cancel also had some questions.  I will send him out the Cancellation link and copy Lou.  I advised him of the deadline', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-25 12:35:06', '2024-06-25 12:35:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141879014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '6-25-24 Sally is removing Redirect, so changing from PDHC to SDHC for Aug. 1st when Pete is aging into Medicare. Sally''s new monthly membership contribution will be $447.15+$462.15 and adding HAB for $107 = $569.15. She curious about adding Pete to the HAB as well since he can join that at any age. She will decide by July 20th. She''s completed both steps.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-25 12:31:30', '2024-06-25 12:31:30'),
