  ('zcrm_1579374000141803008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '6/25/24: Melissa called to see if a tooth implant would be shareable. I advised no, according to Zion''s guidelines - only dental services caused by an incident would be eligible. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-25 08:09:18', '2024-06-25 08:09:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141803003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '6/24/24: Chris called, his wife and him are traveling to Greece and wanted to make sure their plan includes international services. I explained yes, the bill just needs to be translated into English before submitting. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-25 07:12:33', '2024-06-25 07:12:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141757091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '06.24.2024 Stephanie called straight from the colonoscopy facility in Maui, HI. She''s been through the ringer of using Planstin over there to cover the preventive appointment, and she wanted support to help explain and persuade the facility to at least call Planstin to learn about their ACA coverage. Isabelle at the facility got on the phone for me to speak to directly, I implored her to bypass the action of "participation", and connect with the TPA, Planstin to bill them and they will pay. Stephanie did say there aren''t any other facilities that she can go to, and she''s experiencing this exact hardship every single time.
Stephanie was there to have the consultation, but they are considering the $150 as a deposit, which I did not quiet understand whether the deposit is towards the actual procedure or will the consultation cost more than that.
PRESENTLY, I told Stephanie that I will document this entire experience, call her back tomorrow and do a 3-way call with Planstin to better learn of our options in this situation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-24 17:23:09', '2024-06-24 17:23:09'),
