  ('zcrm_1579374000141780003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001409011', 'Karen Frame', NULL, '6-24-24 Karen''s job ended 6-18-24 bc her employer was going to lower her pay if she chose a health insurance plan through them. She wasn''t in agreement with that, so they terminated her. So, brutal!  She just applied for unemployment last week and she will get around $700 per week, $36,400 annually and Sam is getting about $600 a month in SS income. Somehow the system totaled it to $48,600. But, Karen didn''t know Sam''s Medicare information that they are asking for, ie. if he enrolled in Part A and B and how much those cost per month. She is also working on getting a termination letter on letterhead from her employer to show proof of her SEP. She has until June 28th to get this all done which she knows.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-24 12:11:04', '2024-06-24 12:11:04'),
