  ('zcrm_1579374000141728008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132122001', 'Margo Kakoullis', NULL, '6/24/24: Margo called, She''s getting an MRA and wants to make sure it is covered. From the planstin outline of co-pay plan - I explained it only lists MRI, not MRA and to ask Planstin directly about this service. We checked to see if the imaging place was in network which it wasn''t. After I explained that planstin will pay out of network, she went on to ask tons of hypothetical questions about pricing which I did my best to answer, but eventually transferred to Planstin so she could be certain about billing and whether an  MRA is covered. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-24 09:02:39', '2024-06-24 09:02:39'),
