  ('zcrm_1579374000141708003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121653002', 'Christina Darding', NULL, '6/24/24: Christina called over the weekend asking how navigate payment for an ER visit. I left her a detailed voice mail explaining that in the case of an ER visit, she would present as a self pay patient, and later submit bills for reimbursement after her IUA has been met. Advised if she''d like to discuss further to give us a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-24 07:17:38', '2024-06-24 07:17:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141677128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141680058', 'Miguel Guzman', NULL, '6-20-24 They finished the enrollment successfully once they decided who would pay and how they''d get reimbursed. All set for a July 1st start date! Secure HSA with RCI, ES $578.40. Melissa McDowell should also receive the $100 referral free.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-21 16:21:22', '2024-06-21 16:21:22'),
