  ('zcrm_1579374000141638223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130566063', 'Cindy Ensman', NULL, '6/21/24: Cindy called, she has a fractured ankle and getting surgery next week. I advised to go ahead and start a sharing request with the bills she has so far, to let zion know how quickly it''s coming up and if there is anyway they can speed up the determination, and to get an estimate from surgery center to submit - that way hopefully she can get funds ahead of time. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 14:19:04', '2024-06-21 14:19:04'),
