  ('zcrm_1579374000141677038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503001', 'Hailey Klepcyk', NULL, 'spoke to mbr directly and let her know we received her cancellation and asked how her experience was, said that it was fine and she had got a new job that was offering cigna health insurance which she enrolled in, emailed referral', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-21 14:10:09', '2024-06-21 14:10:09'),
