  ('zcrm_1579374000141638208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '6/21/24: Jason called, the surgery center wants him to pay up front. Cost today is 7K, cost later is 11K. He spoke to Zion to get advice and they said go ahead, pay the 7k and submit as a need - no guarantees but VERY optimistic about it being shared. I STRONGLY emphasized to be certain that this is not a pre-ex condition and there is nothing in your records that could point to it being pre-ex. That''s the only thing that could make it ineligible. Jason stated that the doctor said it is absolutely not related to his cataract surgery from over 10 years ago. 
I gave jason the same advice, to go ahead and then submit for sharing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 13:12:37', '2024-06-21 13:12:37'),
