  ('zcrm_1579374000141638174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '6/21/24: Doug called. He''s having issues with his knee (see note above). I advised him to go ahead and open a sharing request, and educated him on his IUA amount, how to present at upcoming appointments and what type of paperwork to collect for office visits and surgery if need be. Transferred to Zion to get his member portal set up and urged him to call the Concierge line if he needs any assistance through this process. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 12:51:24', '2024-06-21 12:51:24'),
