  ('zcrm_1579374000141677028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '6-21-24 Doug is having some new knee pain and wants to follow the proper path to get it resolved. He''s picked out his Dr. He''s confirmed this is brand new, Not pre-x. It just started causing him problem in the last few weeks but it''s mirroring his mom''s knee problem where she needed a knee replacement. Obviously he doesn''t want that to be the case, so he''s addressing it as quickly as possible.  I gave him the MPB Concierge # to call and start the process. I suggested he gets it pre-approved if he needs any kind of surgery to be safe. He said 100% there''s nothing on his record since he hasn''t had any issues until very recently.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-21 12:35:56', '2024-06-21 12:35:56'),
