  ('zcrm_1579374000141638125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '6/21/24: Andy called still not able to access his member portal. He''s not showing in A123 at all, I asked if I could give him a call back after investigating further. We also discussed accessing Fullscript and he asked about Zion''s new RX feature. 

