  ('zcrm_1579374000141638115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '6/21/24: Allyson needs an MRI done, Called and LVM stating that I understand she is looking for a place to have an MRI done, and if she still needs assistance to give us a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 10:51:51', '2024-06-21 10:51:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/21/24: Denise called asking for Zion card for hospital. Julia and I both informed her there is no card, but she can access her member ID inside the member portal. 

Concepcions diagnosis is Nutcracker syndrome, also known as left renal vein entrapment, is a rare vascular compression disorder that occurs when arteries squeeze the left renal vein, causing venous congestion in the left kidney and distal structures. This compression can cause blood to flow backward, making veins swell and causing symptoms like pain and bloody urine.

I asked Denise to AGAIN - call back after she receives the determination letter from ZIon. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 10:27:26', '2024-06-21 10:27:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', 'Decline of 7/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 6/21
6/25-Member submitted update Payment info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-21 10:18:50', '2024-06-25 10:27:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141643018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139588001', 'Emily Ward', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-06-21 10:04:06', '2024-06-21 10:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045585130', 'Angela MacDonald', NULL, '6/21/24: Angela called asking how to update her payment method requesting an email with the link and if varicose veins are shareable. I emailed the link and advised that according to Zion''s guidelines, yes - but they are subject to pre-ex cond clause which means only after second year of membership and financial phase in period. I trans to Zion so she could open her member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 09:57:44', '2024-06-21 09:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745035', 'Deborah Stoffel', 'Decline of 7/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 6/21
2nd notice sent to member &amp; advsior via em - 6/27
7/1 - member submitted Payment Update form.  I will rerun pmt declined
7/8- I have not heard anything from this member after her pmt declined and sent her final notice.  I will cancel. x', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-21 09:54:49', '2024-07-08 12:35:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '6/21/24: Jason called, he''s having a surprise surgery for detached retina today and asking how to present, especially if they want all the money up front. I advised him to present as cash pay and ask for a cash pay discount, say you are part of a medical cost sharing community that will be paying for the surgery after his $1000 IUA is met, and to tell them you can pay $1000 today. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 09:54:19', '2024-06-21 09:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246087', 'Ann Wiley', 'Decline of 7/24 Share Amount', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 6/21', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-21 09:42:13', '2024-06-21 09:42:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921456', 'Joe LeFebre', 'Decline of 7/24 Share Amount', '1st notice to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm - 6/21', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-21 09:17:01', '2024-06-21 09:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141638067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6/21/24: Kristen called - husband having neck pain and visited urgent care who recommended physical therapy. She asked if there are any network restrictions on that. They can go wherever they want and open a sharing request like normal, however there are $$ restrictions on therapeutic care, $7500 or total of 35 visits. It seemed like they had someone in mind, but reminded Kristen that she has access to HCBB to help find a physician and we can help them search that if need be. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-21 09:11:09', '2024-06-21 09:11:09'),
