  ('zcrm_1579374000141638008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110424026', 'David Waters', NULL, 'I received VM from this member who wanted to know why he wasn''t cancelled.  I looked back and he did submit a form requesting a 4/24 cancellation, however it was marked as "completed" but never processed.  I will cancel member eff 6/30 and refund May, June &amp; July when funds become available.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-21 07:44:56', '2024-06-21 08:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141591074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '06.20.2024 Hillary called about MPB app &amp; FullScript. Hillary also asked about her son''s open sharing request with Zion: blood work, specialists, alternative therapies....
