  ('zcrm_1579374000141617033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141680058', 'Miguel Guzman', NULL, '6-20-24 6-20-24 Melissa called to determine how to pay for Mindi and Miguel Guzman''s membership as their 1st employee on the membership. I left a vm and let her know it has to be either their full payment method or the employee''s and they can reimburse as they choose. Mindi will text me when she reaches Melissa again. Working towards July 1st start date and know today is the deadline. I told her I think it''s 10:00 EST so 7:00 PST. She''s doing her best to reach Melissa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-20 16:05:11', '2024-06-20 16:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141617028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103567009', 'Melissa McDowell', NULL, '6-20-24 Melissa called to determine how to pay for Mindi and Miguel Guzman''s membership as their 1st employee on the membership. I left a vm and let her know it has to be either their full payment method or the employee''s and they can reimburse as they choose. Mindi will text me when she reaches Melissa again. Working towards July 1st start date and know today is the deadline. I told her I think it''s 10:00 EST so 7:00 PST.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-20 16:04:49', '2024-06-20 16:04:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141617023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, '6-20-24 Allisyn completed the SECURE HSA to Premium HSA Change Form and chose the $1500 IUA. Nobody in the family has any pre-x at all!  Her price was changing from $731.50 to $931.50 I think. So, I offered her Premium HSA and that gave them the $1500 IUA option to make the monthly $860 instead. So, they chose that option and she knows it''s back to Sedera where they initially began. She is carrying out her wellness visit with Planstin in the next week. Then she knows as of July 1st she will be using a new card for wellness but it''s the same PHCS network. She''s happy with that. She wants to open and fund the HSA and do the ACA wellness as needed for family.  HAB wasn''t a good fit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-20 15:48:17', '2024-06-20 15:48:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141591061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '06.20.2024 Met with Joan via Teams to learn more about the OPD. Some of the items she shared are:
1- Members should not pay extra for appointments. The DPC is part of the membership. 
2- Membership included: MCS + DPC + Essentials
3- Patient is able to see the doctor anytime
4- Most services come with the membership, it is key to discuss these details with the provider.
5- May nominate a provider into the network that Primary Partners generated for DPCs.

Quentin is going to speak to his provider, who Joan found to be Dr. Varesh Patel at Winter Park Family Practice. He will need to explain that seeing him for either preventive OR primary, is part of the DPC 
 part of the membership. He is also going to connect with the Primary Partners firm to inform them of Dr. Patel''s approach with DPC members.

I emailed Quentin the labwork discounted sites and Primary Partners website.    NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-20 15:41:15', '2024-06-20 15:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141591046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140468002', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, '06.20.2024 Leanne called to see if she can get us to either resend the RCI virtual card, or at least type out the information on the card and email it, b/c what she has now is not legible. I told her that I would message the office and they will get to it first thing tomorrow morning. I messaged Kelly to send the information to Angee, so she can email it to Leanne. In turn, Leanne can call the provider and give them her information. Leanne needed to call the doctor TODAY to make the appointment for July. I told her to ask them if it is ok that she calls them tomorrow with that information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-20 15:25:20', '2024-06-20 15:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141617013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '6-20-24 Cameron is pretty well past her appendix rupture and she wanted to review her membership. But, it doesn''t make sense to move her with this health issue still finalizing. She also uses a ton of the wellness benefits. She prefers to move to HAB and drop Redirect. She didn''t realize that it included chiro. But, either way, she will use the wellness benefits for all the normal items plus skin checks, dental screenings, vision check, mammo, mental health, gym and is open to using the nutrition counseling since it''s included. Yes, she prefers alternative doctors. The cost will be nearly identical but she''s paying for all of these other things on her own already. So, this will save her a bunch of money since she can get reimbursed for all of these items. She completed the change for and moved from PDHC to SDHC. New price will be $499.65 for Self-Directed and $200 for HAB EC = $699.65. This will take effect July 1st. She also prefers alternative doctors.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-20 14:38:33', '2024-06-20 14:38:33'),
