  ('zcrm_1579374000141525021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '06.19.2024 Husband needs hearing aids and wanted to know if there are discounts or benefits for them. I checked the guidelines on Zion''s website, and they do deem the aids unshareable.
She wanted to confirm the process of colonoscopy, screening vs. diagnostic, and I explained how both scenarios would play out.
Lastly, her husband also needs to have gum replacement and wanted to know if Zion would share. I checked the guidelines again, but did not see anything there for that - so I transferred her to Zion to  ask:
1- Is it considered a medical health issue or just dental?
2- Would this be shareable by Zion?                   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-19 15:03:50', '2024-06-19 15:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141525016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109512002', 'Gabrian McPhail', NULL, '06.19.2024 Gabrian called trying to attain the information on her newly acquired MEC plan card with RCI. She was unable to get a hold of the number/email  that is in the email sent to her, with the virtual card that she shares is not legible. I reached out to Patti to see if she can resend it, .....', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-19 14:36:01', '2024-06-19 14:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141525008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618002', 'McKinley Frazier', NULL, '06.19.2024 Mckinley is following up on a sharing request that has been determined eligible for sharing, but still says "pending on IUA", even though she paid the physician her IUA amount and uploaded the receipt and itemized bill. I transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-19 14:02:01', '2024-06-19 14:02:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141525003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '06.19.2024 Quentin called to learn how exactly does he maneuver an annual wellness visit on his plan.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-19 13:57:09', '2024-06-19 14:04:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '06.19.24:  Emailed Barry to let him know Jude Hebert enrolled in MPB yesterday and if he keeps the membership for a min. of 60 days, Barry will receive a $100 referral fee.  I also asked to set up a brief call w/him to catch up on how he is doing w/his plan and answer any questions he may have. I asked him to let me know if he''s interested in doing so.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-19 13:22:13', '2024-06-19 13:22:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141522003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132757014', 'Michelle Beckman', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 7/24 citing financial reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-19 13:21:15', '2024-06-19 13:21:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141469003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '6-18-24 I talked with Patti and Sandy is not on Redirect. She''s on the membership with a DPC. Patti recommended I have her complete a change form to get a significant price decrease!  We will move her from MPB Direct to Direct DPC Care. Price will go from $907.28 to $662.28 at the $1500 IUA level 60-64. I left Sandy a vm to call me and I will walk her through the Change Form to get this done by June 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-19 13:04:54', '2024-06-19 13:04:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141405008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, '6/19/24: Snatam called to get therapist joined to MSEAP network, I explained the process and transferred her directly to MAP. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 12:52:04', '2024-06-19 12:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141405003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/19/24: Denise called to give MPB updates on what''s going on with concepcion''s need. 
Surgeon said they don''t have the skills to help Concepcion, that the last 2 surgeries they did for this did not go well and they don''t want to put her through that at 19. 
Surgeon referred her to another Dr at the University of Wisconsin Hospital, and advised the family to not trust anyone else to do this procedure.

Concepcion is going to a CT renal study with contrast and lab work, and to meet with this surgeon Dr. Foley at U of WI. 

They HAVE NOT received an official determination from Zion yet about lifting the pre-ex cap, but Denise stated that Zion (Jayden) said they were doing everything they can to lift it.

All previous bills have been paid for.

I reassured Denise that even if they don''t lift the cap there are other options to explore such as Zion''s additional giving fund and MPB''s debt relief program which is dependent on the hospital and other factors. Hospital is University of Wisconsin. 
And to please call us once she receives the official determination.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 12:02:11', '2024-06-19 12:02:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141338043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084642013', 'Nicole Pietramale', NULL, 'I held off on the Change of IUA because I realized that her spouse had just turned 50 so the Share Amount would be $520.  Members spoke with Karen and then decided to cancel.  I deleted the Change From and will process the Cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-19 11:56:48', '2024-06-19 11:56:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141360028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '6/19/24: Melanie called needing assistance with her HMA account. She asked if there is anyone else she could speak to other than HMA directly bc she seems to be getting nowhere. I advised reaching out to her advisor. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 11:21:31', '2024-06-19 11:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141391003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141390002', 'Michael Earle', NULL, '6-19-24 Talked with Christina first and she said Mike is most concerned about what happens if he needs ER while in Mexico. I called Select Health and spoke with Francesca. She stated that all international scenarios including Mexico, the patient must pay the full cost out of pocket and then they will reimburse later which takes 30-45 days. So, as a self-pay patient with MCS he at a little less of a risk bc they won''t jack up the rates like they do when insurance is involved. He''s more apt to be paid much quicker with MCS vs ins.  Once I let him know that with both options, he needs to pay the cost of the visit he chose MCS since it''s better benefits at half the price. He also chose Premium Care over HSA since he rarely uses those services so not worth the extra money. He chose $1000/$285!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-19 11:04:13', '2024-06-19 11:04:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141360018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '6/19/24: Chris called regarding an email he got from Wendy mentioning access to discounted supplements. I navigated Chris to the section on website where he could access Fullscript and helped him log into the site. Explained that he gets free shipping on orders over $50 and 25% off orders. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 11:00:32', '2024-06-19 11:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141360013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459009', 'Skye Harry', NULL, '6/19/24: Martin called asking how to use current counselor with MPB plan. I gave him info on how the process works through MAP for a new counselor to join their network, and advised him to call MAP to ask if she is currently in network and to reach out if not. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 10:26:47', '2024-06-19 10:26:47'),
