  ('zcrm_1579374000141272029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '6/19/24: Member called. She''s having veining on legs and some bruising and interested in seeing someone about it. I asked if she knew what kind of specialist she wanted to see. She didn''t and does not have a pcp. I reccomended using CirrusMD first as they can give advice on what to do next, and if after that she needs help finding a PCP or Specialist, then give us a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 08:46:48', '2024-06-19 08:46:48'),
