  ('zcrm_1579374000141272011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089150002', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, '6/19/24: Erin called needing help understanding the plan as she is taking their daughter to an initial consult and well-visit. I explained when to use Planstin opposed to Medical Cost Sharing and how to present. We also discussed using discount lab sites, and understanding the reference numbers on the cards. I advised that while I''m happy to discuss general info about the plan and how to use it, for more detailed information and in the future, she will need to fill out a "permission to discuss plan" form. Called Joseph to let him know that in order for Erin to call and speak to the Concierge about their plan information, he would need to fill out a permission to discuss MPB.health membership plan and emailed the form. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-19 07:57:38', '2024-06-19 08:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141260096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135360002', 'William Goodrich', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-06-19 07:47:51', '2024-06-19 07:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '6-18-24 I sent Sandra and email to let her know her membership will increase by $30 for June 20th billing for July membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 20:05:43', '2024-06-18 20:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141289038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140532038', 'Loreen Costa', NULL, '6/18/24: Loreen called wanting to know what and when to expect onboarding info. I informed her that her fulfillment letter was mailed out on the 13th, and she should get an email from Zion. Also, Once she receives all her paperwork, we''ll reach out and schedule an orientation call to make sure she get registered for the different services and knows how to use them. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-18 17:13:40', '2024-06-18 17:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, '6-18-24 I left a vm for Rachel about the $25 price increase and we can make changes if need be to bring her price down. I told her to call me by the 20th to do so for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 16:40:20', '2024-06-18 16:40:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191499', 'Christopher Nolder', NULL, '6-18-24 I sent a text to Chris about the price increase of $25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 16:36:47', '2024-06-18 16:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, '6-18-24 I spoke with Stacey and  told him the membership contribution is increasing by $35 for MF for the next billing on June 20th for July membership. I asked about both emails and they are both still good. So, I''m leaving it alone. He was very appreciative of my call and all is well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 16:34:09', '2024-06-18 16:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, '6-18-24 Teresa has had a brutal year so far that she''s now recovering from. Her brother died in March and then her husband had a vasal vagal event which made him unconscious for 40 min!  He''s ok now and learning how to get around again on the bus, etc. She is joining HAB. She''s doing a ton of the wellness benefits right away just by chance. Her vision appt is too soon, in June. So, she''ll pay for that out of her Aflac membership. She will pay for many items out of her HSA and she knows by removing Planstin MEC that it''s no longer HSA compliant moving forward. But, she can fund it now and use the money in it. We completed the application process for HAB $107 and billed on 1st of the month and cancelled Planstin MEC. So, $284 + $107 = $391 July 1st onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 15:45:54', '2024-06-18 15:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141289033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '6/18/24: Celeste from P informed me that Jason has beeen successfully enrolled with a start date of June 1. I called and LVM letting him know that the issue is resolved and he should be able to call Zion and get his sharing request set up. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-18 15:26:47', '2024-06-18 15:26:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141239081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, '06.18.2024 Snatam left a message on the site regarding nominating a therapist. I called her and left her a vm to call the number for M&amp;S, I shared the number, and told her to tell them that she wants to nominate a therapist and they will walk her through it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 15:12:53', '2024-06-18 15:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141239066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, '06.18.2024 Marianne called to ask about Jack''s situation and how to present. I explained that we agreed for him to go to Urgent Care and present as a cash pay patient. 
Marianne then asked how to proceed for a preventive mammography appt. I told her that I will generate a list in her area for facilities and send her an instructional email on PHCS, MultiPlan Link and Healthcare.GOV. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 14:58:09', '2024-06-18 14:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269243', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964297', 'Brooke Bangart', NULL, 'reached out to mbr to wish happy birthday, lvm and sent referral', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-18 14:36:31', '2024-06-18 14:36:31'),
