  ('zcrm_1579374000141269223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099565002', 'Dennis Flannigan', NULL, 'reached out to mbr for birthday, brought up the whole fiasco with his son not being covered here and wanted to know why and ask i call him back potentially, will check with patti here tomorrow for the scoop on this member', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-18 14:32:24', '2024-06-18 14:32:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141680058', 'Miguel Guzman', NULL, '6-18-24 Mindi asked more questions about her specific health issues of blood clotting and thyroid. I recommended that she talks with her doctors to find out worst case scenarios and then she can decide if joining is viable or not. Her husband will join most likely and she just has to decide the risk. She''s also interested in maternity and what happens with "high risk" as an older, late 30''s, future mom.  The Maternity Guide just says to contact Zion for maternity related to complications. There''s nothing to be answered now.  She also let me know they will still qualify for the affordable Lovenox with the income level at the moment. We will reconnect on Thursday, June 20th to enroll in SECURE HSA w RCI for EO or ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 14:30:53', '2024-06-18 14:30:53'),
