  ('zcrm_1579374000141239061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130965012', 'David Duvall', NULL, '06.18.2024 David was wondering if he had any dental or vision on his plan, but it does not look like it was added. So I suggested he try to reach out to James Ashford, who shows inactive in the CRM. I gave him the number listed, and told him that I would also have an advisor in house reach out to him, just in case, since James is showing as inactive. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 14:17:06', '2024-06-18 14:17:06'),
