  ('zcrm_1579374000141239056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121928001', 'Tanya Hagre', NULL, '06.18.2024 Tanya called regarding a preventive bill she received from her woman wellness visit. We did a 3-way call with Planstin to learn more of any reciprocation that took place with billing from her provider. We gladly spoke with Celeste, who confirmed Planstin did receive TWO claims and they paid 100%, with not responsibility on the member, Tanya. However Tanya did share in the end that she may get/did get an ultrasound to view the ovaries. That is not covered by planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 14:15:32', '2024-06-18 14:15:32'),
