  ('zcrm_1579374000141289028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130965012', 'David Duvall', NULL, '6/18/24: David called wanting a "run down" on his plan. I asked if he had any specific questions, but he did not. We discussed the following:
1. Large Medical Needs, IUA, yearly limit, zion guidelines
2. Preventive sharing - 175 for visit, colonoscopies, immunizations, mammograms
3. Telehealth - made sure he was registered
4. Mental Health Resources
5. MPB reference card and Member Portal page of website
Suggested David do welcome call and sent link to schedule. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-18 13:33:54', '2024-06-18 13:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061322074', 'Richard Weinberg', NULL, 'Spoke to mbr directly, offered him referral and sent email', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-18 13:17:26', '2024-06-18 13:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141298002', 'Joshua DeNoyer', NULL, '06.18.24:  Enrolled Joshua in Premium Care today. His mother, Jenni DeNoyer, referred him and I waived his enrollment fee. I had sent him my website to review the plans and services as well as a plan price comparison spreadsheet of all plans appropriate to his needs.  I further explained these plans and both MCS groups. Josh decided on Premium Care. I informed him of the on-boarding process and recommended he schedule a Welcome Call.  I told him to call me with any questions or concerns. Emailed him to thank him for his enrollment and informed him, even though his confirmation email mentions he will be billed $125 for enrollment and membership, he will not be billed the $100 fee for enrollment.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 12:48:39', '2024-06-18 14:30:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.18.24:  Had a meeting with Josh and Jenni.  Samantha couldn''t make it.  Jenni said Sam will call me later.  I explained difference in DIRECT and Premium Care plans/MCS groups to Josh and Jenni.  We looked at pricing comparison. Josh decided to go with Premium Care and Jenni is willing to change to Premium HSA but is reluctant to leave Zion, as she likes their service.  She is willing to change from Planstin to RCI.  She told me today her husband has an open need with Zion. He has a 2nd Sx to undergo in July so I told her to complete the Need before she changes plans. I assisted Josh with his enrollment in Premium Care.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 12:41:46', '2024-06-18 12:41:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.17.24:  Spoke with Jenni. She wants to do individual plans for her, Josh and Samantha.  I told her I created a Plan Price Comparison spreadsheet with each family member''s plan options and I would send it to her as well as an invite to our meeting tomorrow at 12 p.m. CT. I asked for Josh''s email so I could send him an invite as well, which Jenni texted me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 12:35:55', '2024-06-18 12:35:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141260086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109381009', 'Bryan Felberg', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update MPB Portal username.  This has been updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-18 12:32:27', '2024-06-18 12:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '6-18-24 Rickie was out playing golf and wanted to know if he could get sharing for his sons cyst that is now costing about $2K. But, I read him my notes from 5-15-24 and he now understands it''s pre-x bc he missed a month of membership being active, so pre-x started over on new membership. He will pay it and he''ll call me tomorrow or the next day to work on his daughter''s membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 12:31:30', '2024-06-18 12:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.16.24:   I texted  Jenni and suggested 12 p.m. CT on Tuesday and she agreed. I also asked if she and I could talk on Monday at 11 a.m. CT so I could ask her some questions about her decision to do an employer group or not.  She agreed to the call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 12:27:11', '2024-06-18 12:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '6-18-24 Left vm for Ricki returning his call and we need to talk about his daughter''s membership as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 12:20:20', '2024-06-18 12:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141289018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132126001', 'Madison Martin', NULL, '6/18/24: Madison called saying she can''t find the email to schedule a welcome call. I sent her a new link and advised to just pick a day and time that works for her. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-18 12:12:30', '2024-06-18 12:12:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141297008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, '6-18-24 I had an appt set with Ryan now but he didn''t answer. It looks like he wants to keep the MEC and possibly add  HAB for the mental health benefits. Not sure if this is for him or one of his employees.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-18 12:12:13', '2024-06-18 12:12:13'),
