  ('zcrm_1579374000141269034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.14.24:  Jenni texted me yesterday. Said she forgot about scheduling a meeting. Asked to do it today at noon but I didn''t see her text until now. Told her we''ll have to schedule a call for next week.  I suggested Tuesday, the 18th if everyone is available. She answered any time is available.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 10:48:31', '2024-06-18 12:22:02'),
