  ('zcrm_1579374000141269021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '06.17.24:  Jude texted to ask if they could re-schedule our meeting. I responded yes, we could meet tomorrow or Wednesday, as long as we did it by the 19th.  He chose tomorrow at 5:30 CT.  I sent an invite.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 08:20:59', '2024-06-18 08:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '06.16.24:  Texted Jude to ask if they''d like to meet at 6:30 p.m. CT tomorrow. Jude responded yes. Sent them an invite for 6.17 at 6:30 CT.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 08:20:03', '2024-06-18 08:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141239029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '06.18.2024 Maria and I did a 3-way call with Zion, and spoke with Mandy. Confirmed everything for the sharing request is on point and moving in the right direction: Determine eligible 4/21, Assigned a processor David 5/16, Received all documents for reimbursement from Maria 5/21, and it takes 4-5 weeks to process it all. 
We asked about the End of Life Assistance, Mandy verified her membership with her husband, and confirmed she, the surviving member of the household, is eligible to receive 10k, per diseased person. 
Mandy offered to transfer Maria to the Extended life assistance team and requested that Maria share the death certificate. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 08:18:53', '2024-06-18 08:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141269008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '06.14.24:  Jude texted me that they think they will go with the DIRECT plan at a $1000 IUA. I responded to ask if we could set up a call to discuss a few more items and if they''re ready to enroll. Jude responded yes and I asked what time would work best for them but did not get an answer.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-18 08:17:55', '2024-06-18 08:18:15'),
