  ('zcrm_1579374000141239019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140542018', 'Pamela Roble', NULL, '06.18.2024 Pamela called to confirm her welcome call with Vanessa at 11ET, phone:  (763) 286-7060.
I checked with Vanessa via Teams and she confirmed she is showing up. Pamela will expect a call from Vanessa at that time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 07:51:19', '2024-06-18 07:51:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141239014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '06.18.2024 Need to call Zion to advocate for this member''s wellness and move forward with the sharing requests. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 07:27:52', '2024-06-18 07:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141239003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109381009', 'Bryan Felberg', NULL, '06.18.2024 Bryan called around midnight to request his member ID. I called him back to learn which member ID. 
*********************************************************************************
Bryan called back. We walked through his credentials, filling out the MPB change form to change his username for the MPB Portal. We discussed opening a sharing request with Zion, I explained the process, gave his the number and transferred him to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-18 07:23:06', '2024-06-18 12:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024225', 'Jason Fishburn', NULL, '6-17-24 I reached Jason and let him know his price will be changing from $264 to $319 due to turning 50 in July. He says "Getting older isn''t for sissies!"  He was appreciative of my call and he''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 18:03:39', '2024-06-17 18:03:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024225', 'Jason Fishburn', NULL, '6-17-24 Emails are getting bounced back showing he no longer works for Aspen Properties. I am calling him to let him know of the price increase.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 17:58:36', '2024-06-17 17:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141203089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123096002', 'Karen Yabuno', NULL, '06.17.2024 Karen called saying that she already opened a sharing request, but thinks she should have opened them under two separate requests. After further conversation I learned the specific situations are: Rheumatoid Arthritis and Sleep Study and Breathing Issues.
I explained that the rheumatoid is definitely considered as a pre-membership, and she''s in her 1st year, so she''s waiting till next September to get anything shared up to 25k. I read the guidelines out loud to her.
Then we looked up anything under; breathing, lungs, sleep....etc, and the only item that came up was that Sleep Apnea study and equipment are not shareable.
We had questions for Zion to get more clarification on the breathing sharing request, so I asked her if she would call us back tomorrow morning and we can call them then, since they are gone for the day. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 17:58:36', '2024-06-17 17:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141203084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132041011', 'Bobbi Shiflett', NULL, '06.17.2024 Bobbi called and left us a VM. I called her back in hopes to educate her on her membership, per her request, but no answer, so I left her a VM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 17:21:42', '2024-06-17 17:21:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141203073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '06.17.2024 Maria called attempting to access her Zion portal, but turns out she needed to make updates on her MPB portal credentials also. I guided her to the MPB Change form. She needs to change her USERNAME email to the present one: mcfit4life@gmail.com, and the secondary needs to be REMOVED, as he no longer is with us.
She also needs to CHANGE her BANKING information, so I led her to that form to complete after our call.
We attempted a 3-way call with Zion, but it rang for too long, no one picked up. I told her to call back early tomorrow morning, so we can connect with them then and ask them the following questions:
1- Why have her bills not been shared yet? It''s been 2 months since she has received the determination email.
2- What does she have to do to attain the Zion''s End of Life Assistance? 
"E N D O F L I F E A S S I S T A N C E
If a member, or someone in the member’s household membership, dies after one year of
uninterrupted membership, the Zion HealthShare community may provide financial
assistance after receiving a copy of the death certificate. The surviving family may receive
$10,000 per deceased household member."                          NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 17:09:04', '2024-06-17 17:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141229002', 'Jessica Giles', NULL, '6-17-24 Jessica is a patient with and referred by Functional Medicine Dr. and client Aimee Smith. Jessica is 40 and her kids are 18 and 13. The kids are currently covered by their father''s Cigna plan. Her aunt who lives in Kansas has used a health sharing membership for many years now and really likes it. She''s been meaning to explore this option and is finally doing so. She''s currently a member of a DPC but may choose to end that soon. She prefers functional medicine and Dr. Evans has been helping her tremendously with Hashimotos. The DPC dr. is more traditional and the path she was going down was making her feel worse, not better. So, now she''s on a great path and doing well! She also chose to do a home birth for her 3rd child.  She lives in Fort Collins. I explained CARE+ $265/$1000 and HAB $107.   She joined CARE+ today and wants to ponder HAB. She also might add the kids at some point in the future when she''s more financially able. She got a divorce about 1 year ago and is still getting her feet on the ground.  She needed a July 1st start date. She paid $3K for a dr. to provide her care for a period of time. Otherwise, she doesn''t have anything protecting her for major medical issues. She fully understands the pre-x clause and need for pre-approval if she''s able to get sharing for years two and beyond.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 17:06:29', '2024-06-17 17:06:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142370033', 'Michael Llerandi', NULL, '6-17-24 Mike is turning 61  tomorrow and his wife is 49. They live in Crested Butte and came to me via Kimberly Baldwin. Mike is ending his employment July 31st and is contemplating getting full time corporate job or going to work independently. They have no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. I explained everything to him re Premium Care bc of age. He just had his colonoscopy 1 month ago and he does blood work and check hormones, etc. His wife does mammo''s, yes for dentl, no for vision bc had Lasik years afo, no for mental health, yes for nutrition. Wife trains people, so may not really spend $ on gym membership or anything similar. He''s interested in Premium Care and possibly HAB, $1000/$575 +$165 HAB or $1500/$507 + $165. He needs Aug. 1st start date and knows deadline is July 19th. He will call me in about 1 week when he knows if/how he plans to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 16:21:52', '2024-06-17 16:21:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141390002', 'Michael Earle', NULL, '6-17-24 Christina asked about the MCS option for her husband. His only pre-x is allergies and he''s never been hospitalized for that I believe and she''s not worried about it. I described Premium Care which she''s excited about and HAB which they will pass on. I should probably mentioned Premium HSA!  Sounds like he does some of the blood work for typical wellness screening. I will send the video, overview and brochure for her to share with her husband. They will likely go with Premium Care $1000/$285 and we will need to cancel Select Health for $772.36 for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 15:26:14', '2024-06-17 15:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141203068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123512012', 'Kathy Stevenson', NULL, '06.17.2024 Kathy called to learn how to proceed for a preventive appointment through her membership. I  guided her how to open a preventive sharing request with Zion, what to expect and transferred her to them, after I gave her their phone number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 15:15:09', '2024-06-17 17:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141203063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129740002', 'Dana Weddle', NULL, '06.17.2024 Dana called on behalf of his wife who is having ongoing gastrologic concerns. AO today they''re spent $991, and the physician has referred her to more services that includes a biopsy and research that will total $2100. I encouraged him to open a sharing request with Zion, where they will determine its shareability via guidelines and more. I coached him on the steps, what to expect and they''re responsibilities. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 14:59:03', '2024-06-17 14:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141172051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '6/17/24: Called Jason back and LVM to let him know they are still working on resolving his member status issue, but it should be done by tomorrow. AM
William from Planstin called - there was an issue with Planstin inputting Jason''s info bc he does not have a MEC ?
William was able to get approval to add Jason''s enrollment and should be good to go by tomorrow. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 14:04:08', '2024-06-17 14:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141214008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '6-17-24 Francoise just enrolled her son, Lawson Lewis, 21 into HAB for psychiatrist and mental health therapy. She''s pondering adding her and her husband as well.  

I also brought up the MEC change and thought it was only going to be $3 increase until I looked at her account. So, I just sent her this email.

"Nice to talk with you just now. Let''s hold off on having you sign the form for the change of the ACA/HSA compliant wellness screening insurance benefit. The change might have a different price than what I mentioned because you have a grandfathered price. So, the price change may be more significant. We can hold off until I know more."

Her price is changing $103 not $3 unless the upcoming meetings have a different or positive outcome. We will wait to see what becomes of that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-17 14:02:36', '2024-06-17 16:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141172046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135149007', 'Timur Zamaletdinov', NULL, '6/17/24: Tim called. He has an issue and has been receiving treatment. He has SSNHL (Sudden sensorineural hearing loss) and doc is wanting to do several tests to figure out what''s wrong. Tim wants to know if these will be shareable. I advised that I couldn''t find anything in the guidelines that explicitly says it will not be, but zion will need to make that determination. 
I advised to go ahead and submit a need so he can get a determination as soon as possible. 
Trans to Zion so they could help him set up portal. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 13:57:40', '2024-06-17 13:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141217063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, '6-17-2024 ATAP: Spoke with Jon at length. We cannot save him any $$ at this point. His monthly will increase with the Planstin re-enrollment  by $20 to $520. Sending him Misty''s re-enrollment link via email w/ a CC to Misty.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-17 13:14:29', '2024-06-17 13:14:29'),
