  ('zcrm_1579374000141203008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, '06.17.2024 Jack called to learn how to proceed when he goes in to Urgent Care. I asked him if he was able to connect with someone on telehealth, CirrusMD,  and he said yes. Then I proceeded to guide him via the cash-pay patient lens and healthsharing process with Zion. I told him to call us back if this specific issue prolongs and needs more services. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-17 10:31:24', '2024-06-17 10:31:24'),
