  ('zcrm_1579374000141172023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, '6/17/24:
Marcella called. She broke her wrist  and submitted sharing request last week and now unsure what to do. The surgery center is saying she needs to pay for everything up front. I suggested getting a good faith estimate and submitting that to Zion so they can hopefully issue the funds upfront. I transferred to Zion''s sharing department and advised that they could answer specifics and look into her account to give her an update. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 09:48:24', '2024-06-17 09:48:24'),
