  ('zcrm_1579374000141172018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122227001', 'Mary Jane Morris', NULL, '6/17/24: Mary called asking what card she needs to present to a provider for billing. I explained that with her plan, there is no card to present. She is self-pay and in the event that an issue exceeds her IUA amount of 2500, then she can begin submitting bills for reimbursement. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 09:32:28', '2024-06-17 09:32:28');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000141172013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625021', 'Jacqueline Thill', NULL, '6/17/24: Jackie called. She has a UTI and wanting advice on how to seek medical help. I advised to first use CirrusMD and if they were unable to help her, then she could visit a provider''s office but it would be self-pay. I gave her the web address for using Cirrus. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 09:10:06', '2024-06-17 09:10:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141172008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/17/24: Called Denise to discuss Zion''s recent decision on capping sharing for Concepcion''s issue at 50K bc now they are saying it''s a pre-ex condition.
I suggested to Denise that she ask their provider if there is anything in the records that might point to this finding? And to ask Zion - what document are they using to base this decision on?
Then , if you disagree - appeal the decision by providing a written letter from provider discounting the relationship between the current issue and past issues. 

Denise thinks that Zion could be linking her previous endometriosis with the current issue.

Denise disclosed that during their meeting with transplant team - the surgeon turned them down stating that she''s not convinced she can help Concepcion and wants her to do more GI testing at University of Wisconsin. 
The social worker qualified Concepcion for CO Medicaid but family does not want to go that route. She wouldn''t give me definite reason, but mentioned if they need to go out of state, it wouldn''t work anyway. 

At this point the procedure is up in the air. I suggested still moving forward with a Zion appeal if they feel this decision is incorrect and let her know that she has 30 days from time of determination to file an appeal and to call me back once she received the official determination letter and had the info in front of her, then if need be - we can call Zion or I can advise on how to best file the appeal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 09:08:31', '2024-06-17 09:55:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141172003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130212026', 'Cristin Connelly', NULL, '6/17/24: Cristin called trying to help her daughter Piper register for Cirrus MD. Turns out, Piper was entering a zip code that Cirrus didn''t recognize. She was able to register no problem when putting in zip listed on account. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 09:06:54', '2024-06-17 09:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141165008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118172010', 'David Slabaugh', NULL, '6/17/24: MSEAP called to verify the membership of Ella and Everly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 08:31:45', '2024-06-17 08:31:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141165003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128256011', 'Trey Thomason', NULL, '6/17/24: Emailed Trey the following per recent request:
