  ('zcrm_1579374000141147006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128937002', 'Tracy Hulse', NULL, '6/17/24: James called needing to open a sharing request for the first time. I gave him instructions on how to set up member portal and made sure he knew about his IUA and how to proceed before sending over to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-17 07:48:16', '2024-06-17 07:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141146003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141096012', 'Matt Eytcheson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure w/RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-17 07:28:46', '2024-06-17 07:28:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141056122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130449009', 'Katherine Moore', NULL, '06.14.2024: Katherine called, she cannot figure out how to get into her member portals - MPB or Zion. She has previously registered for her Zion member portal bc she has a current need open. I advised that she will have to speak to them about password issues. I reached out to Julia to get credentials for Katherine for MPB portal but was informed that member''s who re-enroll in through Planstin will not have access to an MPB member portal. AM', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-14 18:00:26', '2024-06-17 07:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141056108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, '06.14.2024 Bradley was looking to change his payment information:

"Hello Patti,

I''m writing to give you a heads-up on a phone call you might receive from a member, Bradley Steele.
He wanted to change his payment information, so I led him to the MPB Payment Change form on the Member Portal page.
However, he was more interested in us using the previous information that shows in the system that we still have, instead of the Cognito form. I offered to check with you on Monday, by calling our concierge # and asking for you.
I did reiterate that you most likely are going to ask for a form of signature to make the switch, even though we still have the old payment (that he wants back on his banking account) in our system.
Hopefully you can give him more insight, otherwise he''ll just need to refill the form online.

Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969"                                               NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-14 17:15:47', '2024-06-14 17:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141056103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119568009', 'Rex Boland', NULL, '06.14.2024 Rex needs to go to an urgent care and needed guidance. 
I provided him with the steps to presenting, the papers to collect and asked him to take care of himself. When he gets home to call us back and we will guide him in opening a sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-14 15:10:39', '2024-06-14 17:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141091021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, '6-14-24 Jill wants HAB and also wants to keep HSA compliance. So, she decided to keep Planstin since it''s only $25 more per month bc she has an old grandfathered membership. I also let her know of the MEC price increase before Nov. of $11. She''s fine with it. HAB is $107 + $375 = $482 for July 1st. She''s very excited to use HAB and to use alt doctors.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-14 14:53:46', '2024-06-14 14:55:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000141079031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/14/24: Karen called and stated that Denise said Zion is determining Concepcion''s condition as pre-ex and capping the funds at 50K. 
Zion previously lifted this cap and told member it was shareable.

Julia reaching out to Ashlee about this situation.

I will reach out to member Monday morning to:
1. Have them ask their provider if there is any evidence in the medical records that shows this is a pre-existing condition?
2. Have Zion show documentation that proves their pre-ex determination
3. Ask what hospital member is using for upcoming procedures.

*If Zion doesn''t budge on determination, then explore Hospital Debt Relief program with member. 
