  ('zcrm_1579374000141091003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139074168', 'Alan Depew', NULL, '6-14-24 Christina and Alan are looking to move from N. CA to FL, GA or SC in the fall. Alan has his 5 year colonoscopy coming up soon before he switches ins. They have Kaiser now and only pay 15% of the monthly cost. They pay only $2771.60 per YR! However, the full cost of their Kaiser plan is $2340 per month for ES which is $28,080 per year. So, Premium CARE for ES is $1000/$837 +$165 = $1002 or $1500/$741 +$165 = $906 and $125/$25. They see the value of this now that they understand the price difference. They are saving $16,000 a year! Now Christina is far less concerned about the Dr. visit here and there or a little extra work in submitting the bills. She wants to wait to see where they move and if she gets a job with benefits for her or both of them. She knows to contact me Aug. 20th -Sept. 20th for an Oct. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-14 11:53:00', '2024-06-14 11:53:00'),
