  ('zcrm_1579374000140946052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '06.12.2024 Cathy and Patrick called for Cathy to share her concern with a possible RE-ENROLLMENT mishap. She has a mammogram next monday that she scheduled months ago and cannot reschedule, and was attempting to use planstin prev care.
She spoke with Planstin and they told her that they never re-enrolled. I told her that we have been having technical issues with the integration file, and that I will put in a ticket to the IT department, and send an email to member services to see how they can remedy the situation. I will Cc the appropriate parties to make them aware. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-12 17:00:34', '2024-06-12 17:10:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140946047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '06.12.2024 Scott called wanting to open a sharing request with Zion, and is unable to due to an email mishap. It was not accepting his new email.
I had him fill out the change form so WE have his new email - then we did a 3-way call with Zion and spoke with Amber. She confirmed that the new email he wants to use is indeed in the system, but he is still unable to open the member portal to start a sharing request.
Amber escalated the situation to IT, and offered to help Scott open a sharing request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-12 16:53:53', '2024-06-12 16:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140946039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135183021', 'Larissa Brice', NULL, '06.12.2024 Larissa called to be guided on how to proceed with an annual physical appointment that she has on Monday. We went over what items and how to separate diagnostic items from the preventive appointment. Discounted labsites, sent her an email via CRM on those, and led her to the RX request form, and chatted about our process and the international shopper. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-12 15:15:03', '2024-06-12 15:19:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140955018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133214002', 'Robert Grinnell', NULL, '6/12/24: Vanessa called. They are in Hawaii and her daughter has an ear infection. Telehealth suggested she see an urgent care clinic, but they are quoting her at most $700. I attempted looking on healthcare bluebook to try and find a fairer price facility but there was nothing coming up close to the island they are staying at. I reiterated how to present and to ask for a cash price discount, and if the expenses went over their IUA, they can be submitted as a sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 14:26:12', '2024-06-12 14:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140959031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084832001', 'Gail Cole', NULL, 'Spoke to mbr and attempted to persuade her to enroll in sedera hsa $2500 but member ultimately chose to remain the same and was not interested in higher IUA for savings, sent enrollment link.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-12 14:13:07', '2024-06-12 14:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140963058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128409012', 'Shawn Ford', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-12 13:34:01', '2024-06-12 13:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140955013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114230002', 'Mary Jo Mooring', NULL, '6/12/24: Mary Jo called with questions about preventive visits. I explained that her plan does include preventive sharing and sent her Zion''s Preventive guidelines. Gave her instructions on how to present, to call and check pricing bc Zion will only pay up to $175 for an annual provider visit, collecting an itemized bill from doctor and getting into portal. Transferred to Zion to set up member portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 13:26:23', '2024-06-12 13:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140963050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140971002', 'Wendy Reghi', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-12 13:15:17', '2024-06-12 13:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140946018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121928001', 'Tanya Hagre', NULL, '06.12.2024 Tanya called inquiring about weight loss sharing details with Zion. We looked up the guidelines together, I read out loud what they say about weight loss sharing.
Then we discussed her IUA and how it is high. Changing the IUA to lower, and the waiting time period.
Speaking to Jane Kassel to be completely informed on all the pricing, premium and anything financially impacted. I guided her to the change form, for when she is ready to make that change.
******************************************************************************************
Tanya called back not being able to get a hold of her advisor, Jane Kassel. I do not have a price sheet handy, and she wanted to learn the difference in her monthly premium. I checked to see if Kirk was available. He was and was willing to answer her questions. I transferred her to him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-12 12:26:42', '2024-06-12 12:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140946013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135129028', 'Aileen Loyola', NULL, '06.12.2024 Aileen requested to have the welcome call scheduling link resent so she can reserve a spot. I sent it via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-12 12:15:53', '2024-06-12 12:27:24'),
