  ('zcrm_1579374000140959008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '6-12-24 Francoise called to inquire about HAB for one family member possibly.  I will call her back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-12 11:57:09', '2024-06-12 11:57:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140959003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '6-12-24 Haley called bc she wants to change to a cheaper option. She''s going back to school and wants drug coverage and dr. visits included. I''ll see if she has a life change event or not. Left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-12 11:52:28', '2024-06-12 11:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140955003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135538001', 'Alison Johnston', NULL, '6/12/24: Alison called wanting advice for a specialist she''s about to see. Since she is on the co-pay plan, she would just present her planstin card for billing and pay the co-pay, but to make sure the provider is in the PHCS network. I checked Multiplan and he is, but recommended she call to verify as well. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 11:36:08', '2024-06-12 11:36:08'),
