  ('zcrm_1579374000140669028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006532067', 'Reena Gajjar', NULL, 'spoke to mbr and wished her happy birthday, mentioned she was about to get in an elevator and had to go, told her to check her email for our referral program.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-12 09:43:33', '2024-06-12 09:43:33'),
