  ('zcrm_1579374000140661073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108301001', 'Catina Lewis', NULL, '6/12/24: Carmen from P called to verify that Catina''s membership did not include a spouse. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 09:24:36', '2024-06-12 09:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, '6/12/24: Marcella called. She fell and broke her wrist, and went to urgent care who referred her to the ER. She then went to see a wrist specialist and they are wanting to do surgery next week. I gave Marcella advice on how to submit a sharing request, her IUA amount and to collect as much info about costs for the surgery and pre-submit those to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 09:23:45', '2024-06-12 09:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, '6/12/24: Monica reached out interested in adding dental to her plan. I informed her that it''s not something offered through MPB, but a lot of times advisors will sell that a la cart and to reach out to her advisor. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 08:55:19', '2024-06-12 08:55:19'),
