  ('zcrm_1579374000140661053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', NULL, '6/12/24: Jaclyn called. She has 3 sons getting wellness visits this week and wanted to know if they have to be exactly 365 days apart. The ACA guidelines state 1 year, but I''m not sure how strictly that is enforced or whether it can be within the month/a few days. Advised to speak to Planstin to be certain.
Asking Planstin their thoughts for future reference. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-12 07:37:06', '2024-06-12 07:37:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-12 07:18:58', '2024-06-12 07:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to remove dependent from membership eff 7/1/24 due to turning 26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-12 07:18:30', '2024-06-12 07:18:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140669008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '6-11-24 Going directly to Zion gives him a price he can afford with their Essentials membership and nothing else included.  At the $2500 IUA it''s $125!  I think he can make this happen. He''s going without anything otherwise.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-11 17:04:04', '2024-06-11 17:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, '6/11/24: Ben called. His wife recently had a preventive mamm, and they are wanting to do further testing. We discussed how the future visits could count towards their IUA and gave advice on collecting itemized bills and the 6 month deadline. I did a quick search for specialists using hcbb for him and also emailed directions on using hcbb to check the referral she gets from her doctor to make sure they are fair price and good quality. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 16:56:14', '2024-06-11 16:56:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '6/11/24: Mikayla called asking if a new patient visit is covered. I explained that IF it is a preventive wellness visit, then it can be paid for by Planstin. She asked if a punch biopsy is covered bc she has a spot on her shoulder and doctor wants to know if it is cancerous. I educated the member on how the IUA works, presenting for diagnostic visits as self pay and collecting bills just in case it turns into an issue. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 16:33:49', '2024-06-11 16:33:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140669003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '6-11-24 Ben came to me via Rebecca Cook he said at first. Then he said via Jill St. Aubin King as well as his ex-wife Mary Geitner. But, it really sounds like Jill is the one who sent him to me. He was on Medicaid which ended in Oct. 2023. He''s missed his open enrollment period. His kids are on CHP+ with income at $50K and he has nothing at the moment. He''s healthy, no  pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Looking for July 1st. I described CARE+ which he likes and HAB which he was also excited about. But, coming off of Medicaid it''s all a bit of sticker shock for him right now after paying a big amount of $ to maintain his truck. CARE+ $265/$1000 and HAB $107 = $372. Even with the higher IUA of $2500 / $205 it''s still too expensive. I''ll look for other options.  He''s 47 and lives in Longmont, CO. Email is Ben@Home-Renu.com. 
Ultimately, he said yes to wellness for all of the following, Annual wellness screening, skin check, dental, vision (he pays $70 per year or every 18 months), gym is yes for snowboarding pass, nutritional health he gets help from his sister who is in that field, mental health he''s opened to. If/when he''s more financially stable, this might be  a good option. Until then, he needs something more affordable.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-11 16:29:18', '2024-06-11 16:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '6/11/24: Kallie called. Her son was in a bike race and hit his head - ended up going to ER with a concussion. They were considering sending the son to a traumatic brain injury program through the hospital and wanted to know if that would be paid for. I advised that ultimately, Zion would make a determination on that and to open a sharing request, submit the documentation for program and get an answer prior to taking part in it. Ended up transferring to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 16:20:42', '2024-06-11 16:20:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114224002', 'Federico Gaytan Jr', NULL, '6/11/24: Federico called to cancel his membership. He said his wife is ending maternity leave, going back to work and the offer from her work is a better deal. He informed me that his advisor is no longer active with the company. I gave him the info for the cancellation form and forewarned the member to be careful about creating a lapse in "coverage". AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 15:34:42', '2024-06-11 15:34:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140661013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244002', 'Elaine Stedman', NULL, '6/11/24: Elaine called trying to find out her member number and when she would be getting a card from Zion. I gave her the MPB number and let her know she could find her Zion number in the welcome email from Zion, but they wouldn''t be sending a card. She asked if she moves during a pregnancy, will that affect anything. I said no - she would just be unable to submit a single global package. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 15:08:40', '2024-06-11 15:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140657138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113498002', 'Devin Miller', NULL, 'reached out to do birthday call, lvm and sent email', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-11 14:57:45', '2024-06-11 14:57:45'),
