  ('zcrm_1579374000140661008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659263', 'Julie Sombrio', NULL, '6/11/24: Julie called. She''s wanting to see an internist and OBGYN to read some blood panels as well as other concerns. I informed her that since these are diagnostic visits, she''ll be presenting as a self-pay patient. Explained to collect itemized bills just in case it turns into a need. 
Julie was well aware of how submitting a need works as they are in the middle of one for her husband. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 14:45:44', '2024-06-11 14:45:44'),
