  ('zcrm_1579374000140661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, '6/11/24: Dante called about re-instating his plan. I informed him that since his membership has been cancelled, he would need to re-enroll and to speak to his advisor, Traci. Gave Dante Traci''s number. Need to clarify with Patti who CAN reinstate members after cancellation - if it has to be the advisor or not. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 14:42:32', '2024-06-11 14:42:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140658018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', NULL, '06.11.2024 Megan called sharing that she has a deviated septum, and searched deviated septum symptoms. She is interested in getting it fixed, under a sharing request with Zion. I attempted to read through the guidelines with her to learn of any obligations or limitations, but the guidelines seemed to have moved. I decided to just call them and do a 3-way call, but their VM said they are in a meeting and to call them later. 
I offered Megan a call back after I learned from Zion any details on this specific situation. 
********************************************************************
I was able to connect with Zion and spoke with Chris. He said her best bet is to open that sharing request and see what happens. I sent her an email via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-11 13:58:47', '2024-06-11 14:25:13'),
