  ('zcrm_1579374000140658003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133865034', 'Astrid Weisseise', NULL, '06.11.2024 Astrid had questions about the prescription program. I went through a lot of detail, explaining the process, the do''s the don''ts and what to expect, and how to avoid mishaps. I also explained that this is extended to labwork as well, and how to change pharmacies if needed, and how to reach a coupon if she is ON HER WAY to the pharmacy. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-11 13:23:35', '2024-06-11 13:23:35'),
