  ('zcrm_1579374000140640016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '6/11/24: James called asking if he had preventive coverage - I advised he did not, but for a colonoscopy - he can submit that as a sharing request and the expenses that exceed his IUA are then eligible for sharing. I suggested he collect at estimation from provider and submit the request prior to having the procedure done. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-11 12:18:08', '2024-06-11 12:23:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140640011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/11/24: Spoke to Ulysis at Zion regarding the status of Concepcions account and to make sure they had finished linking the two so they show no lapse in membership. 
