  ('zcrm_1579374000140643011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6-11-24 Kristen''s family pricing is going from $715 to $905. If we drop the MEC, it will put them into the new 2024 pricing, so we don''t want to do that. If we increase the IUA to $2500 it will be $755 a month. I don''t know what the possible new MEC prices will be if True Health is an option. Right now SECURE HSA with RCI MEC it''s $843.40. So, a simple IUA change is best as of right now. We will meet again June 26th to revisit since she needs to change for Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-11 11:33:54', '2024-06-11 11:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140637026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123819002', 'Heidi Perry', NULL, '06.11.2024 Heidi called to learn better how to maneuver her membership. She has received both the MPB and the Planstin cards. I walked her through the 3 parts to her plan: Essentials, Planstin, Zion.
