  ('zcrm_1579374000140620003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '06.11.2024 Clint called to learn how to proceed, now that he''s learned he needs spinal surgery. We discussed the initial visit timeline towards the 6 months deadline to opening a sharing request. As well as, the $2500 IUA, receipts, bills, organizing it all, and when opening the sharing request, Zion will have their medical advocacy team connect with the  surgeon and hospital. Zion will assign a claim processor, who Clint with reciprocate conversation and questions with. I gave him Zion''s number and transferred him there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-11 08:14:43', '2024-06-11 08:14:43'),
