  ('zcrm_1579374000140541078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, '06.10.2024 Marilynn called to learn how to save/reimbursed for her prescription. I explained how the process works and guided her to the form on the website. She asked how to get reimbursed for her gyno appt, I explained her plan does not have preventive services. However, her advisor may have sold her a product companion that she might be able to tap into. It turns out Wendy did, and Marilynn will reach out to Wendy to learn more on how to get reimbursed for her preventive appointments. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 18:05:09', '2024-06-10 18:05:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140546153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141680058', 'Miguel Guzman', NULL, '6-10-24 Mindi''s husband works for McDowell and Sons (Melissa McDowell''s company). Mindi''s plan is going from $250 to $500+. They want to possibly switch to MCS. Mindi''s husband was diagnosed with type 2 diabetes last year for a short period of time. He no longer has that diagnosis bc they worked on changing their diet and exercise. With SECURE HSA it''s exempt anyhow. They are 36 and 38. They are looking to start a family soon but also talking about fertility options. She knows fertility treatments are not shareable. I will send the maternity guide as well. Mindi take thyroid meds. The bigger concern is she has a clotting disorder that she takes an ongoing med called Lovenox. The generic is Enoxaparin. They are all expensive. She''s getting it super affordably through the hospital right now through some program determined by their income level. They are about $20K-$30K away from the threshold she thinks, so it''s not likely they''ll exceed it. But, she will want to be certain before she joins since it''s $1000''s for the med. She need an injection 2x daily. She gets 180 syringes to last her 90 days right now at .8 ml / 80.  She also takes some pre-natals such as iron and one other. She knows of the June 20th deadline. Looking at SECURE HSA for $578.40 / $1000 and $125/$25. She will find out how much McDowell and Sons will pay towards the plan and see if they will fund anything towards the HSA. She will make sure with her Dr. that it''s not a risk to join with her health status.   We will talk again on Tuesday, next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-10 17:00:20', '2024-06-10 17:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140541059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', NULL, '06.10.2024 Stephanie needs a colonoscopy and thinks it WILL BE diagnostic. I guided her to attempt it via preventive, and let the providers and Planstin decide. Should it become diagnostic, then I asked her to call us and we will take the steps from there. I guided her through the do''s and the don''ts at the women wellness visit, if it were to evolve into a diagnostic then we will open a sharing request. To call us if that were to happen and we will guide her again. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 15:23:03', '2024-06-10 15:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/10/24: Denise called back. I relayed the latest conversation we had with Zion and steps taken to resolve the membership lapse question. I told Denise I would followup with Zion tomorrow.
She requested that I ask if there is anyway they can write a letter stating that Concepcion is in good standing and in the event of a transplant it would be paid for.
I advised she needed to get an estimate and submit to Zion bc they will need to make a determination on the service, and will request that info prior to agreeing to write a letter. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 15:08:19', '2024-06-10 15:08:19'),
