  ('zcrm_1579374000140546148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '6-10-24 Cynthia asked many great questions which I answered.  She enrolled in Premium Care $575 / $1000 and HAB $165 = $740 a month plus $125/$25. Enrolled for July 1st. All set and looking forward to trying this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-10 14:25:57', '2024-06-10 14:25:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '6/10/24: Normandie called to check and see what labs were covered by planstin - just a standard lipid panel. She said they were able to use one of the discount sites Nahla sent over and all the labs came out to around $70, but just wanted to make sure they didn''t pay for them if they were covered. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 14:17:28', '2024-06-10 14:17:28'),
