  ('zcrm_1579374000140541054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, '06.10.2024 Dante called to change his payment information, after his fraud situation, and wrong accounts linked up.
He said he spoke with Patti, who guided him to speak to Traci, who then guided him to speak to the Concierge.
The membership is now cancelled, so hoping he can be reinstated. Attempted a 3-way call with Traci, but she was busy/did not answer. I left her a message to call us back. When she does, I will 3-way with Dante. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 13:25:27', '2024-06-10 13:25:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140541046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081593002', 'Heather Bacchus', NULL, '06.10.2024 Heather called to learn if a functional medicine doctor would be shared. I told her as long as the provider is a Licensed Medical Professional, and to run it by Zion first, due to past experience with another member. She was happy to do that, I gave her Zion''s number, told her to press #3, and transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 13:11:14', '2024-06-10 13:11:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/10/24: Nahla and I called Zion to confirm that there is no lapse in coverage for Concepcion and to please link the inactive account to the active one to make sure the membership shows correctly. Ulysis from Zion said that he would speak to the admin team to make these changes and reach out to the member regarding the sharing request. 

I emailed Zion Denise''s proof of payment for month of April - Ulysis from Zion confirmed he received it and will begin processing this - I made sure to note that members pay on the 20th of the previous month for the following month.

Called Denise and left a detailed vm regarding steps taken to correct that Zion is showing Concepcion with a lapse in membership. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 13:07:59', '2024-06-11 10:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140541041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '06.10.2024 Did a 3-way call with Zion, spoke with Ulysees to inform that there is no lapse in coverage and requested that they link both of Concepcion''s account (new and old). Angee iterated how imperative it is to expedite this process, due to the progress of medical attention that Concepcion''s is presently receiving. Ulysees said he would notify the admin team regarding the "NOT lapsed" account situation, and the time sensitivity to the matter. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 13:05:54', '2024-06-10 13:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140546023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048538018', 'Diane Border', NULL, 'reached out to wish mbr happy birthday', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-10 12:59:42', '2024-06-10 12:59:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106305009', 'Karen Awad', NULL, '06.10.24:  Karen called me. Needs more time to prepare to move to SC. Thinks she will move in September. She  hasn''t found a house yet but is looking in the general area of Greenville, SC or a bit north in mtns.  Currently clearing out her house, etc. to prepare for the move.  Said she will work on her video commentary for the July newsletter or before if she gets time. I explained how to use our video platform, which she found easy and said she could practice on that. She said she would keep in touch.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-10 12:41:49', '2024-06-10 12:41:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140546013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '6-10-24  This response is from Ben with Zion. 

Conflict of Interest Answer - 
In keeping with the Principles of Membership, and in the interest of protecting the Zion HealthShare community, medical expenses incurred by a member that obtains medical treatment from a provider with which the member has an affiliation, partnership, personal or business relationship, or the like, and receives financial gain, is not considered shareable.

In the situation you described, there is an affiliation/partnership with the provider and the practice (member is an owner) is receiving financial gain because of it. I would say this is a conflict of interest and the services performed in that clinic may not be shareable.

However, if the member is a DPC, and is using the DPC practice for their routine care, they would not be submitting sharing requests to Zion HealthShare for any service performed within the clinic as it should be part of their DPC membership.

Any eligible medical treatment performed outside the clinic by an unaffiliated person should be shareable with the community.
_______
It''s a valid point!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-10 12:38:00', '2024-06-10 12:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140546008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '6-10-24 Patty just enrolled for Premium Care $285/$1000 and HAB $107 = $392. She enrolled for July 1st and knows of different billing dates for each.  She''s also friends with Tanya who encouraged her to join as well. But, she came to me via Holly Wiese first. She''s happy that it was so easy. She just got back from 2 weeks in Costa Rica and it''s hard to wrap your head around all of this again. But, she scheduled her Welcome Call for June 1st. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-10 12:32:03', '2024-06-10 12:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140541028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134978019', 'Angel Cachero', NULL, '0610.2024 Angel called to see how she can save on dental appointments. I explained about the HCBB resource site, and sent it to her via CRM. I also recommended that she speak to Leslie Jablonski to learn if she can sell her a side product companion for dental. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 12:10:03', '2024-06-10 12:10:03'),
