  ('zcrm_1579374000140535006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140542018', 'Pamela Roble', NULL, '6-10-2024
Enrolled Pamela in Premium HSA at 1500 IUA, $860/month
She did mention that Whitney contacted her back so I gave Pamela the choice to go enroll with Whitney or enroll me me right now. She was not comfortable and said that Whitney may take 2 to 3 days to get back to her. Pamela decided to enroll with me right now.  Also, Pamela will likely use Fidelity directly for her HSA (existing relationship there).', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-10 11:34:48', '2024-06-11 08:41:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140537013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138936002', 'Chantal Watson-Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-06-10 11:30:23', '2024-06-10 11:30:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140541013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553066', 'Ronald Lopez', NULL, '06.10.2024 Ronald called to learn who his benefits company is and how it is used. He did need to update his address, so I sent him the MPB change form.
I had him search his email for Planstin and Zion, and he received both welcome emails, as he read the titles out loud. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-10 11:23:11', '2024-06-10 11:23:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128734001', 'Martin Rojas', NULL, '6/10/24: Northwest Children''s clinic called to verify coverage for Jace. I gave a brief overview of their plan and that they are a self-pay patient. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 11:13:07', '2024-06-10 11:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '6/10/24: Ryan called needing help getting into his CirrusMD account. I suggested using the tech support bubble in the app and I''ll also send a support ticket to CIrrus email. I reassured that they are pretty speedy in resolving these issues and to wait for them to respond. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 11:05:59', '2024-06-10 11:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138128002', 'Justin Caid', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-06-10 10:58:41', '2024-06-10 10:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130212026', 'Cristin Connelly', NULL, '6/10/24: Cristin called saying she feels very very sick and anticipates that if she uses the telehealth service, they will just tell her to go see someone. I advised that with her plan, she would present as a self-pay patient and if the issue accumulated costs that exceed her IUA, then it can be submitted for sharing. 
We looked up urgent care clinics in her area and I gave her some options that were in the fair price range. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 09:58:49', '2024-06-10 09:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136232002', 'Concepcion DeLeo', NULL, '6/10/24: Denise and Concepcion called very frustrated and nervous about Concepcion''s medical issues and Zion not issuing funds yet. Last time I spoke to Denise, Zion stated that the issue was shareable with a cap until pre-ex was ruled out. 
Denise stated that Zion is now saying her daughter had a lapse in coverage and they don''t know if they will pay anything - but that she spoke to Patti and resolved the issue over the phone with Zion. 
She also said that Zion is coming back asking her for documents that she''s already sent several times, and that she still owes on her IUA even though Denise says she''s put thousands on her CC and submitted all the info. 
I reiterated that right now, the issue is the lapse of coverage questions to which Denise replied - yes.
I asked Denise to let me speak to Patti about this and give her a call back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 09:55:18', '2024-06-10 09:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140492002', 'Christopher Hawkins', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure w/RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-10 07:57:22', '2024-06-10 07:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140510013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '6/10/24: Bradon filled out a contact form on website. Called to offer assistance - LVM. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 07:44:43', '2024-06-10 07:44:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140510008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618002', 'McKinley Frazier', NULL, '6/10/24: McKinley called. She submitted a sharing request, and has paid over her IUA. She said it was determined shareable after IUA is met. I informed her that I personally couldn''t see into her account with Zion and connected her to Z sharing department. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 07:31:33', '2024-06-10 07:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140510003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098386002', 'Maria Merrifield', NULL, '6/10/24: Maria''s husband Jeffrey called, wondering why he got a welcome letter when he isn''t on the plan. Turns out, their son signed up who has the same name as Jeffrey. 
They also wanted to double check if the facility that Maria has her Colonoscopy scheduled is within network. I didn''t see it listed on Multiplan and suggested they call and verify prior to going in - also gave them info about how Planstin will pay out of network. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-10 07:25:25', '2024-06-10 07:25:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140473088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '6-9-24 Mary asked about a past kidney stone issue years ago that she did a repeat cat scan to check on more recently. I suggested she check her records and make sure there''s nothing alarming on there or get a clean bill of health. Daugther uses IUD for heavy periods and will likely just keep it for 5 years. She has her own DPC practice. She read the Sharing Guidelines and wants to make sure there''s no conflict of interest if they use the other doctor in the practice for their needs. I will ask Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-09 23:20:08', '2024-06-09 23:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140473068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140470020', 'Nikki Alber', NULL, '5-28-24 Nikki Alber is Marc Alber''s wife and came to me via Mindy Grabau. Jo at front desk reached out as well for assistance. They are paying about $2800 a month for Alber''s family of 4 and Jo.  Their ded is $2500 and $10K mop.  They are with UHC who constantly denies them of the benefits they believe they deserve. Nikki and daughter Sloan both need regular ins. Nikki is battling some type of cancer that moved to her lungs and needs to keep all of her drs. Daughter blew out her ACL last year and had 2 eye surgeries.  Dr. Alber and son Nash are super healthy, never take meds and never sick. Nikki DOB 8/3/72, Marc 9/26/71, daughter Sloan 9/5/02 and son Nash 7/19/06. Jo is 5/7/71 (?). Nikki needs Dr. Daniel Bowles oncologist and Dr. Brian Haugen. I proposed putting Nikki, Sloan and Jo on reg ins. through C4 and March and Nash on MCS for a July 1st start date. Some other agent was able to get them onto a June 1st start date for both. So, they wound up cutting me out since whoever they chose is likely going direct to Zion for June 1st. So brutal! Nikki left me a nice and appreciative vm. I don''t think there''s anything more I can do on this case.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-09 22:48:45', '2024-06-09 22:48:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140473063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140468002', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, '6-7-24 Leanne had a terrible experience with her new regular insurance in finding a doctor who would accept the network for her wellness visit. She was adamant wanting her old membership with the PHCS network and not HAB. She didn''t want to pay cash and wait for reimbursement. I warned her that she must be her own advocate and make certain her Dr. codes all aspects of the visit as wellness/preventative, especially for a colonoscopy. I explained the tricks they play sometimes and to ask many questions in advance.  She has done her colonoscopy a think perhaps 2 years ago and is on the 5 year track for getting it again. She''s super healthy, has her yoga certification, pilates certification, no smoking, no pre-x.  I also explained mammo''s are every other year now. She is 57, so Premium HSA makes the most sense. She wasn''t really thrilled with Zion. So, a change to Premium HSA is good And it brings down her cost from previously $375 to $346.  She cancelled for recently bc her price went from $275 to $375 until she experienced more challenges with her new plan. So, having the PHCS network again and a new sharing company with a cheaper monthly membership made her happier. She will have a July 1st start date. 
I also changed her address immediately in Admin123 and Zoho upon enrollment since the address she entered doesn''t receive mail. I changed it to her PO Box. Physical address is 1063 N Boulder Dr. Carefree, AZ 85377,', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-06-09 22:35:29', '2024-06-09 22:35:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140477050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109369002', 'Milen Yankov', NULL, '06.07.2024 Milen called to cancel his membership, he is now receiving benefits through his new job. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-07 17:10:14', '2024-06-07 17:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140477042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131706010', 'Sarah Larsen', NULL, '06.07.2024 Integration file and results. Andrew and Sarah still prefer to get the reimbursement for the two  months their file was not integrated. 
I shared the results with them but they wanted me to give our admins another try to see, if Zion would offer the reimbursement, given that the glitch was at their end. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-07 16:15:09', '2024-06-07 17:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140477037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, '06.07.2024 Paul called to better understand how to maneuver a prev physical annual, and getting the shingles vaccines. I explained both are covered under the ACA guidelines and went over the detailed steps on presenting and all the do''s and don''ts at the appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-07 15:08:09', '2024-06-07 15:08:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140477026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103277001', 'Kim Robinson', NULL, '6/7/24: Kim called asking if it''s ok if her doctor has "his people" do a urine culture for a UTI. I informed her that anything related to a specific need is self-pay until you reach your 1000 IUA and there are no network restrictions. I then advised her to use her telehealth service first as they commonly help individuals with UTI''s and if she doesn''t get the help she needs from that, then schedule an appt with her provider. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-07 14:24:40', '2024-06-07 14:24:40'),
