  ('zcrm_1579374000140477003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138945001', 'Josh Roseman', NULL, '06.07.2024 Josh called to share they have not received any of the welcome calls, aside from MPB. I right away put in a support ticket to manually integrate this membership. He also shared he could not register for CirrusMD, so I put in a ticket to their support group. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-07 11:40:45', '2024-06-07 15:03:43'),
