  ('zcrm_1579374000140449019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095838002', 'Sue Wilder', NULL, '6-7-2024:
KB 6-7-24 $1K-IUA currently.  If convert to new Secure HSA, mo will be $416.20. Or stay with Planstin  and will become $385/mo', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-07 09:51:39', '2024-06-07 09:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140449014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115979002', 'Tony Hugar', NULL, '6-7-2024:
- Notes for Kirk to share with Tony & Robin on next call at 10:30 pacific: First, the docs listed on the Multiplan site will absolutely work with Planstin for payment of the services given; that''s why they are part of the Multiplan network in the first place,.

 But... docs change their status frequently and don''t update the network... so we recommend a call to the doc''s office...and the person at the doctor''s office may not be familiar with Planstin so it''s easy for them to say no. It''s how you ask for the service....you can say: "This is a self funded group plan which is contracted with the PHCS network, part of MultiPlan.  I''ve checked and Dr. (name of doctor or facility) is listed in the network. Will you please call and verify my eligibility?" 888-920-7526." This above approach works per Angee.

Next: Planstin is going to increase your rate to $950 effective 11/1 and they will want you to do the re-enrollment online...it''s cumbersome.

 As an option, we can drop the preventive care piece altogether for you and keep the Zion part...it''s called Care+ and the monthly is $875...it can be effective on 7/1 w/ a simple change form.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-07 09:50:02', '2024-06-07 11:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140433018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087126001', 'Kevin Coan', NULL, 'atap ob call, lvm', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-07 09:49:52', '2024-06-07 09:49:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', NULL, 'Member called in asking about how to add back 2 of her children to the membership.  I will send her out the link to the Member Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 09:34:23', '2024-06-07 09:34:23'),
