  ('zcrm_1579374000140408043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491034', 'Michael Couch', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  Due to his company having their Open Enrollment.  I told him that I would send out link and that he should be in touch with Whitney.  He questioned this.  I advised that she was the one that enrolled him and that she should be notified that he will be cancelling.  I will send out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 09:20:03', '2024-06-07 09:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140433013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, 'reached out and lvm on what seemed to be aimees vm and explained the atap and left my direct line and sent additional email', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-07 09:10:44', '2024-06-07 09:10:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140423019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612009', 'Annette Mosbarger', NULL, '6/7/24: Annette called to get a script refilled. I advised to either use her telehealth services or contact her pcp to first write the script and send to her preferred pharmacy and then afterwards she can request a quote from the concierge using Pres. Quote Request form - guided her on how to find that on website. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-07 09:08:11', '2024-06-07 09:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140450018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137735002', 'Jeffrey Danos', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-06-07 09:06:04', '2024-06-07 09:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114144002', 'Jan Carteaux', 'New Membership eff 7/24', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 08:53:57', '2024-06-07 08:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114144002', 'Jan Carteaux', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to remove MEC eff 7/1/24.  As she now has "Essential Benefits" thru her employer.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 08:51:13', '2024-06-07 08:51:13'),
