  ('zcrm_1579374000140449003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115979002', 'Tony Hugar', NULL, '6-7-2024 CAlled re ATAP.  Tony  doesn''t turn 65 until 2025. There has been some pre-ex so they need to stay with Zion. VERY unhappy with  the preventive care aspect of  the membership...cannot find a local doc for their son (21) in Nashville TN (away at school)...Used the PHCS network, very frustrated... threatening to leave us. I''m involving Angee to asssit.
Note, if they remain w/Planstin, monthly will go up to $950....if they drop the MEC and go to Care+ only, it will cost them $875/mo.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-07 08:45:27', '2024-06-07 09:10:17'),
