  ('zcrm_1579374000140408018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, 'Per Nahla''s request I will email a digital version of his RCI card and order new hard card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 08:01:36', '2024-06-07 08:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140423008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089138002', 'Karen Jones', NULL, '6/7/24: Karen called to request a new MPB card bc she had misplaced hers. Reached out to Kelly to send her a new copy and let member know to give it a couple weeks to arrive in the mail. Sent a followup email:
"I''m writing to let you know that your new MPB card is currently being processed and will be mailed to your address promptly. You can expect to receive it within 14 business days. 
Unfortunately, I was informed that we do not send these cards out digitally. 
 If you have any further questions or need additional assistance, please feel free to reach out."
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-07 07:59:04', '2024-06-07 08:29:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136920002', 'Ryan Quarles', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 7/24.  This member was on 2 months and was set to age up on 7/1.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 07:52:03', '2024-06-07 07:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140423003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139432012', 'Kayla Farrell', NULL, '6/7/24: Kayla called back in stating she still has not received any emails from Zion, and cannot get into her CirrusMD account. I explained that while she is definitely in the Zion system, they usually send out onboarding emails on a certain day of the week, but we can get them on the phone and request they manually send yours now. Grace from Z sent Kayla all of her info while we were on the phone. 
I sent CirrusMD a support ticket to get Kayla manually entered into their system and advised her to give it a couple of hours but they are usually very fast. I asked if there was anything else she was having registration issues with but that seemed to be all. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-07 07:45:48', '2024-06-07 07:45:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126956011', 'Richele Henry', NULL, 'Received Cancellation Request from this member eff 6/30/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 07:31:33', '2024-06-07 07:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140408003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114237001', 'Adrian Ashby', NULL, 'Member''s sp left vm wanting to know how to cancel her membership as she was getting employer benefits.  I sent out link and copied advisor.  Will reach out to member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-07 07:08:39', '2024-06-07 07:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140392111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139268002', 'Donna Trocino', NULL, '06.06.2024 Donna called to get help to book her welcome call. I sent her the scheduling link, and I booked her a spot on Vanessa''s calendar. I messaged Vanessa to make sure she can see the booking and to make sure it is showing for 06.11.2024 @ 9:30MT. 
Donna also wanted help in registering with CirrusMD, I attempted to send her an invitation link, but it did not recognize her account. I sent in a ticket to CirrusMD and told her to look for an email from them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-06 18:01:45', '2024-06-06 18:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140392101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131706010', 'Sarah Larsen', NULL, '06.06.2024 Angee informed me that Andrew is waiting on my call back to him. Since it''s a billing issue, it does not seem like the same issue we dealt with regarding their integration file issue for 3 months.
I called Andrew back, but got his VM. I left him a VM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-06 16:57:08', '2024-06-06 16:57:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140392093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121824002', 'Meghan Nyswaner', NULL, '06.06.2024 Uploaded receipt of $2500 onto the sharing request. Still waiting on the Sharing Request to move from Pending. That $2500 receipt was uploaded back on the 8th of May. 
We did a 3-way call with Zion and spoke with Illana, who explained to Meghan that she needs to attain an itemized bill for that $2500 to show the connection to the hospital''s payment. Meghan will reconnect with the children''s hospital and ask them for it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-06 16:43:23', '2024-06-06 16:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140392077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, '06.06.2024 Benjamin needed a refresher on a lot of their services in their membership. I resent him the welcome call schedule link via CRM. I also forwarded via outlook, the detailed steps and codes for:
HCBB & Healthgrades
PHCS & Multiplan link & Healthcare.GOV
MAP directions and access. 
*****************************************************************************
Ben and Heidi called back to better understand Zion''s portal and if they can open a separate one for Heidi.
Heidi resent a welcome email, but it was not going through. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-06 15:43:46', '2024-06-06 16:22:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140392072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '06.06.2024 Matthew called in hopes to attain an RCI card, as he was on his way to the doctor''s appointment. At first I thought he might be planstin, so I told him that they can send him a virtual one. Then after confirming his profile, I learned he is RCI, and RCI had been closed at that point for 15 minutes already.
I tried Patti via Teams Chat - but she was gone for the day.
I told Matthew that his best bet is to reschedule the appointment till he gets his card, or present cash pay and TRY (RCI understanding the situation) to get reimbursed by RCI. At the beginning of the conversation, I did iterate that RCI is not big on reimbursements. They just don''t do them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-06 14:59:12', '2024-06-06 14:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140401103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126956011', 'Richele Henry', NULL, 'mbr choosing to go with zion essentials, was not interested in the care plus', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-06 14:40:28', '2024-06-06 14:40:28'),
