  ('zcrm_1579374000140392064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '6/6/24: Risa called saying her provider has never heard of planstin. I explained that she can tell the provider that her MEC is an ACA mandated plan and is part of the PHCS network which is part of multiplan. I gave her instructions on how to search the network and information about RBP pricing just in case the provider is not contracted within that network. AM

Risa called right back saying the provider stated they are not in network and will not bill. I explained that unfortunately the docs office will need to bill them. Planstin doesn''t do reimbursement, and suggested that the provider try calling planstin, the number on her card for reassurance. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-06 14:34:38', '2024-06-06 14:44:03'),
