  ('zcrm_1579374000140391008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.06.24:  Jenni called me. Hadn''t read my text and asked about scheduling a call with Josh and Sam to discuss plan options for them.  I told her I texted her back to ask if they wanted to speak to me together or separately. Jenni said she''d ask them when they would be available next week and get back to me.  I also informed Jenni we have new plan options which she will need to discuss w/me soon, as she''ll  need to make a decision w/Planstin''s MEC.  She, again, asked about all of them taking Secure and I reminded her of the employer group approach, since they all work for her company.  Jenni said she''ll give me 2 dates and times for next week to choose from to speak with Josh and Sam.  I told her she could join us if she''d like and I would explain the features of each plan to them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-06-06 08:52:19', '2024-06-06 08:52:19'),
