  ('zcrm_1579374000140381027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108041001', 'Frederick Schilling', 'NEEDS TO SEE an Orthopedic TO solidify the Sharing Request!', '06.05.2024 Frederick called to learn how to proceed in sharing the xrays the DOC is recommending to have to learn from the ski accident from february/early march has caused, and to make sure it is not the hip. I walked him through opening a sharing request with Zion, and he will call them tomorrow to request the invitation link to open a portal with them. 
