  ('zcrm_1579374000140381022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '06.05.2024 After learning about the following today, all together:
1-John Donovan put in his cancellation with MPB due to the above reasons.
2-Through Joan and Sherry from M&S, learned that after many hoops and major policy accommodations, Sherry persuaded Dr. Lydia Glass to sign up with the Mazzitti & Sullivan organization (minimized MOST of the paperwork.
3-They are paying Dr. Lydia Glass an exorbitant fee, over $200/hour, to accommodate John''s mental wellness.
4-Aside from the first session he had with Dr. Glass, he is accommodated another 5 (total of 6) sessions till the end of June, 2024.

I emailed him the above information for his records and ability to take advantage of the offer/accommodation prior to the end of the month. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-05 16:55:00', '2024-06-05 16:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140381008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128581003', 'Ian Leventhal', NULL, '06.05.2024 Prior to calling Ian today, I contacted Melissa Blatt, his advisor (& close friend), to briefly discuss our plan of action, including our recommendation to have him change plans to the Essentials, in order to be qualified for the debt dismissal program. Melissa was just about to hop onto a zoom call, so I quickly shared with and she strongly agreed.
I called Ian, we chatted a bit and I gave him the action plan in mind, and what responsibilities he has to make it happen and move it forward.
1- 3-way call with Zion to learn what terminology THEY are fixated on to determine the results.
     * Called spoke with Cassidy who reiterated the determination again, and recommended we leave Bethany another VM to call Ian back, regarding the second appeal, and for Ian to verbalize his clarification and opposition to their determination. Ian did that, left Bethany a VM. 
We hung up to let go of Zion''s line. I called him back.
2- We talked some more about the situation. Ian is extremely worried about his financial situation and not being able to resolve this if he cancelled NOW. I explained that b/c his sharing request was opened prior to cancellation, they will help resolve the issue after the cancellation.
3- We talked about changing plans to purely the Essentials, member only, to lower the premium, in order to qualify for the Debt Dismissal Program. 
4- Ian will call his provider RIGHT NOW, after we hang up, to connect with them and request from the provider verbiage that negates the determination, base on his/her medical expertise and skills and knowledge. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-05 16:26:00', '2024-06-05 16:41:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140381003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128581003', 'Ian Leventhal', NULL, '06.04.2024 Learned that Ian''s sharing request was denied yet again, under the notion it being a preX. Collaborated with Angee via Teams to conjure up the best course of action before contacting him. 
We decided to contact him to set up a time to do a 3-way call with Zion to better understand what they are basing their determination on, learn where their angle is at, and help him consider changing plans to purely Essentials to be qualified to apply for the Dept Dismissal Program. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-05 16:25:24', '2024-06-05 16:27:01'),
