  ('zcrm_1579374000140321055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111990002', 'John Hill', NULL, '6/5/24: Mary called. Her son is wanting to get back on his attention medication and she''s asking how to go about that. I advised to try telehealth first - since he''s been on it for a long time, they may prescribe - however if not, then he''d have to schedule an appt with his previous dr and it is self-pay. His options with MPB are using therapists and counselors but they are mostly talk therapy. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-05 13:17:25', '2024-06-05 13:17:25'),
