  ('zcrm_1579374000140304028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919471', 'Tad Jakes', NULL, '6/5 reached out to mbr to wish them happy birthday, lvm and offer referral.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-05 08:21:47', '2024-06-05 08:21:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140324003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030491006', 'Trent Buttars', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to add dependents back to plan eff 8/1.  Come to find out that he just wanted a quote to see how much it would be.  After processing the Change I reversed this with RCI &amp; Sedera and advised Member to be in contact with his advisor for quotes, that the Change request was only for changes to be processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-05 08:17:45', '2024-06-05 08:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140321008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128686021', 'Toni Denise Boucher', NULL, '6/5/24: Toni reached out via email asking how to add her 14 year old son to her plan. I emailed her instructions and the membership form link over to her and reaching out with a call to make sure she received the info. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-05 08:01:09', '2024-06-05 08:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135605001', 'Olena Gorodisskiy', NULL, '6/4/24: Olena called, she has a pain in her rib cage and asking best course of action. I advised to start with her telehealth service as they can recommend what she do next depending on her symptoms. We discussed presenting as self pay for specialist and why there are co-pays listed on planstin card. I also said she can call us back if she does need to find a specialist in her area. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-04 15:27:58', '2024-06-04 15:27:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140304023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125995002', 'Mel Fonseca', NULL, 'reached out to him to let him know we are cancelling his plan but wanted to know if we could have done anything better, mentioned he had some issues with one if his providers but that he was wanting to switch over to the dpc program and may call back here next week to compelte enrollment.', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-04 14:58:33', '2024-06-04 14:58:33'),
