  ('zcrm_1579374000140261008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131624027', 'Lilian Borges', NULL, '6/4/24: Lilian called asking how to go about getting discount labs. I checked her zip in a few sites and gave her instructions along with emailed list of sites and how to use them. Advised her to give us a call back one she begins the process if she needs us to walk her through using the site. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-04 12:41:09', '2024-06-04 12:41:09'),
