  ('zcrm_1579374000140248050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138936002', 'Chantal Watson-Lewenkamp', NULL, '06.04.2024 Called Chantal to perform to welcome call, but it went straight to VM. I left her a message. Resent the scheduling link via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-04 11:01:10', '2024-06-04 11:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763142', 'Leanne Wagner', NULL, '6/4/24: Leanne called very frustrated with the new plan she purchased bc after moving, she cannot find a provider anywhere. She asked what the timeline would be like if she re-enrolled in her previous plan. I advised her to speak to her advisor, Wendy about that as I am more familiar with the elements of her plan but not the enrollment process. I gave her Wendy''s phone and email address. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-04 10:55:02', '2024-06-04 10:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140248034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '6.04.2024 Sarah called needing assistance with her sharing request with Zion. I gave her their number and transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-04 10:48:52', '2024-06-04 10:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085342002', 'Michael Meuth', NULL, '6/4/25: Michael called. His wife is having cancer treatments and wanted to know how to go about using health share. I advised to pay his IUA of 2500 and submit remaining bills as a sharing request to Zion Member Portal. Trans to Zion to register for portal. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-04 10:30:01', '2024-06-04 10:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120108002', 'Penny Fallon', NULL, '6/4/24: Penny called to ask about Humira quote request. She''s taking part in a drug study so another party will be paying for the medication, but they are needing information about her prescription insurance. I advised to use the bin numbers on her planstin card as that''s the only "coverage" for medication she has but it will not pay for this since it''s not a preventive drug. I informed her I was still waiting on a quote from our international shopper and will email her once I hear back. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-04 10:28:31', '2024-06-04 10:28:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140248021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755369', 'Rachel Allen', NULL, '06.04.2024 Missed a call from Rachel today. Called back at 706-490-7188, left a VM. 

Rachel called back. I gave her the info on nominating the provider and the RBP option if she needs. I also sent her the PHCS multiplan link with resources. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-04 10:22:55', '2024-06-04 10:55:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140248008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '06.04.2024 Welcome call attempted TODAY at 11 on 970-403-3714. No answer. VM not set up. Did not leave a VM. Resent scheduling link to reschedule. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-04 10:02:25', '2024-06-04 10:05:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140248003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043462286', 'Bryan Baker', NULL, '06.04.2024 Received a message Bryan needs his cards, Planstin, to use for a dermatology appt. I called Planstin to get his cards overs to him. I called him to explain how he won''t be using his Planstin cards for that appointment and guided him on how to present. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-04 09:56:58', '2024-06-04 09:56:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140190070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132122001', 'Margo Kakoullis', NULL, 'Margo was presented with a bill for $1039.50, she is asking for MPB to provide payment for the balance since she was not properly explained the plan''s limitations by her advisor. Emailed Ashlee at Planstin to provide confirmation that MPB members receive EOB in addition to their Planstin Card. Additionally, notified Karen of the situation, and asked her to speak to her member in an attempt to salvage their relationship before responding to Margo''s request.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-06-04 08:10:28', '2024-06-04 08:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140190065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110878002', 'Kenneth Huffman Jr', 'New Membership eff 7/24', 'Member Only $1000 Secure w/RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-04 07:53:55', '2024-06-04 07:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140190060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110878002', 'Kenneth Huffman Jr', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address, remove spouse &amp; Change MEC to RCI.  I will process eff 7/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-04 07:52:44', '2024-06-04 07:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140190055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126761002', 'Jonathan Figg', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-04 07:36:46', '2024-06-04 07:36:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125995002', 'Mel Fonseca', NULL, '06.03.2024 Mel called to learn how to cancel him membership with MPB. At first I discussed  the preferred MPB process, then he said he is his own advisor, so I just led him to the form on the website. I offered him the process that a member can go through independently to empower him. He asked more clarifying questions about membership cancellations. Mel was very nice and complimentary to my services with MPB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 16:42:50', '2024-06-03 16:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134448007', 'Robert Ridpath', NULL, '6/3/24: Rob called. His wife is having issues getting the provider to accept their Planstin MEC. The provider is wary and believes that Planstin is a scam even though they are listed as being in the PHCS network. Rob says his wife really likes her doctor and doesn''t want to switch - is there anything they can do to put the provider''s office at ease? I gave Rob some verbage to use when speaking to the billing department and suggested he call Planstin directly and see if they can 3 way the provider. He''s going to try that before attempting to find another provider. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 15:04:07', '2024-06-03 15:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140190039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159002', 'Daniel Cody', NULL, '6-3-2024 ATAP. See email to Daniel below. We need to share the new MEC provider with him.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-06-03 14:48:27', '2024-06-03 14:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '6/3/24: Linda called - Shane is having carpel tunnel surgery in October and wondering how to go about submitting the bills. I advised that she would collect all the info she can and open a sharing request through Zion, submitting doctor bills so far along with the estimated costs of the surgery. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 14:19:48', '2024-06-03 14:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140230013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, 'Reached out to mbr to do cancellation call, lvm and offered referral. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-03 14:02:56', '2024-06-03 14:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140230008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', NULL, '6/3/24: Connected with member who had mentioned that he had been a part of Sederas heath share at one point in the past but wasn''t a fan. Has a couple of pre existing conditions that he doesn''t want to begin a new lookback period for, choose to re-enroll planstin. - WU', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-06-03 13:59:32', '2024-06-03 13:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure w/ RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 13:51:27', '2024-06-03 13:51:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140113002', 'Megan Grabau', NULL, '06.03.2024 Sent Megan the scheduling link for the welcome call, via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 13:32:50', '2024-06-03 13:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Request to drop the Planstin MEC to the RCI MEC eff 7/1/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 13:30:57', '2024-06-03 13:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', NULL, '06.03.2024 Steve called in response to Will''s call to him. He missed it and wanted to reschedule it but did not know how. I checked with Will via teams chat, thankfully he was available, I transferred Steve to Will. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 13:16:58', '2024-06-03 13:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member &amp; Ch $1500 IUA Self Directed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 12:46:25', '2024-06-03 12:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115982002', 'Timothy Cornely', NULL, '06.03.2024 Tracey called to better learn about sharing requests.  She was diagnosed with Hyperhydrosis not even a month ago (oversweating...etc). She''s had several services that are adding up, including a very expensive medication, with limited effectiveness then different treatment is in order. Up till now, she''s paid over $1000 in labs and tests, and is currently half way there on fulfilling the IUA.
I encouraged her to open a sharing request with Zion and upload all of her documents there. This way it will give zion a chance to accept and share it, or deny and explain why. 
I transferred her over to Zion, after I coached her on what to press and say. 
Tracey ended up calling back shortly afterwards, due to having technical issues with accessing the portal she just registered for, including accepting the brand new passcode, or allowing her to change it. I transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 12:46:00', '2024-06-03 14:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request to Remove MEC from membership eff 6/30/24 going to Self Directed.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 12:44:40', '2024-06-03 12:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132131011', 'Paul Mergener', NULL, '06.03.2024 Tara called to better learn how to get shared on her chiro and acupuncture visits. After a lengthy conversation about lowering the IUA, I learned that it is a pre-x condition. So I guided her to maybe not lower the IUA NOW, give they will not share anything for a pre-X in the first year of membership. She will hold off till end of the year to change her IUA. We did talk about how there could be situations that are not pre-x, and she might consider lowering it anyways. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 12:43:01', '2024-06-03 14:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110365002', 'Richard Webster', NULL, '06.03.2024 Richard preventive or diagnostic? I guided him through how to identify a situation as preventive vs diagnostic. We talked about the language to use when at a prev appt, the healthcare.GOV site and how to proceed for either nature of appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 12:30:45', '2024-06-03 14:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118041001', 'Simon Buchard', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 12:24:58', '2024-06-03 12:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118041001', 'Simon Buchard', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to drop MEC membership eff 7/1/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 12:23:45', '2024-06-03 12:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', 'New Membership eff 7/1/24', 'Member Only $1000 IUA CareZ', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 12:21:37', '2024-06-03 12:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130141011', 'Julie Chatham', NULL, '06.03.2024 VM - Sent her a CirrusMD registration link, learned she is already registered. I sent her an email explaining both of the above, and guided her to reset her passcode. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 12:19:16', '2024-06-03 14:52:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '6/3/24: Brittany called stating her provider is not in the PHCS network. When I performed another search to give her options, she did NOT want to go to any of them because it''s out of the way and/or not affiliated with the hospital she likes. I explained Planstin''s RBP pricing model and advised her to call the provider and ask if they would be willing to bill planstin directly bc they do not do reimbursements, but will pay out of network. I said start there, if the provider is not willing to do that then it is what it is, and you''ll have to choose another place to go if you''d like planstin to pay for the well-woman visit and mammogram. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 12:18:49', '2024-06-03 12:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, 'Member submitted Change to Remove Spouse &amp; all dependents &amp; drop the Planstin MEC eff 7/1/24.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 11:49:51', '2024-06-03 11:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '06.03.2024 Tal called to better understand how to proceed with the expenses he''s been getting towards a heart condition he''s had since he was a kid, he said.
He shared all the services he''s had so far, equipment, referrals and future testing/procedures.
We concluded that he needs to open a medical need to get started on getting shared, and that Zion might determine this a pre-membership condition. We went over what the sharing max would be, and his options for how to open a sharing request, since he ALREADY has a portal with Zion. 
Tal said he will open the sharing request at his own leisure, since he''s about to enter a meeting. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-06-03 11:46:56', '2024-06-03 11:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126761002', 'Jonathan Figg', NULL, 'Member called in and requested to update Pmt info.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 11:36:18', '2024-06-03 11:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095157002', 'David Stout', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Request to add newborn Tessa to membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 11:29:16', '2024-06-03 11:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089150002', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, '6/3/24: Joseph called. He stated that he received a letter from Planstin saying that since he has 1 or more dependents over the age of 18, they would need to create their own accounts. He called planstin and they told him he needed to call MPB. When I spoke to Carmen at Planstin, she said there are no notes under his name and she confirmed that it must have been a mistake bc dependents don''t need a seperate profile account or healthcare plan until the age of 26. I called Joseph back and let him know that he can disregard the letter. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 11:29:01', '2024-06-03 11:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '6/3/24: Ruth called. Her husband had 2 ER visits over the weekend and wanted to know next steps. We discussed her IUA, 6 month deadline, setting up Zion member portal, and submitting itemized bills. Trans to Zion to get started after our conversation. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 10:23:21', '2024-06-03 10:23:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140176023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140157002', 'Joy Garvey', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA w/RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 09:59:27', '2024-06-03 09:59:27'),
