  ('zcrm_1579374000140202003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137631002', 'Remso Martinez', NULL, 'Re-sent Remso''s fulfillment package as it was sent back saying "Insufficient address". I found in the past most times this happens, their address in the CRM is missing a suite or apartment #, which I always find it in Admin123. It seems to not get copied over. So, this was the case, an Apt. # was missing. I added it here in the CRM and sent out their fulfillment package. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-06-03 09:29:08', '2024-06-03 09:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138574002', 'Tammy Basile', NULL, '6/3/24: Tammy filled out the contact form on website with no message. Gave her a call to see if she had any questions - Left a VM to give us a call back if she does. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 09:02:48', '2024-06-03 09:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update Form I will process. Member emailed me wanting to change Pmt info back to original.  I will change', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-06-03 07:29:40', '2024-06-03 07:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140174003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081595012', 'Aron Groner', NULL, '6/3/24: Aron called. His daughter Naava has a tick bite and they wanted to access telehealth. I gave Aron the web address to access it and advised that since she is over 18, Naava will need to create her own account with a unique email address. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-06-03 07:26:11', '2024-06-03 07:26:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140144013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, '5-31-24 I left a vm on his phone 240 # and I spoke with Jamie at the 301 #. She is sending him a note about updating his payment quickly to avoid cancellation. Sending him an email as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-31 18:11:45', '2024-05-31 18:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140148028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357046', 'Nicole Lubeck', NULL, '05.31.2024 Nicole called attempting to speak to her Zion''s Sharing Request processor, Sandy. I explained she reached the wrong #, who we are and transferred her to Zion, after I gave her their number and told her they are closed for the weekend. She may have been able to leave a message. If not, she will call them on Monday. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-31 16:37:00', '2024-05-31 16:37:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140148008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850008', 'Melissa Mangum', NULL, '05.31.2024 Completing Melissa''s RX Request:
