  ('zcrm_1579374000140148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605321', 'Robin Cressy', NULL, '05.31.2024 Robin called to request another fulfillment package to attain the MPB card and more. I mentioned the other items he should register for: HCBB, MAP and CirrusMD. I sent all three of those instructions via CRM. I transferred him over to Zion to request a new welcome email, and request the invitation link to open a portal with them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-31 16:00:50', '2024-05-31 16:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '5-31-24 I called Julia back about her balance bill of $60 for mammo. She''s already talking with Planstin and knows what to do to stop this balance bill which isn''t allowed. She''s all set for now and happy for the call back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-31 15:06:23', '2024-05-31 15:06:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140138008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128559002', 'John Senini III', NULL, '5/31/24: John called confused about what card to present to doctor. I educated him on his MEC and using Zion healthshare. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-31 14:49:01', '2024-05-31 14:49:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140144003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108597002', 'Scott Bearon', NULL, 'Reached out to mbr to go over his options, not many options for savings given the mbrs preference for needing his hsa', 'Willis Upton', 'Willis Upton', '2024-05-31 14:48:27', '2024-05-31 14:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140138003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '5/31/24: Cheryl called to update her payment info. I directed her to form on website. Also asked if we were connected to EAP - I offered to transfer her to MAP and did so. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-31 14:08:21', '2024-05-31 14:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140124003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140113002', 'Megan Grabau', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-31 13:54:30', '2024-05-31 13:54:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140099018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140470082', 'Sam Wyman', NULL, '5-31-24 He texted me and said he chose something else sadly...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-31 13:01:20', '2024-05-31 13:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140099013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140113002', 'Megan Grabau', NULL, '5-31-24 Megan turned 26 in May and just finally was ready to go for a new membership for July 1st. So, since she has a lapse in benefits, it saves her a tiny bit of money to go with Premium Care for $237/$1000 vs CARE+ at $240/$1000. So, she chose Premium Care and no wellness. She has a thyroid issue that she runs traditional labs for at Helios Medical. I priced out a thyroid panel with TSH and she can get it for $22.96 via Lab Assist!  She didn''t know what panel her dr uses. But, it usually costs her $500. She''s happy to use the MPB Concierge for labs and meds. Her Armour Thyroid costs her about $100 every 3 months. GoodRX was $90 for 3 months at 30 mg. PharmacyChecker shows $63.74 for 100 tablets! She can get those affordably as well. It may be even better through WorldMedRX.  She joined for July 1st. She didn''t need the wellness benefit since she''s young and won''t use most of the $4500 for wellness, or mental healthy, or nutritional health or vision. Not worth the extra money for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-31 12:59:45', '2024-05-31 12:59:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140106008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', NULL, '05.31.2024 Steve called and was a little concerned about the email and VM he received from William (above).  I told him that I do see the notes regarding this and if he would like me to transfer him. He said he''s just going to get his VM, which I did not understand what that meant. I''m sure if Will was available, he would speak to a member. 
Steve proceeded to let me know he clicked on the link in the email, saying it was weird and sharing that it looks like the prices are going up and confused that he would be saving money (quoting). Then asked me what would happen if he did not go through the transition, do WE cancel him. I told him, based on previous situations like this, if the transition did not complete the membership does cancel. but towards the end of my statement (was still talking...) it hung up. I do not know if it was him hanging up or a technical issue. I will give it time to call back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-31 12:11:54', '2024-05-31 12:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140106003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130043002', 'Jonathon Waunch', NULL, '05.31.2024 Jonathon and talked about the details of his wife''s visit, what the provider''s bill says, and the ACA guidelines. We were confused about what the write off part of the EOB is from the provider (~$400) and about the out of age range part that was mentioned twice.
We called Planstin as a 3-way, and spoke with Seleste. She was graciously helpful in trying to break down the terminology for Jonathon...', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-05-31 11:47:20', '2024-05-31 11:47:20'),
