  ('zcrm_1579374000140089003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137621001', 'Phillip Patterson', NULL, '5/31/24: Terri Called with 4 questions:
1. Terri a pap May 1, before getting cards from planstin. Planstin advised her to go to appointment and send in the claim and they would send her a check. The bill was coded incorrectly. I advised to have provider re-code the bill and either 1)have them submit to planstin and reimburse you OR 2)you can send to claims department, **but best case scenario is that it is billed from provider. 
2. How can we access discount labs? I explained that we use a collection of sites to help with prices of labs, they partner with Labcorp and Quest. I gave a brief overview of how the process worked and advised her to call us once she has a list of labs that she needs and we can walk her through the process. 
3. Husband has back issues and receives chiropractic care. How to get discounts on that? I explained that while we don''t offer the sevice discounts any longer, if the alternative care is related to a sharing request then it could be eligible for sharing. 
4. Terri is 100% deaf and works with a vocational rehab for hearing devices. How will that work with this plan? I let her know that audiological treatment is shareable according to Zion''s guidelines BUT they will look at everything as if it is a pre-existing condition so there would be a phase in period to having these treatments and devices shared by the community. 
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-05-31 08:37:31', '2024-05-31 08:37:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140085003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114148002', 'Danielle Carnett', NULL, 'Member left VM requesting to change her payment method.  I will send out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-05-31 07:09:02', '2024-05-31 07:09:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000140080093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, '5-30-24 Hello Raeanna,

